<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">-Yemsa New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Wosini meya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Wosini meeni matsafa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Wosini meeni wosto</para>
  <para style="toc3">Wos.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Wosini Meeni Wosto</para>
  <para style="imt1">Gachgiru</para>
  <para style="ip">Wosini meeni wostoos Luqasni misirachchuni kaamaasi tusu. Matsafaasi arki chowa tesuni Yesus Kiristoosneen ane hama asuni meya Korto Ayyanak zoonustesere basa chowaasik makefa misirachchuni kaamaason Yerusalemuk, Yuudani daa zuuttambaase asiissi, Samariyak, hamma daani dilta kar'ananneen (1:8) aakkak zi'sisetematotu makefa. Matsafaas Kiristinnani amantoos Ayhudni meeni ganeyaassi jammartera daasta fe asu zuuttambaase asi amanto sinana kabaneen aakkak zi'inamatotu tochoyefa. Tichi bar Kiristanani meya Roomni taate meeni taatoos shorkuk sire sire jallisuk kabsefe asuni meya sina beyobesiisonnawa Kiristinnani haymanotiis Ayhudni meeni haymanotiison tuununir sinnamato besuk chima kabo kabe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wosini meeni wostoos; Yesusni chowaasik makefanaas misirachchuni kaamaas kar'na dima wonna wonna tagit hambaasonnawa betekiristanini kaputtooson besifa keez arto arto dimta maddabtok chimana.</para>
  <para style="ili">1. Kiristinnani haymanotiis Yesusni sama hamaasneen orfo Yerusalemuk jammartobaas;</para>
  <para style="ili">2. Israelni daa zuuttambaase asiista kar'baas;</para>
  <para style="ili">3. Roomnonneen gedda mediteraniyani baarisi biratota faase daasta zi'ubaas;</para>
  <para style="ili">Wosini meeni wostoossi ammanon kessa biistefaas Korto ayyanaasi wosto sinfaat Penxekosteni wono Yerusalemuk feese amanynyi meyaasta akama hugnak kerobaas; esiisimato matsafaassi isarba isarbaasik kuni zagte wuzaasikito zuuttambaase biistenaasimato Korto ayyanaas betekiristaniisonnawa bari zoonsiisinna zoonsubaasonnanawa chinubaasonna daysifa. Wosini meeni wostoossi zagte wuzaasikito wosiyaas amanynyini meeni kaassinawa betekiristanini isar sinaassik fa hugnaas awune fa akama sinnamatotu makefa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Matsafaas Siruk Ephna Ephobaas</para>
  <para style="io1">Zaala sinak hooro <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 1:1-26">1:1-26</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesus koi'baasta imna ajajinewa Korto Ayyanaasi yooni abdine <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 1:1-14">1:1-14</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yuudani eddeessi giri asusa chowa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 1:15-26">1:15-26</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yerusalemuk makte zaala <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 2:1-8:3">2:1—8:3</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yuudaknawa Samariyakna makte zaala <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 8:4-12:25">8:4—12:25</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawulos wosi sinne hambaas <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 13:1-28:31">13:1—28:31</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wosi sinne tesire hama <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 13:1-14:28">13:1—14:28</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yerusalemni zuutto <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 15:1-35">15:1-35</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wosi sinne hepsa hambaas <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 15:36-18:22">15:36—18:22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wosi sinne keezsa hambaas <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 18:23-21:16">18:23—21:16</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawulosni Yerusalemuk; Qisariyaknawa Roomukna taatobaas <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 21:17-28:31">21:17—28:31</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1"/>Tewofilosno! Zeemoti tichina tichaasta Yesus wostena wuzaasewa assina assuse asinna tichingwa. Es Tichinaas dey Yesus wostobaason jammarena wonaastan kabgira, <verse eid="ACT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2"/>Den sama hamana wononeen kar'a wostena wostosongwa. Den sama hamnaas bar korina wosibaasik Korto Ayyanaaski kamo ajajibaason imnanneen orfowa. <verse eid="ACT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3"/>Akama shanaason ephpheteere kitinanneen orfo hayew sinne foobaason showo ugnak ammanon biiste zaalaak kesse baassok beste. Acheechasir wona kesse bestefaafe Ha'oosi taatoni chowanon baassok assi. <verse eid="ACT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4"/>Baassoneen ane feena kabaasik ekka yire ajaje: «Ta makena Abaaskin imte abdiison oodtitano Yerusalemun kesatiita. <verse eid="ACT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5"/>Yohannis akaktu haphqi; sinuntano nitto garo wonaneen orfo Korto Ayyanaktu haphuqtoti» yi.<verse eid="ACT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Den Sama Hami</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mar. 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luqa. 24:50-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6"/>Baasso Yesusneen ane isarik zuuttere feeseten: «Daamiiso! Israelni taatooson wolgira imata wonaas hashnoso?» yit mamussete.<verse eid="ACT 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7"/>Yesus dey wolgire: «Abaas basa ha'suni hugnaasik hoossina wonaasewa neyaase asin nitto arutik aafawa chimati wuza. <verse eid="ACT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8"/>Sinuntano Korto Ayyanaas nittoosta kerefana kabaasik hugna danatiwa. Es kabaasik Yerusalemuk, Yuudak, Samariyaknawa hamma daani dila kar'ananneenna taak zaal sinatiwa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9"/>Es baron makenanneen orfo baasso biyefeen den sama hami. Shaaruus dey barin ephpha aaffesiissin aachi.<verse eid="ACT 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10"/>Bar den sama hamfeen baasso dey den sama kootkire biyefeen diinqone foro maama mayo hep asu baasso tesha yerefaat: <verse eid="ACT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11"/>«Nitto Galiilaki asu! Awagan den sama kootkira biyet yeretirinso? Han den sama hamfeen biyeti Yesus den sama hamfeen biyetiisimato wolle dey yoonirwa.»<verse eid="ACT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuudani Eddeessi Matiyas Korte</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 109:8">Gaama. 109:8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12"/>Esseen orfo Dabrazayitini kumaastan Yerusalem wolsete. Es Dabrazayitini kumaas Yerusalemniistan wokbaas isa beysani wonni kutuni ugna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa kiilo meetiri</char></note> sinana.<verse eid="ACT 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13"/>Yerusalem yeesere den diisefe segenetiista kesete. Es kese baasso dey Phexiros, Yohannis, Yaqob, Indiriyas, Filiphoos, Tomas, Bertelomewos, Matiyos, Ilfiyosni naa Yaqob, Kooner yistefe Simonnawa Yaqobni naa Yuudana. <verse eid="ACT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14"/>Es baasso zuuttambesiise isarik Ha'oni shiiphok wonna wonna zuutteset feeseter. Baassoneen ane dey isa isa mashka meya Yesusni into Maarami esiisimato dey Yesusni ayni meya feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15"/>Es wono Phexiros tiirewa hepasire sinni amanynyini meeni ganesi yerefaat ekka yi: <verse eid="ACT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16"/>«Ayni meyane! Yesusnin ephpha baassok zoonsi sina Yuudani chowaasik Korto Ayyanaas zeemma Dawitniki kamo makena tichaasi kaama ko'unak sholsuwa. <verse eid="ACT 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17"/>Yuuda innoossin isar sinne faattere han inno wostefeni wostooson wostet feer. <verse eid="ACT 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18"/>Sinuntano han asus es wostena mangu wostobaasi waagak daa waage. Estan sinbaasik gandere kixxek karate. Kenashbaas dey fe'te. <verse eid="ACT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19"/>Es chowaas dey Yerusalemuk feese baasso zuuttambesiise asik odte. Es bari boor'a es daas baasso noonoosik: ‹Akkeldaama› yistera teegte. Kotbaas dey: ‹Harinni daa› uu. <verse eid="ACT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20"/>Es bar sinnaas gaamni matsafaassi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">« ‹Foona keebaas ona sinfawungwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">oonu barissi foonaatawa›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">dey: ‹Barik imte wostooson;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">oom asu basaastan ephphe wostowowa.›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">yistera tichchena boor'awa.<verse eid="ACT 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21"/>«Es bari boor'a Daam Yesus inno ganeyaassi kutit feena kabaasik innoneen ane feese baassossin; <verse eid="ACT 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22"/>Esiisimato dey Yohannisni haphqustan kabira Daam Yesus den sama hamna wonaastaneen kar'e ane feese asuni meyaassin isa asu innoneen ane kitun kabubaasi chowaasik zaal sinanak sholsuwa.» <verse eid="ACT 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23"/>Esseen orfo hep asunin ephphe yeesete. Es baasso dey Barsabaas wedey Iyyosixos yistefe Yosefnawa Matiyasna. <verse eid="ACT 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24"/>Ekka yisere shiiphsete: «Asu zuuttambaase asi nibanon arife Daamiiso! Han heppiisasin oonin koritamato ne innok besuwa. <verse eid="ACT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25"/>Shiiphefeniis Yuuda beyye basa teetni dimaassi hamna wostoosewa wosi sinaason ephphetooni barinna innok besutakwa» <verse eid="ACT 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26"/>Estan ixaason hai'seten Matiyasnik kesi. Es bari boor'a bar asire isse wosini meyaneen ane faatte.<verse eid="ACT 1:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Korto Ayyanaas Nawoni Meyaasta Kere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1"/>Penxekooste yiste heeboos kar'fana kabaasik nawoni meya zuuttambesiise isarik isa dimta zuuttere feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2"/>Diinqo akama ipuwani kaamane fa kaama den saman ya. Baasso feesete keyaassi dey tuumi. <verse eid="ACT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3"/>Termane fa geeni wino baassok beste. Bagte bagtera isa isarbesiisata di. <verse eid="ACT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4"/>Zuuttambesiise Korto Ayyanak tuuntesete. Korto Ayyanaas baassok imna aruusimato ooma noonok wolumsete.<verse eid="ACT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5"/>Es kabaasik daa daassin yeese Ha'ooson digsefe Ayhudni meya Yerusalemuk feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6"/>Es kaamaason odesefe kabaasik showo asuni meya zuuttesete. Isarbesi isarbesiis baasso teetni noonoosik wolumsefeen odesete boor'a diinqesete. <verse eid="ACT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7"/>Diinqoknawa dajokna ekka yisete: «Han ekka wolumsefe baasso zuuttambesiise Galiilaki asutenoso? <verse eid="ACT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8"/>Eekin inno daani noonoosik wolumsefeen odefeniis aakkanso? <verse eid="ACT 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9"/>Inno Partenaki, Meedki, Elamki, Mesopetomiyaki, Yuudaki, Kepedokiyaki, Pantoski, Iisiyaki, <verse eid="ACT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10"/>Firgiyaki, Punfiliyaki, Giphtsiki, Kerenani tesha fa Libiyani awurajjaasitu faafeni. Inno Roomun ye Ayhudni meenawa Ayhud sina inno dey faanir. <verse eid="ACT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11"/>Esiisimato Qerxesni asuni meenawa Arabni asuni meena zuuttere Ha'oosi akama wostonon inno teetni noonoosik wolumsefeen odedifeniwa» <verse eid="ACT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12"/>Es bari boor'a zuuttambesiise diinqesere: «Han wuzaas aambanso?» yisete. <verse eid="ACT 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13"/>Sinuntano isa isaas: «Wayinini usha ushere zaysetewa» yit kanyesete.<verse eid="ACT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexirosni Wollaas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14"/>Es kabaasik Phexiros asire isse wosini meyaneen yerefaat kaambaason teggire daraasik ekka yit make: «Nitto Yuudani daastaki asunawa Yerusalemuk feese nittona zuuttamnitiise han sina chowaason aruk sholefaatine ta makefana baron mai'sira odotiwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15"/>Hash wonnanneen keez sa'ati sinna boor'a nitto safarefetisimato han baasso aane zaysotowa. <verse eid="ACT 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16"/>Sinuntano han bar sinnaas raajju Iyyuel ekka yit makena bar ko'unakwa:<verse eid="ACT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17"/>« ‹Ha'oos koi'ni wonaasikitosi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Ayyananaason asu zuuttambaase asiista kessunawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">arqaasnawa mashka naanggotnitiise raaji maksone;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">na'oni meya dey raa'i biyone;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">kur'uni meya dey miito miitosone.<verse eid="ACT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18"/>Esiisimato dey es wonaasikitosi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">arqa wostinynyataasatanawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">mashka wostinynyanaastana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">Ayyananaason kessunawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">baasso dey Raaji maksone.<verse eid="ACT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19"/>Den samak diinqi wuzasikitonon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">han daastak dey biistera artonoy wuza besunawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">hanna, geya, geeni ki'na dey bestona.<verse eid="ACT 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20"/>Akama dey diinqi sina Daamiisa wona yoonoyfeen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">zeemma Awaas talmona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">assaas dey hannane faar sinana.<verse eid="ACT 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21"/>Daamiisa sunanon teegefe bar zuuttere fui'tona› yiwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22"/>«Israelni asuni meeno! Han kaamaason odotiwa. Nitto teetaasik arifetisimato Naaziretki Yesus bar oo sinnamato Ha'oos nitto ganeyaassi barki kamo zagina akama akama wostoos, biistera artonoy wuzaasewa besose futo sinbaas artewa. <verse eid="ACT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23"/>Bar teetbaasik Ha'oos zeemma koppa'ena bariknawa arina barikna nittok aattere imtewa. Nitto dey barin tumabesi foonto meeni kushusi suuttonak zagira worseti. <verse eid="ACT 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24"/>Sinuntano kituus barin ephpha fu'onak aane chima sinna boor'a Ha'oos kituusi shananon tishkira barin kitun kabgi. <verse eid="ACT 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25"/>Dawit dey basa chowaasik ekka yi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">« ‹Daamiisin wonna wonna sinnaastatu biifawungwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">nawonoynamato bar hoi'ta teshnaastatu fewa.<verse eid="ACT 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26"/>Es bari boor'a nibnaas gire;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">noononaas dey girak tuunte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">Esiisimato ashnaas dey abdiktu faafa.<verse eid="ACT 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27"/>Kaanaason ke'oni dimaassi aafa beyana wuza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">Kortoneesin dey;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">moogaassi kuuppe fui'tonak aafa zaguta wuza.<verse eid="ACT 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28"/>Kaani ugnaason taak assitwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">ne taneen ane sinta boor'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">giranaas tuuma sinana.›<verse eid="ACT 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29"/>«Aytaasakitono! Zeemoti abani meeni ganeyaassin isaas sina Dawit kitire kabbartenamato; moogbaas dey hawungneen kar'a innokik faanamato ammanon nittok makonawa. <verse eid="ACT 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30"/>Sinuntano Dawit es baron makenaas raajju sinna boor'anawa dey Ha'oos barik: ‹Ne zalaassin isaasin ne zigimoosta duusunawa› yit teyya girina abdini kaamaason arire feer sinna boor'awa. <verse eid="ACT 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31"/>Es bari boor'a: ‹Kiristoos› ke'oni dimaassi fui'tonoynamatonawa ashbaas dey moogaassi kuupnoynamatonatu zeemme biyaat kitun kabuna bari chowaason make. <verse eid="ACT 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32"/>Es Yesusnin Ha'oos kitun kabgiwa. Inno dey zuuttera es chowaasik zaalwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33"/>Ha'oosi hoi'ta teshta duuk den tegifena kabaasiknawa Korto Ayyanaasi abdinon Abaaskin ephna kabaasikna han biifeti baronnawa odefeti baronna kessiwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:33"/><verse number="34-35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34-35"/>Ese den sama kesaas Dawit sinna beybaason Dawit teetbaasik ekka yit makewa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34-35">« ‹Daamiis Daamtaasik;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34-35">gumaneesin ne ha'suni hugnaasi sikalosi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34-35">zaguna kabaneen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34-35">hoi'ta teshnaasta duwa.›<verse eid="ACT 2:34-35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36"/>«Ese han nitto suutti Yesusnin Ha'oos Daam dey Kiristoos zaginamato Israelni meeni daraas zuuttere futok aruwowa!»<verse eid="ACT 2:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37"/>Daraas dey es baron odesefe kabaasik nibbesiissi akamanon safarsere Phexirosninnawa oom wosini meyanonna: «Ayni meyane! Eekin awu zagunirinso?» yisete.<verse eid="ACT 2:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38"/>Phexiros dey ekka yi: «Harmutiwa; boor'nitiis dey feeshun ustonak isa isarnitiis Yesus Kiristoosni sunaasik haphuqtoti. Ha'oosi ima sina Korto Ayyanaason ephphatootiwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39"/>Abdini kaamaas nittoknawa naanggotnitiisikitoknawa. Esiisimato dey Daama Ha'oos barki teegona woksok feese baasso zuuttambesiise asiknawa.»<verse eid="ACT 2:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40"/>Dey ooma showo kaama zaala maket: «Han elinga koontoosta yooni ke'oossin teetnitiison fu'otiwa» yire kiiti. <verse eid="ACT 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41"/>Baassossin showobesiis es kaamaason ephpheteesere haphuktesete. Es wono keez kum sinni asuni meya amanere daytesete. <verse eid="ACT 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42"/>Baasso dey wosini meeni assuuson odesere isarik fook, tushaason isarik muuknawa shiiphokna chimet feeseter.<verse eid="ACT 2:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amanynyini Meeni Isar Sinnewa Baasso Foose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43"/>Es kabaasik wosini meeni kushuussi showo biistera artonoy wuznewa diinqine zagtet faar sinna boor'a asu zuuttambaase dige. <verse eid="ACT 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44"/>Amanynyini meya zuuttere isariktu feesefe. Fa wuzbesiis zuuttera gaara. <verse eid="ACT 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45"/>Fa wuzbesiisonnawa otumbesiisonna kisire waagefaafe es waagaason isarba isarbaasik sholsinamato haa'e imet feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46"/>Wonna wonna betemeqdesiissi zuutteset feeseter. Keebesi keebesiissik dey wol teegsefaafe isarik tushaason batte giraknawa ma'a nibakna meeset feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47"/>Daamiisin dey galatteset feeseter. Dara zuuttambaase dey baassotin ulfinsit feer. Ha'oos dey faruni asuni meyanon wonna wonna baassosta daysit faar.<verse eid="ACT 2:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Laafa Asusa Faru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1"/>Isa wona Phexirosnawa Yohannisna Ha'o shiiphtefana wonni izgin sa'atiista betemeqdesiiski kesete. <verse eid="ACT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2"/>Estak «Gada» yistefa betemeqdesiisi finynyi faar. Estak intobaasi keensin laafa sinne koonte isa asu feer. Bar dey betemeqdesiissi girife asuskin waaga shiiphonak wonna wonna asuni meya wor'e teshshosi duusit feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3"/>Es asus Phexiros Yohannisna betemeqdesiissi girsefeen biyaat waaga imonek baassotin shiiphe. <verse eid="ACT 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4"/>Phexiros Yohannisna asuski kootkire biyefaat Phexiros: «Hang innoki biwa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5"/>Asus dey baassokin isa wuzane imonerwa iyaat kootkire bi. <verse eid="ACT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6"/>Sinuntano Phexiros: «Birrinewa warqene taakik aafawa. Sinuntano taaki fa baron neek imanawa. Naaziretki Yesus Kiristoosni sunaasik kabira kutuwa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7"/>Hoi'ta kushubaasi zatte kabgin geregere wochobaasewa kumarkushbaase zagi. <verse eid="ACT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8"/>Kabire dey yere. Kutit baassoneen ane betemeqdesiissi giri. Bar dey kutit, fillet Ha'ooson galattet feer. <verse eid="ACT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9"/>Daraasakito zuuttambesiise kutifeennawa Ha'ooson galattefeenna biyete. <verse eid="ACT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10"/>«Gada finynya» yistera teegtefa betemeqdesiisi finynyita diifaat shiiphet fe bar sinnamato arsete. Basaastaki sina chowaasik akamanon dajesere diinqeset feeseter.<verse eid="ACT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexitros Betemeqdesiisik Wollena Wolla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11"/>Fari asus Phexirosninnawa Yohannisninna asin zataat feen daraas zuuttere diinqok: «Solomonni dagafiyo» yistefa dimaasta baassoki eelet hamete. <verse eid="ACT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12"/>Phexiros asuni meyanon biinayse ekka yi: «Israelni daraaso! Han chowaasik awuni boor'a diinqedifetirinso? Awuniron kootkira biidifetirinso? Inno teetniri hugnak wedey Ha'ooson digoniisik han asus farire kutunak zaginirne faar sinna nittok bestefawoso? <verse eid="ACT 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13"/>Inno abani meya Abraham Yisaqnawa Yaqobna asi Ha'o bari Naa Yesusnin ulfinsiwa. Sinuntano nitto kitunak Philaxosni sina aatira barin imetiwa. Pilatos dey kotanak sholen nitto: ‹Aane sholefeniwa› yiseti. <verse eid="ACT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14"/>Nitto Kortoosinnawa ookoosinna: ‹Aane sholefeni› yisefaat kaa wori barin kotanak shiiphseti. <verse eid="ACT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15"/>Kaa imfe barin worseti. Sinuntano Ha'oos barin kitun kabgi. Es chowaasik inno zaalwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16"/>Han biifeti asusinnawa arifeti asusinna farire chima dannaas Yesusni sunaasik beste amantoosikwa. Yesusnik amanobaasik zuuttamnitiise asi sina tuuma faru daniwa.<verse eid="ACT 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17"/>«Hashnu aytaasakitono! Han Yesusniista zagseti bar nittotin ha'sife baassosimato tugga'ok zagsetimato arifawungwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18"/>Sinuntano Ha'oos zeemma raajjuni meya zuuttambesiise asiki kamo: ‹Kiristoos› shana ephphetoonak sholsifa yina kaamaas esiisik ko'unak zagiwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19"/>Ese boor'nitiis feeshun ustonak harmira Daamiiski wolutiwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20"/>Daamiiskin hepsa wolla gaddo sinati wona nittok yoonak Daamiis zeemme korina Kiristoosnin nittok wosuna. <verse eid="ACT 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21"/>Es Yesus den samak foonaas Ha'oos zeemma korto raajjuni meyaki kamo makenaasimato han daas zuuttera hepsa wolla gaddo sinna wosustona kabaneengwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22"/>Muse dey ekka yiwa: ‹Daama Ha'oos taan kabginaasimato nitto ganeyaassin raajjunin nittok kabgunawa. Bar nittok makona baron zuutira odotiwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23"/>Es raajjuusin odo beya bar zuuttere daraasa ganesin oor kesse tishunawa.› <verse eid="ACT 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24"/>Samuelniistan kabire feese raajjuni meya zuuttere han wonaasi chowanon esiisimato maksetewa. <verse eid="ACT 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25"/>Raajjuni meyak makte abdiis nittokwa; esiisimato dey Ha'oos Abrahamnik: ‹Han daasta fe darani meya zuuttere ne zalaasiktu suustosonewa› yira abaniisakitoneen ane girina teyyaasi kaama nittoktu siniwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26"/>Es bari boor'a Ha'o zeemma nawubaasin kabgira wosinaas nittokwa. Es baron dey zaginaas nitto isarniti isarnitiis mangu wostontiissin wolini suusanakwa.»<verse eid="ACT 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Phexiros Yohannisna Ayhudni Meeni Shonggosta Ta'esete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1"/>Phexiros Yohannisna daraasik maksefeen maagni meenawa betemeqdesini tasoni gaanynyaasna esiisimato dey Seduk'awini meya baassoki yeesete. <verse eid="ACT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2"/>Es hep wosini meya daraasik Yesusni kitun kabuuson assubesiisiknawa barki kamo kitun kabu foobaasonna kotte maksete boor'a akamanon gi'tesete. <verse eid="ACT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3"/>Es bari boor'a Phexiros Yohannisna asin ephere gerok waala sinna boor'a wonananneen taatoni keer foosonek zagsete. <verse eid="ACT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4"/>Sinuntano basakitoni kaamaason ode baasso ganeyaassin showobesiis amanesete. Amane asuni meeni faadaas dey uuch kuma sinana. <verse eid="ACT 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5"/>Wonotirik Ayhudni meeni gaanynye meenawa kur'uni meena dey Museni tumaasi assinynyani meya Yerusalemuk zuuttesete. <figure style="fig" alt="Part of the Sanhedrin council in session" file="LB00284B.tif" size="span" ref="4:5">Ayhudni meeni shonggo </figure><verse eid="ACT 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6"/>Zuuttese asuni meeni ganeyaassin maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynya Haannanawa Keyyaffana; Yohannisnawa Iskindirosna; maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaasa keerki meyaneen zuuttere feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7"/>Baasso dey Phexiros Yohannisna asin ganebesiissi yeetaat: «Han baron zagsetiis aro hugnak wedey ooni sunakinso?» yit mamussete. <verse eid="ACT 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8"/>Es kabaasik Phexiros Korto Ayyanak tuuntere ekka yit wolgi: «Daraasa ha'sinynyanawa kur'uni meyane! <verse eid="ACT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9"/>Hash hawung inno mamustoniis isa laafa asusata zagte ma'a wostoosewa aakkak farinamatonawa. <verse eid="ACT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10"/>Han asus farire nitto sina yerenaas nitto suutni Ha'oos dey kitun kabgina Naaziretki Yesus Kiristoosni sunaasik sinnamato nittonawa Israelni dara zuuttambaase asikna arto sinungwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11"/>Keyaason keer'fe nitto kashshira ha'iti shu'aas barwa; bar dey kajjaasta duuni shu'awa. <verse eid="ACT 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12"/>Es bari boor'a faru ooma ookinnu aafawa. Inno farunik sholsina Ha'oos asunik imna suna barneen ooma samaneen daakuk oonu aafewa.»<verse eid="ACT 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13"/>Shonggoni meya Phexiros Yohannisna diga foontonon maksobesiison biyeteese arubesi foonto asu sinobesiison arseter sinna boor'a diinqesete. Yesusneen ane feeser sinobesiison dey arsete. <verse eid="ACT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14"/>Fari asus Phexirosneen Yohannisneen ane yerefeen biyaat maksone wuza turuksete. <verse eid="ACT 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15"/>Estan shonggoostan kesonek zagsefaat ekka yit merkesete: <verse eid="ACT 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16"/>«Eekin han asusakitonista awu zagunirinso? Yerusalemuk fe asu zuuttambaase asik baasso zagsete biistera artonoy wuzaas arto siniwa. Es bari boor'a mormonik aafawa chimani wuza. <verse eid="ACT 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17"/>Sinuntano han chowaas daraasa ganesi tagunoynamato hawungneen ekalo han Yesusni sunaason kabgire ooniknu maksonoytemato deessira kalaniwa» yisete.<verse eid="ACT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18"/>Estan baassotin teegsere Yesusni sunaasik isanne maksonoytemato wedey assusonoytemato chinire ajajesete. <verse eid="ACT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19"/>Sinuntano Phexiros Yohannisna wolgire ekka yisete: «Ha'oosik ajajamoostan nittok ajajamonik Ha'oosi sinak sholsunoso? Nitto teetnitiisik makebbetiso. <verse eid="ACT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20"/>Inno biini baronnawa odeni baronna mako aafa beyaniwuza» <verse eid="ACT 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21"/>Daraasa gaannye meenawa shongoosta diisefe baassona Phexirosninnawa Yohannisninna ke'uk isa chowane dano beyobesiisik dey daraasin digsefaat hepsi dey deessire kotte gafuksete. Es baron dey zagsetees daraas zuuttere sina chowaasik Ha'ooson galattet feer sinna boor'awa. <verse eid="ACT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22"/>Es biistera artonoy wuzaasik fari asus woggabaas acheechasirneen denalo.<verse eid="ACT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amanynyini Meeni Shiipho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23"/>Phexiros Yohannisna kottesetenneen orfo amanynyi sina zomobesiiski yeesere maagni gaanynye meenawa kur'uni meena maksete baron zuutire maksete. <verse eid="ACT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24"/>Baasso dey es baron odeseteyse isarik kaambesiison teggire Ha'ooski ekka yit shiiphsete: «Samaasewa daase; baariisewa siruk fa testoose asin zuutire tesi Daamiiso! <verse eid="ACT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25"/>Korto Ayyanaaski kamo wostinynyane sina abani Dawitni noonoossi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">« ‹Aazabni meya awuniron gi'teseteso?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">daraas awuniron shimak koppa'eseteso?<verse eid="ACT 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26"/>Daasta fe taate meya hooresere;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">daason ha'sife baasso dey isarik zuuttesere;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">Daamiisatanawa basa Muudtosatana kabsete.›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 4:26">yira make Ha'oos newe.<verse eid="ACT 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27"/>«Futoosik Herodisnawa Pentenawi Pilatosna Aazabiisneen Israelni daraasneen han katamaassi Muudto zagita korto wostinynyane Yesusniista kabsete. <verse eid="ACT 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28"/>Es bar dey ekka sinnaas ne zeemma ne hugnaasiknawa ne fiqadisikna koppa'eta baron ko'issonekwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29"/>Hashnu Daamniiso; fokkorabesiison biwa. Wostinynyaneesakito kaamneeson diga foontonon maksonek chima baassok imma. <verse eid="ACT 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30"/>Korto wostinynyane Yesusni sunaasik mettanni meya farsoneknawa biistera artonoy wuzne; diinqine zagtonak kushuneeson shonggowa» yisete. <verse eid="ACT 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31"/>Shiiphsetenneen orfo zuuttesere feesete dimaas shorke. Zuuttambesiise Korto Ayyanak tuuntesete. Ha'oosi kaamanon diga foontonon maksete.<verse eid="ACT 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tesuni Kiristanani Meeni Isarik Fo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32"/>Amanynyini meya zuuttere isa nibaknawa isa safaraknatu feesefe. Oonu: «Haniis taarwa» yifena wuza aafa. Fa wuzbesiis zuuttera gaara. <verse eid="ACT 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33"/>Wosini meya dey Daam Yesusni kitun kabuuson akama hugnak zaala makset feeseter. Zuuttambesiise asiista akama Ha'oni otma faar. <verse eid="ACT 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34"/>Daason wedey keyaason waagefaafe waagbesiison isa baristatu teshshesefe sinna boor'a ganebesiissi isa rakkata aafe. <verse eid="ACT 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35"/>Waagaason teshshere wosini meyak imet feeseter. Isa isarbesiisik sholsinaasne faaron haa'et feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36"/>Koontena daabaas Qophiros sina Yosef yiste isa Lewi feer. Wosini meya barin: «Barnabas» yiretu teegsefe. Kotbaas dey: «Chinuni naa» uu. <verse eid="ACT 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37"/>Bar dey daabaason waagere waagaason teshshere wosini meyak imi. <figure style="fig" alt="Jewish and Roman coins" file="HK00163B.tif" size="span" ref="4:35">Ayhudni meenawa Romanni meena asi santibi </figure><verse eid="ACT 4:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Hananiyaneen Saphphiraneen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1"/>Hananiya yiste isa asu asuba Saphphiraneen daa kisire waagsete. <verse eid="ACT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2"/>Asubaas arifeen es daa waagtena waagaassin fu'efaat taamme wosini meeni wochoossi kunsi. <verse eid="ACT 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3"/>Sinuntano Phexiros: «Hananiyano! Korto Ayyanaason eshataknawa daasi waagtan fu'otakna awuni boor'a Sexana nibneessi giriso. <verse eid="ACT 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4"/>Kisira waagonoyfeen daas neertanoso? Kisira waagetanneen orfo waagaas neertanoso? Eekin awuni boor'a han wuzason nibneessi safaretso? Ha'oosontu eshittano asunintawa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5"/>Hananiya es kaamaason odenayse kere wor'e kiti. Es baron ode asuni meya zuuttere akamanon digsete. <verse eid="ACT 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6"/>Na'oni meya kabsere kitubaason kimme kabbarsete.<verse eid="ACT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7"/>Keez sa'atineen orfo asubaas teegobaasata sina chowaason arunoy yaara kar'i. <verse eid="ACT 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8"/>Phexiros dey: «Makebbe; daantiison waagsetiis han waagaassinose?» yi. Bar dey wolgira: «Aa; han barissitu waageniwa» yi.<verse eid="ACT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9"/>Phexiros dey: «Daamiisa Ayyananon fattanok aakkak isarik merketise? Ese teegoneesin kabbare asuni meeni wochoos han finynyiissitu fawe. Neen dey ephphe kabbarsonerwe» yi. <verse eid="ACT 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10"/>Bar dey geregere wochobaassi kere wor'a kiti. Asuni meya dey girseten kitira kunfeen danne taamme teegobaasa moogni tesha kabbarsete. <verse eid="ACT 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11"/>Betekiristaniissinawa es baron ode asuni meya zuuttambesiise asiistana akama diga sini.<verse eid="ACT 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wosini Meeni kushuussi Zagte Biistera Artonoy Wuza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12"/>Daraasa ganesi showo biistera artonoy wuznewa diinqine wosini meeni kushuussi zagtet faar. Zuuttere isa nibak Solomonni dagafiyo yistefa dimaasta zuuttet feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13"/>Baassoneen oom asu baassossi wo'itok oonu chimfer aafe. Sinuntano daraas akamanon ulfinsit feer. <verse eid="ACT 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14"/>Daamiisik amanefe arqarnawa mashkare akamanon daytet feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15"/>Phexiros esta kamo hamfena kabaasik yirarabaasnu mettanni meyaasta kamo aatanak mettanni meyanon oppotanawa saa'otana wor'e ugunta kisire kunsit feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16"/>Asuni meya Yerusalemni biratoosta faase katamaasikitosin mettanni meyanonnawa kiina ayyana ephaan mettet fe baassotinna ephphe yeeset feeseter. Mettanni meya dey zuuttere farit feeseter.<verse eid="ACT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wosini Meeni Kabugto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17"/>Maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaasnawa barneen ane feese Seduqawini meeni keen sina baassona zuuttere koonak wosini meyaasta kabsete. <verse eid="ACT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18"/>Wosini meyanon ephere daraasa taatoni keer gedesete. <verse eid="ACT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19"/>Sinuntano Daamiisa wosiya wassi taatoni keyaason gachcha baassotin kisaat: <verse eid="ACT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20"/>«Hamfaat betemeqdesiisi yerefaat han kaani kaamaason zuutira daraasik makotiwa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21"/>Wosini meya dey wonfana kabaasik baassok maktenaasimato betemeqdesiissi hamme assisete. Maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaasnawa barneen ane fe baassotna yeesere shonggosta diisefe baassotinnawa Ayhudni kur'uni meyanonna isarik zuutisete. Wosini meyanon dey ephphe yoosonek asunin taatoni keer wosisete. <verse eid="ACT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22"/>Sinuntano tasoni meeni ha'sinynyani meya taatoni keer hamere aane danoto. Wolle yeesere dey: <verse eid="ACT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23"/>«Taatoni keyaasi gamala mai'sira kuluftera yerer; tasoos dey finynyibaasta yersefeen biini. Sinuntano gachcha girira ooninnu aane daneni» yisete. <verse eid="ACT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24"/>Betemeqdesini tasoni meyanon ajajefe barnawa maagni gaanynye meena es baron odeseteyse: «Han bar awutaaso?» yiset sina wuzaasik ephphe maksone wuza tishi. <verse eid="ACT 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25"/>Es kabaasik isa asu yeere: «Taatoni keer taatiti asusakito betemeqdesiissi yersefaat daraasin assidifewa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26"/>Estan tasoosa gaanynyanawa basa wostinynyaasna hamme baassotin ephphe yeesete. Sinuntano daraas shu'ak baassotin ichnoynamato digsefaat hugnak aane ephoto.<verse eid="ACT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27"/>Wosini meyanon ephpheteshsho shonggosi sina yeetisete. Maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaas ekka yit mamsi: <verse eid="ACT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28"/>«Han sunaasik daraasin assunoytimato kalla faanir; sinuntano nitto Yerusalemni daraasin assira koi'siti; dey Yesusnin woriis inno zagira basa hannaasik mamustonik sholsefeti!»<verse eid="ACT 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29"/>Phexiros oom wosisakitona wolgire: «Asunik ajajamoostan Ha'oosik ajajamoniktu sholsifawa. <verse eid="ACT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30"/>Nitto i'oosta suutta worseti Yesusnin abaniisa Ha'o barin kitun kabgiwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31"/>Bar dey Israelni daraasik harminewa boor'aason feeshun une imanak Ha'oos barin zuuttambaase asi zoonsinawa fatunirna zagira o'itbaasta duunak zagi. <verse eid="ACT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32"/>Inno dey es chowaasik zaalwa. Ha'oosik ajajamefe baassok imna Korto Ayyanaas dey zaalawa» yisete.<verse eid="ACT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33"/>Shonggosta diise baasso dey es baron odeseteyse akamanon haaresere baassotin woruk sholsete. <verse eid="ACT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34"/>Sinuntano dara zuuttambaase asi sina ulfinto tumaasi assinynya Gamaliya yiste shonggosta diisefe baassossin isa Farisawi kabire wosini meyanon gero kissonek zagi. <verse eid="ACT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35"/>Estan shonggosta diisefe baassok ekka yi: «Israelni asuni meyane! Han asusakitonista zagutik safareti baristan teetnitiison oodtiwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36"/>Zeemo sinak Tewodas yiste asu teetbaason iny zagire kabin acheech tii asu dey barik zoonustesete. Sinuntano bar worte. Barneen zoonuste asusakito dey sikte. Koppa'ena wuzaas dey baak tishira fu'te. <verse eid="ACT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37"/>Esseen orfo dey darani faada zagtena kabaasik Galiilaki Yuuda kabire showo daranin barik zoonustonak zagi. Es asus dey worte. Barik zoonuste baasso dey siktesete. <verse eid="ACT 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38"/>Es bari boor'a hash ta nittok makefanaas han asusakitonin beyatiknawa baassostan shaatotiknawa. Han wostobesiis asunikin sinfaanane tishutu tishuna. <verse eid="ACT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39"/>Sinuntano Ha'ooskin sinfaanane baassotin yeetutik aafa chimati wuza. Dey Ha'oosneen faasser sinatiitawa» yi. Baasso dey basa kiitooson ephpheteesete.<verse eid="ACT 5:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40"/>Wosini meyanon hang baassoki teegsere ichaat Yesusni sunaason teegsere maksonoytemato ke'ire gafuksete. <verse eid="ACT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41"/>Sinuntano wosini meya Yesusni sunaasik kashistoos sholsu zagire faadisete boor'a shonggosi sina giret kesete. <verse eid="ACT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42"/>Wonna wonna betemeqdesiissinawa keya keyaassina Yesus Kiristoosni chowaasik assuusonnawa misirachchuni kaamaason makoosonna aane yeetusoto.<verse eid="ACT 5:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Naafun Daaqonynyini Meeni Korto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1"/>Es wonaasi amanynyini meeni faadaas daytet hambaase. Girikni noono wollefe Ayhudni meya Yuudaki Ayhudni meyaasta unyisete. Es unyisetees wonna wonna haachefa argasuni imaas baasso dicha asusikitok beytera faar sinna boor'awa. <verse eid="ACT 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2"/>Estan asire heppe wosini meya amanynyini meyanon zuutire ekka yisete: «Muuni haa'akwa iyaat Ha'oosi kaamanon mako beyanik aane sholsifawa. <verse eid="ACT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3"/>Ese ayni meyane; nitto ganeyaassin ma'a amalabesi faana Korto Ayyanaknawa techmakna tuum naafun asunin korani han wostooson wostosonek imniwa. <verse eid="ACT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4"/>Sinuntano inno shiiphoknawa kaamaason makokna chimani.»<verse eid="ACT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5"/>Es kaamaas zuuttambesiise asin girsi. Estan amantoknawa Korto Ayyanakna tuunto Isxifanosnin, Filiphosnin, Prokorosnin, Nikarosnin, Timonannin, Permenannin, Ayhudni meyaassi girire fe Ansokiyaki Nikolawosnin korsete. <verse eid="ACT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6"/>Es baassotin teshshere wosini meeni sina yeetisete. Wosini meya dey shiiphsetenneen orfo kushubesiison baassosta ta'isete. <verse eid="ACT 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7"/>Ha'oosi kaama dey tagit hamna boor'a amane asusa faada Yerusalemuk akamanon daytet hami. Maagni meyaassin dey showobesiis amanesete.<verse eid="ACT 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isxifanosni Ootto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8"/>Isxifanos Ha'oni otmaknawa hugnakna tuumme daraasa ganesi diinqinewa biistera artonoy wuzne zagit feer. <verse eid="ACT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9"/>Es kabaasik: «Birmadumma kesa asuni meeni zuuttoni keya» yistera teegtefa Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaasi asuni meya; Qerenaki asuni meenawa Iskindiriyaki asuni meena; Kilqiyannawa Iisiyanna isa isa asuni meya kabsere Isxifanosneen ane karakkarsete. <verse eid="ACT 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10"/>Sinuntano Isxifanos maket feena techmaasonnawa Ayyanaasonna yeetuk aane chimoto. <verse eid="ACT 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11"/>Estan dey: «Isxifanos Museniistanawa Ha'oostana mei'ni kaama makefeen odeniwa» uni asuni meyanon aachok kabugsete. <verse eid="ACT 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12"/>Ekkak daraasin, kur'uni meyanon, tumaasi assinynyani meyanon basaasta kabugsete. Isxifanosnin ephere shonggosi sina tai'sisete. <verse eid="ACT 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13"/>Basaasta esha zaala makoni asunin ephphe yeesete. Baasso dey: «Han asus han betemeqdesiistanawa tumaastana mei'ni kaama makooson aane beye. <verse eid="ACT 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14"/>Dey: ‹Han Naaziretki Yesus han betemeqdesiison bognir; Muse imna tumaason dey soolonir› yire makefeen odeni» yisete. <verse eid="ACT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15"/>Es kabaasik shonggosta diise baasso zuuttere Isxifanosnin kootkire biyeten sinbaas Ha'oni wosini sinane faar sinna beste.<verse eid="ACT 6:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Isxifanosni Wolla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1"/>Maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaas Isxifanosnin: «Han neyista maktefa chowaas futonoso?» yit mamsi. <verse eid="ACT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2"/>Isxifanos wolgire ekka yi: «Aytaasakitonawa abataasakitona odotiwa! Abani Abraham Kaaran duuk hamnoy zeemme Mesepetomiyak feen ulfinto Ha'oos barik ammanon bestera: <verse eid="ACT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3"/>‹Daaneestannawa koonneesasinna kessa ta besuna dimaas hamma› yi. <verse eid="ACT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4"/>Es kabaasik Keledawini meeni daastan kesse hamme Kaaran di. Estan ababa kitinanneen orfo hash han nitto faafeti daasta Ha'o barin teshshewa. <verse eid="ACT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5"/>Ha'oos hantak wochobaasonnu yeetuna dima barik aane ima. Sinuntano han daason bariknawa barneen orfoki zalbaasikna imanak Ha'o teyya giriwa. Es teyyaason girinaas Abraham nawubaasin koonunoyfeengwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6"/>Zalbaas dey alaga daasta foonamatonawa acheech tiya wogga boza zagsere miir'ak ha'susonematona makera faarwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7"/>Estan dey: ‹Bozok yer'e ha'si daraasata mangsu kar'anar. Esseen orfo birmadumma kesere taan shiiphsone› yira Ha'oos makewa. <verse eid="ACT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8"/>Estak dey haarkoni kunni teyyaason barik imi. Es bari boor'a Abraham Isaqnin koontenari nangirinsinari wono haarko kunsi. Esiisimato dey Isaaq naaba Yaqobnin haarko kunsi. Yaqob dey asire heppe zalaasi aba sina naanggotbaason haarko kunsi.<verse eid="ACT 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9"/>«Yaqobni naanggotiis Yosefniista koonesere boz sinanak Giphtsi waagsete. Sinuntano Ha'oos barneen anetu fa. <verse eid="ACT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10"/>Basaasta kar'a shana zuuttambaase asiissin barin kisi. Giphtsiki taato Fere'onni sina addanewa techumne imi. Fere'on dey Giphtsiniistanawa fa wuzbaastana ha'sunir zagi. <verse eid="ACT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11"/>Es kabaasik Giphtsiniistanawa Kene'aniistana maknewa akama shanane sini. Abaniisakito dey muusone muu turuksete. <verse eid="ACT 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12"/>Yaqob dey Giphtsik meya foobaason odere zeemme abaniisakitonin Giphtsi wosi. <verse eid="ACT 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13"/>Hepsa wolle hamefe kabaasik Yosef aybaasakitonik ammanon kisire make. Fere'on dey Yosefni koon sinobesiison ari. <verse eid="ACT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14"/>Esseen orfo Yosef wosire ababa Yaqobninnawa basa koonni meyanonna barki yoosonek zagi. Baasso dey faadbesiis naafunasire uuchche. <verse eid="ACT 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15"/>Estan Yaqob Giphtsi hami. Barnawa abaniisakitona estak kitisete. <verse eid="ACT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16"/>Kitubesiis dey Sekem oottera hamma Abraham Hemorni naanggotaaskin basa birriisik waagena moogaassi kabbarte. <verse eid="ACT 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17"/>Ha'oos Abrahamnik teyyak imna abdiis ko'unak tai'set yaafana kabaasik Giphtsiki fe daraniisa faada arkit hami. <verse eid="ACT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18"/>Es bar dey sinnaas Yosefni arunoy oom taato Giphtsik taattena wononeengwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19"/>Es ora taatoos daraniisin manguk kabire abaniisakitonin shana besi. Daaga naanggotbesiis kitunaknawa ek gero kissere ha'sonekna abaniisakitonin giddisi. <verse eid="ACT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20"/>Es kabaasik Muse koonte. Bar dey Ha'oosi sina keeshu daag naa sini. Keez assa ababaasa keer diire dichi. <verse eid="ACT 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21"/>Gero kesse kunsiseten taato Fere'onni nawaas danna ephpha bari naa zagira dichi. <verse eid="ACT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22"/>Muse dey Giphtsini meeni techmaason zuutire ari. Wollaknawa wostokna chim asu sini.<verse eid="ACT 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23"/>«Acheechasir woggaba sinfana kabaasik ayba sina Israelni naanggotaason mamsunak nibbaassi safare. <verse eid="ACT 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24"/>Isa Giphtsini asu basa ayiisin miir'efeen danne Giphtsini asusin woruk guma kaaste. <verse eid="ACT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25"/>Basa keen sina baasso Ha'oos barki kamo baassotin birmadumma kisunir zagire biisediferne faar sinnatu barik bestedifa. Sinuntano baasso es baron aane arsoto. <verse eid="ACT 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26"/>Wonotirik hep Israelni asu barna barna faassefeen danne gansunak sholefaat: ‹Nitto ayna aynawa, awuni boor'a nittotna nittotna faassedifetirinso?› yi. <verse eid="ACT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27"/>Es zomobaasin miir'et fe bar Musenin ek tugire: ‹Ne innoosta mangsu kar'ataknawa ha'sutakna zagiis oonso? <verse eid="ACT 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28"/>Hazoti Giphtsini asusin woritaasimato taan dey worutak sholedifataroso?› yi. <verse eid="ACT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29"/>Muse es baron odenaase Midiyamni daa guuzze hamme di. Estak hep arqa naanggotnin kooni.<verse eid="ACT 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30"/>«Muse es daastak acheechasir wogga tuumfana kabaasik Siinaki aamaasi tesha fa ichma daassiki saabaassi saamet fa geyaasi winoossi Ha'oni wosiya barik beste. <verse eid="ACT 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31"/>Muse es biina chowaasik diinqet ek barki tai'se. Estan ekka yifa Daamiisa kaamanon dey ode: <verse eid="ACT 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32"/>‹Ta ne abasakitoni Ha'owa, Abrahamni Ha'o, Yisaqni Ha'o, Yaqobni Ha'owa› Muse dey digak biyanaknu aane chime. <verse eid="ACT 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33"/>Daamiis dey ekka yi: ‹Yereta dimaas korto daa sinna boor'a wochoneessin chaa'maneeson kisuwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34"/>Giphtsik fe darataasa shananon futok biingwa. Rakkobesiisi chaaganon odengwa. Es bari boor'a fu'onak kerengwa. Hashnu hani yowa. Neen wolgira Giphtsi wosunawa.›<verse eid="ACT 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35"/>« ‹Innoosta mangsu kar'ataknawa ha'sutakna oonso neen zagiri?› yit oomtesete. Sinuntano Ha'oos es Musenin saabaassi beste Ha'oosi wosiyaaski kamo ha'sunirnawa furonirna zagira baassoki wosi. <verse eid="ACT 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36"/>Es asus dey Giphtsiki daasta she'a baariistanawa ichma daassina diinqinewa biistera artonoy wuzne zagit acheechasir wogga baassotin zoonsi. <verse eid="ACT 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37"/>‹Daama Ha'ontiis taan kabginaasimato nitto ganeyaassin raajjunin nittok kabgunawa› yire Israelni meyak makees es musewa. <verse eid="ACT 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38"/>Zaboossi Israelni maabaraasneen ane; Siinaki aamaasta make Ha'oosi wosiyaneen ane esiisimato dey abaniisakitoneen ane feyiis Musewa. Kaani kaamaason dey ephphe innok aatiis es Musewa.<verse eid="ACT 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39"/>«Sinuntano abaniisakito barin oomtotu oomtesetetano aane ajajamosoto. Nibbesiissi dey Giphtsi wolle kerok safarsete. <verse eid="ACT 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40"/>Aaronnin dey: ‹Giphtsin innotin zoonsire kisi Museniista awu kar'namato aane aruweni sinna boor'a inno sinaasta zeemma zoonsuni ha'osikitonon innok wostowa› yisete. <verse eid="ACT 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41"/>Es kabaasik alaqani gitok koo'lo hoo'e maa'a imete. Kushubesiisi wostok dey girsete. <verse eid="ACT 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42"/>Sinuntano Ha'o baassostan oor kesi. Samaasta fa baakuraasik sagadosonek aatira imi. Esiis dey raajjuni meyaki kamo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">« ‹Nitto Israelni meyane!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">acheechasir wogga zaboossik shukti waagaasewa maa'aase taaknoso?<verse eid="ACT 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43"/>Ephpha hamtiis Molokni durkaniisewa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">Refam yiste ha'ontiisi baakurani suuraasewa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">es bar dey kushuntiisik wostera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">barik kaa'net faati ha'ontiiswa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">ta dey Baabilonni ekalok kabugtotik;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">nittotin zaguna yistera tichchenaasimatowa› yi.<verse eid="ACT 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44"/>«Inno abani meya ichma daassi zaalni durkanibesi faarwa. Es durkaniison Ha'oos barik makenaasimatonawa besinaasimatona wostees Musewa. <verse eid="ACT 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45"/>Ha'oos baasso sinaastan kalla eelsina aazabni meeni daason ephefe kabaasik Iyyasuneen ane durkaniison ephphe girsete. Dawitni neyaas kar'ananneen esta di. <verse eid="ACT 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46"/>Dawit Ha'oosi sina ulfina danne Yaqobni Ha'oos ha'una keya keer'anak shiiphe. <verse eid="ACT 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47"/>Sinuntano Ha'oosik es keyaason keer'aas Solomonwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48"/>Sinuntano zuuttambaase asiistan denalo sina Ha'oos asuni kushuk keete keesi aane diifa. Es bar dey raajjuniki kamo:<verse eid="ACT 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49"/>« ‹Samaas ta zigimuwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">han daas dey wochonaas yer'ana dimawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">eekin awune fa keyanso taak keer'atiri?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">beysa ephana keyaas dey awune faarinso?› »</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 7:49">yife Daamiis.<verse eid="ACT 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50"/>«Han baron zuutira wostees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:50">ta kushustanoso?» yifawa Ha'oos.<verse eid="ACT 7:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51"/>«Nitto eling asuni meya, nibniti taato, odontiis odonor, nitto dey nitto abani meenimato Korto Ayyanaason wonna wonna oomtetir. <verse eid="ACT 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52"/>Raajjuni meyaassin nitto abani meya kabgusonoyter oonso? Baasso ookoosa yoonon zeemme makse baassotin worsesete. Nitto dey hash han ookoosin aatire imak worseti. <verse eid="ACT 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53"/>Nitto Ha'oosi wosiyaki kamo makte tumaason ephpha taaseti. Sinuntano aane oodeti.»<verse eid="ACT 7:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isxifanosni Shu'ak Ichchere Kitu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54"/>Shonggosta diise baasso es baron odeseteyse akamanon haaresere Isxifanosniista ha'besiison karmisete. <verse eid="ACT 7:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55"/>Sinuntano Isxifanos Korto Ayyanak tuumme den sama kootkire Ha'oosi ulfinanon bi. Yesusnin dey Ha'oosi hoi'ta teshta yerefeen bi. <verse eid="ACT 7:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56"/>Estan: «Sama gachchefaan Asuni Naa Ha'oosi o'itta yerefeen biidifawungwa» yi.<verse eid="ACT 7:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57"/>Es kabaasik akama kaamak chaagete. Odobesiison ukere ek barki eelete. <verse eid="ACT 7:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58"/>Barin ephphe katamaassin kissere shu'ak ichesete. Zaalni meya dey maybesiison oodanak ephphe taamme Sawul yistefe isa na'o asuni wochoossi kunussete. <verse eid="ACT 7:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59"/>Isxifanosnin ichesefeen: «Daam Yesusno! Kaanaason neeki ephwa» yit shiiphe. <verse eid="ACT 7:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60"/>Kaa'nere dey akama kaamak: «Daamiiso han boor'besiiso baassosta faadutaatawa» yit chaagi. Es baron yinanneen orfo kiti.<verse eid="ACT 7:60"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Sawul Kiristanani Meyanon Kabgi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1"/>Sawul Isxifanos wortobaasik gire. Es kabaasik Yerusalemuk fa betekiristaniista kabugto kabi. Wosini meya baasso baassoteno oom amanynyini meya zuuttere Yuudanawa Samariyaki daa zuuttambaase asiissi siktesete. <verse eid="ACT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2"/>Shiiphok chimme fe asuni meya Isxifanosnin dugnooson kabbarsete. Barik dey akamanon waassete.<verse eid="ACT 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3"/>Sinuntano Sawul betekiristaniison tishkuk kabet feer. Keya keyaassi girifaafe arqa kiristanaasinnawa mashka kiristanaassonna zatte kisitaafe taatoni keer gedet feer.<verse eid="ACT 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Misirachchuni Kaamaas Samariyak Makte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4"/>Sikte amanynyini meya hamete hamete daassi kaambaason makset feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5"/>Filiphoos dey Samariyani katamaassi hamme Kiristoosni chowaason make. <verse eid="ACT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6"/>Showo dara dey Filiphoos makena baron odetnawa zagifena biistera artonoy wuzasonna biyefaat gasasire barin odet feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7"/>Kiina ayyanaasikito dey akama kaamak chaaget showo asuniissin keset faar. Showo laafanawa engitna farset feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8"/>Es bari boor'a es katamaassi akama gira sini.<verse eid="ACT 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9"/>Es katamaassi Simon yiste isa asu tolfata tolfatefaafe Samariyaki daraasin diinqisit feer: Dey: «Ta arkitto asuwa» iyaafe maket feer. <verse eid="ACT 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10"/>Garosatan kabgire gaymasata kar'e fe asu zuuttere: «Han asu arkitto yistera teegtefa Ha'oni hugnawa» yiset gasasire odet feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11"/>Es gasasire odesefees showo wona tolfatak baassotin diinqisit feer sinna boor'a. <verse eid="ACT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12"/>Sinuntano Filiphoos Ha'oosi taatosonnawa Yesus Kiristoosni sunaasonna makena misirachchuni kaamaasonna odesere arqaas mashkaas amanere haphuktesete. <verse eid="ACT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13"/>Tolfattu Simoonnu amanere haphuktere Filiphosneen ane isar sini. Zagtet fa diinqisewa akama biistera artonoy wuzason biire diinqet feer. <verse eid="ACT 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14"/>Yerusalemuk fe wosini meya Samariyaki daraas Ha'oosi kaamanon ephphetoosobesiison odefaat Phexirosninnawa Yohannisninna asin Samariya wossete. <verse eid="ACT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15"/>Phexirosninnawa Yohannisninna dey hamere Samariyaki asuni meya Korto Ayyana ephphetoosonek Ha'o shiiphsete. <verse eid="ACT 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16"/>Esiis dey Daamni Yesusni sunaasiktu haphuktesetetano Korto Ayyana baassosta aane kerowa. <verse eid="ACT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17"/>Estan Phexiros Yohannisna kushubesiison baassosta ta'ubesiise Korto Ayyana ephpheteesete.<verse eid="ACT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18"/>Wosini meya kushubesiison asuni meyaasta ta'iseten Korto Ayyana imtobaason biyaat Simon waaga ephpheteshshere: <verse eid="ACT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19"/>«Ta dey kushunaason ta'una asuni meya Korto Ayyana ephphetoosonek han ha'suni hugnaason taak imtiwa» yi.<verse eid="ACT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20"/>Sinuntano Phexiros: «Ha'oosi imanon waagneesik waagotak safareta boor'a waagnees neneen ane tishungwa! <verse eid="ACT 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21"/>Nibnees Ha'oosi sina mangu sinna boor'a han wostoossi girira wostota dimnewa ixane neek aafawa. <verse eid="ACT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22"/>Ese han manguneessin harmira Daamiiski woluwa. Awuzakne han nibneesi mangu safaranon feeshun unitto shiiphowa. <verse eid="ACT 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23"/>Ne suqaro koonak tuumma faatamatonawa boor'aasik taatera faatamatotu biidifawungwa» yi.<verse eid="ACT 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24"/>Simon dey: «Han makseti barissin isarnu tayista kar'noynamato nitto wolla Daamiisin taak shiiphotiwa» yi.<verse eid="ACT 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25"/>Phexiros Yohannisna zaala makserenawa Daamiisa kaamanon maksetenneen orfo showo Samariyani ke'eessi hamefaafe misirachchuni kaamaason makset Yerusalem wolle hamete.<verse eid="ACT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Filiphoos Itophiyani Jandarabaasin Haphqi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26"/>Daamiisa wosiya Filiphosnin: «Kabira Yerusalemun Gaaza katifa ichma daassiki ugna kawuda wolla hamma» yi. <verse eid="ACT 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27"/>Bar dey kabire hami. Hindake yistefa Itophiyani taatosi foononnawa waagbaasonna ha'sife isa jandaraba Itophiyani asu Ha'ok kaa'nok Yerusalem yeere feer. <verse eid="ACT 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28"/>Es jandarabaas wolle daaba hamfena kabaasik seregellata diifaat raajju Isayyasni tichaason feretit feer. <verse eid="ACT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29"/>Estan Korto Ayyanaas Filiphosnin: «Ek saragalaski tai'sera uphowa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30"/>Estan Filiphoos dey taptere ek seregellaaski hamfeen Itophiyani asus raajju Isayyasni tichaason feretifeen odaat: «Han feretifa ta bar neek galedifaroso?» yi. <verse eid="ACT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31"/>Itophiyani jandarabaas dey wolgire: «Taak kotte makoni asu foontonon aakkak taak galonirinso?» iyaat Filiphosnin: «Han seregellaasta kessa taneen ane duwa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32"/>Jandarabaas dey feretit feena tichaas ekkatu yifa: <figure style="fig" alt="Philip with the Ethiopian eunuch" file="LB00331B.tif" size="span" ref="8:32">Filipos Itiyopiyani jandarabasneen ane </figure></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">«Bar shuktok zattera hama fantune feer;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">esabaason kar'fe baasso sina shaakkife Fantusamato kaambaason aane kote.<verse eid="ACT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33"/>Salphate; dey futoni mangsuni kar'a barik aane katowa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">kaabaas han daastan kaltera tishina boor'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Han koontoosi chowanon oo makok chimnirinso?»<verse eid="ACT 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34"/>Jandarabaas dey wolgire Filiphosnin: «Raajjuus han baron ooni chowanso makenari? Basa teetnirinwa wedey oom asunirinso? Taak makaaywa» yit mamsi. <verse eid="ACT 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35"/>Filiphoos dey es tichaastan kabire Yesusni chowaason maket fa Ha'oosi kaamanon kotte make. <verse eid="ACT 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36"/>Hamere isa akani tesha kar'eten Jandarabaas: «Ese hanta aka faarwa, haphuktonak kalni wuza aambanso?» yi. [<verse eid="ACT 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37"/>Filiphoos wolgire: «Tuuma nibneesik amanefaatane haphuktok chimatawa» yi. Jandarabaas dey: «Yesus Kiristoos Ha'oni naa sinnamato amanefawungwa» yi.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Han faadaasta fa bar zeemoti Girikni tichaassi aafa. </char></note><verse eid="ACT 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38"/>Jandarabaas saragalaas yeronak ajaje. Hepobesiise yeet akaassi kerseten Filiphoos Jandarabaasin haphqi. <verse eid="ACT 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39"/>Akaassin kesefe kabaasik Daamiisa Ayyana Filiphosnin ephpha hami. Jandarabaas dey Filiphosnin esseen orfo aane biye. Giret ugunbaason hami. <verse eid="ACT 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40"/>Sinuntano Filiphoos Azaxonuk biiste. Qisariya hamme kar'ananneen aatfena katama katamaassi misirachchuni kaamanon make.<verse eid="ACT 8:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Sawul Kiristoosnik Amane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1"/>Es kabaasik Sawul Daamiisa nawoni meyanon worunak deessit maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaaski hami. <verse eid="ACT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2"/>Daamiisa ugnak zoonustefe meyanon arqasinnawa mashkasonna danfena kabaasik taar'taafe Yerusalem teshshok chimanamato Demaskoki fa Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaasikitok ticha imtonak maagni meyanon mamsi. <verse eid="ACT 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3"/>Demasko hamme kar'fena kabaasik biratobaasta den saman diinqone chaarefa palpali. <verse eid="ACT 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4"/>Es kabaasik bar daa kere gande. Estan: «Sawulno, Sawulno, awuni boor'a taan kabgidifa?» yifa kaama ode.<verse eid="ACT 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5"/>Sawul dey: «Daamiiso! Ne oonso?» yi. Bar dey wolgire: «Ta han ne kabgifata Yesuswa. <verse eid="ACT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6"/>Sinuntano hash kabira ek katamaassi hamma. Zagutak sholsuuson estak neek maksonewa.»<verse eid="ACT 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7"/>Sawulneen ane hama asuni meya kaamaason odesete. Sinuntano ooninnu aane biyoto sinna boor'a maksone wuza tishifaan shaakkisere yersete. <verse eid="ACT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8"/>Sawul dey gandena dimaastan kabi. Sinuntano aaffaason woyin biyanak aane chima. Es bari boor'a asuni meya kushubaason zatte zoonsit Demasko katama ephphe hamete. <verse eid="ACT 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9"/>Keez wona kar'ananeen aaftishu sinne muu muunoynawa ushnoyna di. <verse eid="ACT 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10"/>Es kabaasik Demaskok Hananiya yiste isa Daamiisa nawo feer. Daamiis raa'ik: «Hananiyano!» yire teege. Bar dey: «Abetwa; Daamiisob hantatu fawungwa» yit koyi. <verse eid="ACT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11"/>Daamiis dey barik ekka yi: «Kabira zeephto yistefa ugnaasik hamma. Estak Yihuda yistefe asusa keer Sawul yiste isa Terseski asusin sholowa. Hash bar shiiphotatu fewa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12"/>Sawul dey Hananiya yiste asu yeere kushubaason aaffaasta ta'fena kabaasik biyanamato raa'ik bi. <verse eid="ACT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13"/>Sinuntano Hananiya wolgire ekka yi: «Daamtaaso! Han asus Yerusalemuk feese amanynyisata akama shana katinamato ta showo asunikin odengwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14"/>Hashnu han Demaskok feese ne sunaason teegesefe baassotin zuuttambesiise asin taar'anak maagni gaanynyasakitonikin fiqadi ephiwa» <verse eid="ACT 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15"/>Daamiis dey Hananiyanik ekka yi: «Bar Aazabni meeni sina; taate meeni sinanawa Israelni daraasa sinana ta sunaason wor'ni ta korina korto kodana sinna boor'a barki hamma. <verse eid="ACT 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16"/>Ta sunaasik awune fa shana ephphetoonak feenamato ta barik ammanon besunawa» <verse eid="ACT 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17"/>Estan Hananiya hamme es bar feena keyaassi giri. Kushubaason Sawulniista ta'ire: «Ayta Sawulno! Hani yaafeen ugnaasta ammanon neek uphe Daam Yesus aafnees biyanaknawa Korto Ayyanak tuuntotakna taan neeki wosiwa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18"/>Geregere Sawulni aaffaastan i'oni gongane fa wuza zigin biyak chimi; dey kabire haphukte. <verse eid="ACT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19"/>Muu dey meere chimi. Demaskok feese nawoni meyaneen ane garo wona di.<verse eid="ACT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sawul Demaskok Assi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20"/>Geregere Sawul Demaskok: «Yesus Ha'oni Naawa» yit Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaasikitosi assu ephi. <verse eid="ACT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21"/>Ode baasso dey zuuttere diinqok: «Han asus Yerusalemuk han sunaason teegefe baassotin zuuttambesiise asin tishkit fe bartenoso? Dey hani yeenaas baassotin taar'e maagni gaanynyasakitoniki taamme imaktanoso?» yisete. <verse eid="ACT 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22"/>Sinuntano Sawul zeemotiistan daysire chimet hami. Demasko fe Ayhudni meya Yesus bar Kiristoos sinnamato kotte assubaasik maksone wuza turksit feer. <verse eid="ACT 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23"/>Showo wonaneen orfo Ayhudni meya Sawulni woruk merkesete. <verse eid="ACT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24"/>Sinuntano bar baasso mangu mekamaason ari. Baasso dey barin woruk toone waalinne bar kesfena katamaasi finynyaasi kitonon oodet feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25"/>Sinuntano basa nawoosakito wassi katamaasi shu'ni ojaasi kattosi kamo Sawulnin masasi duusire kessisete.<verse eid="ACT 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sawul Yerusalemuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26"/>Sawul Yerusalem hamme kar'e estak feese Daamiisa nawoneen ane woi'tonak shole. Sinuntano Sawul Kiristoosnin amanobaas futo sinna baassok aane bestowa sinna boor'a zuuttere digesete. <verse eid="ACT 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27"/>Sinuntano Barnabas Sawulnin wosini meyaki ephphe taamme uguntak feen Daamiis aakkak barik ammanon uphenamato; barneen dey wollenamatonawa Demaskok Daamiisa sunanon aakkak digaba foontonon assinamatona baassok make. <verse eid="ACT 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28"/>Es bari boor'a Sawul baassoneen ane feefaat Yerusalemniissi biratefaafe Daamiisa sunak dey digaba foontonon maket feer. <verse eid="ACT 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29"/>Girikni noono wollesefe Ayhudni meyaneen wollefaafe karakkaret feer. Sinuntano baasso barin woruk hooresere feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30"/>Ayni meya es baron arseteyse Qisariya ephphe hamete. Estan Terses hamanak zagisete. <verse eid="ACT 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31"/>Es kabaasik Yuudak, Galiilaknawa Samariyakna fa betekiristaniis naga dani. Daamiisin ulfinsitnawa Korto Ayyanaasik chimetna faadbaas dey daytet hami.<verse eid="ACT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiros Lidani daastanawa Iyyopheni daastana assi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32"/>Phexiros daadaassi biratet feena kabaasik Lida yiste daasta feese amanynyini meyaki hami. <verse eid="ACT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33"/>Estak dey Eeniya yiste asu nangirin wogga laafa sinne mettere kuphota kunfeen dani. <verse eid="ACT 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34"/>Phexiros dey: «Eeniyano! Yesus Kiristoos neen fatunawa; kabira kuphoneeson yiir'wa» yin Bar dey geregere kabi. <verse eid="ACT 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35"/>Lidaniissinawa Seronaneessina feese asuni meya zuuttere barin biyefaat Daamiiski wolsete. <verse eid="ACT 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36"/>Iyyopheni daastak dey Xabita yiste isa amanynyi faar. Sunbaasi kota dey Girikni noonok «Dorqa» uu. «Dorqa» uus dey «Gimuwa» uu. Bar dey wonna wonna ma'a wosto zaguk tukamni meyanon argasit faar. <verse eid="ACT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37"/>Es kabaasik bar mettera kiti. Asuni meya dey dugnooson masse segenetiista kunussete. <verse eid="ACT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38"/>Lida Iyyophek ta'a sinna boor'a Iyyophek feese nawoni meya Phexiros Lidak foobaason odeseteyse hep asuni wossere: «Adarawa taptera innoki yaafaywa» yisete. <verse eid="ACT 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39"/>Es bari boor'a Phexiros kabire wosineen ane hamme esta kar'fena kabaasik segenetiissi barin ephphe hamete. Dicha asusikito zuuttera Dorqa kaak faana kabaasik wostena wondaboosewa maamaase asin besaafa waasset faaser. <verse eid="ACT 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40"/>Sinuntano Phexiros zuuttambesiise asin keerun kisaat kaa'nere shiiphe. Ek dugnooski yerqere: «Xabitane kabuwe» yi. Bar dey aaffaason woora Phexirosnin biinaase kaanna di. <verse eid="ACT 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41"/>Bar kushubaason shongere zatte kabgi. Dicha mashkasusikitoknawa oom amanynyini meyanonna teegere nawaason kaabarereron baasso sinna tai'si. <verse eid="ACT 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42"/>Es chowaas Iyyopheki daasta zuuttambaase asiissi zi'ira arte. Showo asuni meya dey Daamiisik amanesete. <verse eid="ACT 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43"/>Phexiros Simon yiste isa wooma kaa'a asuneen ane Iyyophek showo wona di.<verse eid="ACT 9:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Phexiros Qornelewosna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1"/>Qisariya yiste daa diife sunba Qornelewos yiste isa asu feer. Bar dey Romanni meeni taatosi sikalosi fa Ixaliyani toray yistefa barissi tii meeni gaanynya. <verse eid="ACT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2"/>Bar dey basa keer feese asuni meyaneen Ha'ooson shiiphoknawa digakna esiisimato dey tukamni meyak akama ima imet feer. Wonna wonna dey Ha'ooski shiiphet feer. <verse eid="ACT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3"/>Isawa izgin sa'ati kar'fana kabaasik Ha'oni wosiya barki yaara: «Qornelewosno!» yira teegefeen ammanon raa'ik bi. <verse eid="ACT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4"/>Qornelewos Ha'oosi wosiyanon kootki biyaat nayere: «Daamiiso! Aambanso?» yi. Ha'oosi wosiya dey ekka yi: «Shiiphonesewa tukamni meyak imfata imneese Ha'oosi sina neen safaronir sinna den hamiwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5"/>Hashnu asutni meyanon ek Iyyophe wosira Phexiros yiste Simoonnin teegsuwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6"/>Bar hash dichaasi tesha fe googo kaa'fe Simonni keer irba sinne diifewa.» <verse eid="ACT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7"/>Qornelewosnik han wosiyaason make Ha'oosi wosiya kessa hamnanneen orfo wostinynyabasakitonisin heppinnawa Qornelewos ha'sifena baassossin Ha'ooson digefe isa meyataar'oninna teegere <verse eid="ACT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8"/>Zuuttambaase asin baassok makenanneen orfo baassotin Iyyophe wosi. <verse eid="ACT 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9"/>Wonotiri wono wostere hama asuni meya katamaaski tai'sesefe kabaasik issun sa'atik Phexiros Ha'o shiiphonak segenetiista kesi. <verse eid="ACT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10"/>Es kabaasik Phexiros maktere muu muunak shole. Muu barik hoorefeen bar shaakkire diifaat raa'i bi. <verse eid="ACT 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11"/>Biina raa'iis dey samaas gachchefaan isa inya yinune fa wuza samaasi acheech fashbaasta oottera daasta kerefeen bi. <verse eid="ACT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12"/>Es yinusta dey acheech wochobare yere kaabare yere wuza wochoba foonto daasta nibbaasik zayifa testoosewa den samaastak fulifa kasaasikitone faaser. <verse eid="ACT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13"/>Es kabaasik: «phexiros Kabira han barikitonon shukka muwa» yifa kaama ode. <verse eid="ACT 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14"/>Sinuntano Phexiros: «Daamiiso! Aafawa sinanawuza. Ta kayma sinnoy wuza wedey kiina wuza maara aane biyutwa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15"/>Dey: «Ha'oos kayimsina baron ne kiinawa utak aane sholsifawa» yifa kaamaas hepsa barki ya. <verse eid="ACT 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16"/>Es bar dey keeza wolla maktenanneen orfo es erbeesne fa wuzaas geregere wolla den sama oottera hami. <verse eid="ACT 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17"/>Phexiros biina raa'iisi kota «Awutaaso?» yit nibbaassi safarefeen; Qornelewos wosina asuni meya Simonni keyaason sholere danne yeesere keyaasi finynyita yersefeer. <verse eid="ACT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18"/>Teegere dey «Phexiros» yiste Simon irba sinne feenaas hantanoso?. <verse eid="ACT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19"/>Phexiros raa'iisi chowanon safaret feen Korto Ayyanaas barik ekka yi: «Ese keez asu neen sholsedifewa. <verse eid="ACT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20"/>Baassotin tatu wosir sinna boor'a ek hang unoy kabira baassoneen aane hamma.» <verse eid="ACT 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21"/>Phexiros kerere: «Sholsefeti asus tawa. Yaati chowaas aambanso?» yi. <verse eid="ACT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22"/>Baasso dey: «Tii meya taar'oni meyanon ha'sife Qornelewos yistefe barkintu wostera yaaniwa. Bar dey Ayhudni daraas zuuttere barin ulfinsina Ha'ooson dige ma'a asuwa. Neen barki keer teegere ne maketa baron odonak korto Ha'oni wosiyaas barik makewa» yisete. <verse eid="ACT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23"/>Phexiros dey es wostere ye asuni meyanon keer gedde irbasire ha'sone dima dey shiiphere ha'si. Hepsinari wono kabire baassoneen ane hami. Iyyophek feese isa isa ayni meya barneen ane hamete. <verse eid="ACT 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24"/>Wonotiri wono Kesariya kar'ete. Qornelewos dey basa koonisinnawa tai'so zomobaasinna asin zuutire teegere baassoneen ane oodet feer. <verse eid="ACT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25"/>Phexiros keer girifena kabaasik Qornelewos barki tai'sere wochobaasi kaa'ne. <verse eid="ACT 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26"/>Sinuntano Phexiros: «Kabuwa ta dey neyiisimato asuwa» yit kabgi. <verse eid="ACT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27"/>Phexiros barin wolumsit ane keer girifena kabaasik showo asuni meya zuuttere feeseten bi. <verse eid="ACT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28"/>Baassok dey ekka yi: «Isa Ayhudni meeni asu oom Aazabni meeni asuneen ane isar sinne foonak wedey keebaasi girunoynamato inno tumaasik aane sholsifa sinnamato nitto teetnitisiknu arsetirwa. Sinuntano ta ooninnu kiin wedey kayim unoynamato Ha'oos taak ammanon makewa. <verse eid="ACT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29"/>Es bari boor'a taaki wosifeti kabaasik ek hang unoytu kabira yaanwa. Ese awuni boor'a taan teegetimato arunak sholefawungwa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30"/>Qornelewos dey ekka yi: «Acheech wonaneen sinak han izgin sa'atiistak keenaassi shiiphefana diinqone isa chaaret yere maama mayo asu yeere sinna yere. <verse eid="ACT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31"/>Ekka dey yi: ‹Qornelewosno! Ha'oos shiiphoneeson odewa. Tukamni meyak imfata imnees safartewa. <verse eid="ACT 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32"/>Ese ek Iyyophe wosini meyanon wosira Phexiros yistefe Simoonin teegowa. Bar baarisi tesha fe googo kaa'fe Simonni keer irba sinne diifewa› <verse eid="ACT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33"/>Estan ta dey geregere neeki wosini meyanon wosingwa. Ne dey yoonesik ma'arontu zagitwa. Ese inno zuuttamniise asik Ha'oos makotak ajajena baron zuutira odonikna Ha'oosi sina zuuttera faaniwa.»<verse eid="ACT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiros Wollena Wolla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34"/>Phexiros dey ekka yit mako ephi: «Futoosik Ha'oos ooninnu aane korifa sinnamato aringwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35"/>Sinuntano aaffa daani asunu sinfenak Ha'ooson digefe barinnawa futo sina chowaason zagife asusinna Ha'oos shunarwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36"/>Ha'oos Israelni daraasik kaambaason wosubaas artowa. Asu zuuttambaase asi Daam sina Yesusniki kamo nagaason maket yaas Ha'ooswa. <verse eid="ACT 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37"/>Yohannisni haphquni chowaason makena wonaastan kabira Galiilan hamma Yuudani daasta kar'a sina wuzason arsedifetiwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38"/>Dey Ha'oos Naaziretki Yesusnin Korto Ayyanak muudnamatonawa hugna barik imnamatona arsedifetiwa. Ha'oos dey barneen ane faana boor'a ma'a wuzason zagitnawa Daabulos ephna baassotin zuutire fatit feer. <verse eid="ACT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39"/>Yuudani daastanawa Yerusalemni katamaassina bar zagina chowaasik inno zuuttamniise zaalwa. Sinuntano asuni meya barin i'ota suutere worsete. <verse eid="ACT 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40"/>Sinuntano Ha'oos keezsinari wono kitun kabira ammanon bestonak zagi. <verse eid="ACT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41"/>Ammanon bestenaas dey zeemme Ha'o korina baassoktano dara zuuttambaase asiktawa. Bar kitun kabinanneen orfo barneen ane meere usha inno zaalwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42"/>Han baron zuutira daraasik makonik bar hayewni meyaastanawa kituni meyaastana mangsu kar'anak Ha'oos barin taassinaas bar sinbaason zaala makonik bar innotin ajaje. <verse eid="ACT 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43"/>Barik amanefe bar zuuttambaase sunbaasik boor'ani feeshun uuson ephphetoosonemato raajjuni meya zuuttere zaala maksetewa.»<verse eid="ACT 10:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aazabni Meya Amanere Korto Ayyanaason Ephpheteesete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44"/>Phexiros es baron makefeen kaambaason ode baasso zuuttambesiise asiista Korto Ayyanaas kere. <verse eid="ACT 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45"/>Phexirosneen ane yeese haarko kuni Ayhudni amanynyini meya Aazabni meyanu Korto Ayyanaason ephphetoosobesiisik diinqesete. <verse eid="ACT 10:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46"/>Aazabni meyak Korto Ayyanaas imtenamato arsetees baasso ooma noonok wolumsefeennawa Ha'ooson galattesefenna odesete boor'awa. Es kabaasik Phexiros: <verse eid="ACT 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47"/>«Han asuni meya innoosimato Korto Ayyanaason ephpheteesetewa. Eekan baasso akak haphuktosonoytemato kalnir oonso?» yi. <verse eid="ACT 10:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48"/>Estan Yesus Kiristoosni sunaasik haphuktosonek ajaje. Esseen orfo Phexiros garo wonanon baassoneen ane foonak shiiphsete.<verse eid="ACT 10:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Phexiros Aazabni Meyaki Awuniron Hamnamato Make</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1"/>Yuudak feese wosini meenawa ayni meena Aazabni meya Ha'oosi kaamanon ephpheteesetemato odesete. <verse eid="ACT 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2"/>Phexiros Yerusalem wolle yeefena kabaasik haarko kunu sholsu sinnamato amanesefe Ayhudni meeni kiristanani meya Phexirosnin: <verse eid="ACT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3"/>«Awuni boor'a haarko kununoy asuni meeni keer girira baassoneen ane muu maadifatarso?» yit wee'esete. <verse eid="ACT 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4"/>Sinuntano Phexiros ekka yit isarba isarbaasik zuuttambaase asin kotte baassok make: <verse eid="ACT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5"/>«Ta Iyyopheni katamaassi Ha'oni shiiphota faana raa'i biin. Es biina raa'iis dey inya yinuni maamane fa wuza acheech fashbaastan oottera den saman ta faana dimaasta keredifeen biin. <verse eid="ACT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6"/>Es baron kootkira biifana es yinuni maamaasta acheech wochobare yeere kaabare yere wuza buur'uni gonyo, nibbak daasta zayifa testoosewa samaastaki fulifa kasaase asin biin. <verse eid="ACT 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7"/>‹Phexirosno! Kabira han baron shukka muwa› yifa kaama oden. <verse eid="ACT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8"/>Sinuntano Daamiiso! Taak aafawa sinanawuza; Ta kiina wuza wedey zina wuza noononasi maara aane biyutwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9"/>Hepsa dey: ‹Ha'oos kayma zagina baron ne kiinawa utak aane sholsifawa› yifa kaamaason den saman oden. <verse eid="ACT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10"/>Es bar dey keeza wolla sinnanneen orfo es maamane fa wuzaas zuuttambaase wolla den sama oottera hami. <verse eid="ACT 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11"/>Es kabaasik Qisariyan keez asu taaki wostere ta faana keyaasi yeesete. <verse eid="ACT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12"/>Isaronnu ek hang unoy baassoneen hamanak Korto Ayyanaas taak make. Han issun ayni meya dey taneen anetu feesete. Baassoneen ane dey Qornolosni keer girini. <verse eid="ACT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13"/>Bar dey Ha'oni wosiya barki keer girira yeere feen biinamatonawa ‹Ek Iyyophe asunin wosira Phexiros yistefe Simoonnin teegsuwa, bar dey <verse eid="ACT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14"/>Yeere neenawa ne keer feese asuni meena zuuttere farusone kaama neek makonawa› yit barik makenamato innok make. <verse eid="ACT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15"/>Ta dey makefana kabaasik Korto Ayyanaas zeemma innoosta kerenaasimato baassosta dey kere. <verse eid="ACT 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16"/>Es kabaasik: ‹Yohannis akaktu haphqiwa. Sinuntano nitto Korto Ayyanaktu haphuktotiwa› yit Daamiis makena kaamaason yaadaten. <verse eid="ACT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17"/>Inno Daamni Yesus Kiristoosnin amanefeni kabaasik Ha'oos innok imna es imaason baassok dey imnanneen eekan Ha'ooson kalak chimnir ta oonso?» <verse eid="ACT 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18"/>Baasso dey es baron odeseteyse ephphe maksone wuza turuksefaat shaakkisete. «Ese Ha'oos Aazabni meya gaddo kaasi wolsonek baassotin zaguni boor'aassin harmiyaason baassok imiwa» uuk Ha'ooson galattesete.<verse eid="ACT 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amanynyini Meya Ansokiyak «Kiristana» Yistere Teegtesete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19"/>Isxifanos shu'ak ichchere kitina kabaasik kar'a shanaasik sikte amanynyini meya Fiinqe, Kophphiros; hamma Ansokiya kar'ana kabaneen hamete. Ha'oosi kaamanon Ayhudni meyatano oom asuni meyak aane maksoto. <verse eid="ACT 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20"/>Sinuntano Koppirosunnawa Kerenanna yeese isa isa amanynyini meya Ansokiya hamefe kabaasik Girikni meyakneen Daam Yesusni ma'a odunon maksete. <verse eid="ACT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21"/>Daamiis dey hugnabaasik baassotin argasit feer. Showo asuni meya dey amanere Daamiiski wolsete. <verse eid="ACT 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22"/>Yerusalemuk fa betekiristaniis es baron odenayse Barnabasnin Ansokiya wosi. <verse eid="ACT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23"/>Bar dey hamme Ha'oos otumbaason darabaasik aakkak imnamato biinayse gire. Zuuttambesiise tuuma nibak amanere Daamiisik chimme yersonek kiiti. <verse eid="ACT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24"/>Esiis dey Barnabas Korto Ayyanaknawa amantokna tuumme fe ma'a asu sinna boor'a faadbesi showo asuni meya Daamiiski wolsete. <verse eid="ACT 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25"/>Esseen orfo Barnabas Sawulnin sholonak Terses hami. <verse eid="ACT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26"/>Dannaayse ek Ansokiya ephphe hami. Hepobesiise isa wogga betekiristaniisneen ane isarik showo asuni meyanon assisete. Es wonaastaneen kabira nawoni meya: «Kiristana» yistere teegtesete. <verse eid="ACT 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27"/>Es kabaasik isa isa raajjuni meya Yerusalemun kabire Ansokiya hamete. <verse eid="ACT 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28"/>Baasso ganeyaassin isaas: «Agabos» yistefe bar kabire daa zuuttambaase asiissi akama maka sinanamato Korto Ayyanaas maken raaji make. Es bar dey sinnaas Kelawudos Keesarni taato sinna neyaasikwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29"/>Es bari boor'a Ansokiyak feesefe amanynyini meya Yuudak feese ayiisakitonik sinni argasu isa isarbesiise chimetemato waaga kissere baassok imtonak wollere buggisete. <verse eid="ACT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30"/>Es argasuni waagaason dey Barnabasniknawa Sawulnikna Betekiristaniisi kur'uni meyak wosisete.<verse eid="ACT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Amanynyini Meyaasta Kar'a Akama Shana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1"/>Es neyaasik Herodis yistefe taatoos isa isa amanynyini meyanon kabgu ephi. <verse eid="ACT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2"/>Yohannisni ay Yaqobnin siifok wortonak zagi. <verse eid="ACT 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3"/>Es wuzaas Ayhudni meyanon girsinamato biinayse Phexirosnin dey ootire taati. Es bar sinnaas Ayhudni meya kixxani heeboos ulfintona wonaasikitosiwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4"/>Phexirosnin ootinanneen orfo taatoni keer gedi. Ayhudni faasikani heeboos aatnanneen orfo daraasa sina tai'sunanneen acheech acheech sinfaafe oodonek acheech meya taar'oni meyak aatire imi. <verse eid="ACT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5"/>Estan Phexiros taatoni keyaassi oodtet feer. Sinuntano betekiristaniis zaggira basa chowaasik Ha'ooski shiiphet faar.<verse eid="ACT 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ha'oni Wosiya Phexirosnin Taatoni Keerun Kisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6"/>Wonotiri wono Herodis Phexirosnin daraasik tai'sunak hoorere feen es waalaasik Phexiros hep shashsharak taatere hep meya taar'oni meeni ganesi kunfer. Oom tasoosakito taatoni keyaasi finynyanon oodet feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7"/>Es kabaasik Daamiisa wosiya ammanon beste. Taatoni keyaassi dey chaarefaas chaare. Ha'oosi wosiya Phexirosni teshason ta'uk nuskira: «Taptera kabuwa» yi. Es kabaasik shashsharaas kushubaassin zigi. <verse eid="ACT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8"/>Ha'oosi wosiya dey: «Maamneeson mayya chaa'maneeson yer'wa» yi. Phexiros dey Ha'oosi wosiya maktenaasimato zagi. Estan Ha'oosi wosiyaas: «Wor'a maamneeson mayya taneen ane yowa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9"/>Phexiros dey kesse barneen ane hami. Sinuntano raa'i biidifeenne faar sinnatu barik bestetano Ha'oosi wosiyaas zagina bar amma sinna barik aane bestowa. <verse eid="ACT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10"/>Tesuniisewa hepsani tasoosinna aatere ek katamaassi taamfa bittani gamalaaski kar'ete. Gamalaas dey teetbak gachchen baasso dey kesere isa garo ugnak hamete. Diinqok Ha'oosi wosiya Phexirosnistan oor kessa hami. <verse eid="ACT 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11"/>Phexiros nibbaassi wolle: «Daamiis wosibaason wosire Herodisni kushuussinnawa Ayhud tayista safarena chowaassinna kisinamato hash aringwa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12"/>Es baro arinanneen orfo showo asuni meya isarik zuuttesere shiiphset feesete Marqos yiste Yohannisni into Maaramini keer hami. <verse eid="ACT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13"/>Esta kar'e keyaasi gamalanon ki'in Roda yiste isa keeri wostinynya oo sinnamato gasasuk gamalaaski tai'se. <verse eid="ACT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14"/>Phexirosni kaama sinbaaso araat girabaasi aatamtan kabira gamalaason gachnoy orfo wolla eella: «Phexiros finynyi yerefe» yira make. <verse eid="ACT 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15"/>Asuni meya dey: «Nifasetwe, aakka ekka sinana» yisete. Sinuntano bar futo sinbaaso gasasira make. Baasso wolgire: «Basa wosiyaaswa» yisete. <verse eid="ACT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16"/>Phexiros tusi tusire gamalaason ki'i. Baasso gamalaason gachche biyaat diinqesete. <verse eid="ACT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17"/>Bar shaakkusonek zagaat Daamiis taatoni keerun aakkak barin kisinamato make. Estan: «Ta kesaason Yaqobniknawa ayiisakitonikna makoti» iyaat ooma dima hami. <verse eid="ACT 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18"/>Wono e'sotirik meya taar'osakito: «Phexiros ay hamiso» yiset ganebesiissi inya shorko kabi. <verse eid="ACT 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19"/>Herodis Phexirosnin sholere turkifaat tasoni meyanon tu'nire mamsinanneen orfo wortosonek ajaje. Esseen orfo Herodis Yuudan Qisariya hamme esta di.<verse eid="ACT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Herodisni Kitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20"/>Herodis Tiroskinawa Sidonakina fe asuni meyaneen faassere feer. Daabesiis muu danfanaay taatoosa ha'suussin sinna boor'a taatoosa erasho sina Bilastoosnikin argasuni mekama dannanneen orfo isarik taatoosneen ane ganok mamsi. <verse eid="ACT 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21"/>Ootte wonaasta Herodis taatoni mayaason mayye taatoni zigimuusta diifaat daraasik wolle. <verse eid="ACT 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22"/>Daraas dey: «Han bar Ha'oni kaamatano asuni kaamatawa» yit chaagete. <verse eid="ACT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23"/>Herodis Ha'oosik ulfina ima beyna boor'a Daamiisa wosiya geregere ichin towak maastere kiti. <verse eid="ACT 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24"/>Sinuntano Ha'oosi kaama dichetnawa tagitna hami. <verse eid="ACT 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25"/>Barnabasnawa Sawulna wostobesiison koi'sire Yerusalemun wolsete. Marqos yistefe Yohannisnin zoonsire yeesete.<verse eid="ACT 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Barnabasnawa Sawulna Wostere Hamete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1"/>Ansokiya fa betekiristaniissi raajjuni meenawa kaambaasi assinynyana feeseter. Baasso dey Barnabas, kara yistefe Simon, Kerenaki Lukiyos, acheechsa daason ha'sife Herodisni zomo Minahenawa Sawulna feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2"/>Es baasso Daamiisik wostetnawa soomere shiiphsetna feeseten Korto Ayyana: «Barnabasnawa Sawulna asin ta teegena wostoosik oor kisuti» yi. <verse eid="ACT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3"/>Baasso soomere shiiphsefaat kushubesiison baassosta ta'ire shiiphsetenneen orfo gafuksete.<verse eid="ACT 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Barnabasnawa Sawulna Qophirosuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4"/>Barnabasnawa Sawulna dey Korto Ayyanaas wosin ek Selewukiya kessete. Estan dey Merkebik Kophphiros kessete. <verse eid="ACT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5"/>Silmanak feesete kabaasik Ha'oosi kaamanon Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi maksete. Yohannis dey baassotin argasit feer. <verse eid="ACT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6"/>Kophphiros yistefa akak birato daason finere Paafu kar'efe kabaasik Beriyasus yiste isa Ayhudawi sina tolfattunin danete; bar dey eshinynya raajju. <verse eid="ACT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7"/>Bar dey Sergiyos Phawulos yiste daason ha'sife isa aru asusneen anetu feefe. Es daa ha'sife asus Ha'oni kaama odonak sholere Barnabasninnawa Sawulninna barki teegsi. <verse eid="ACT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8"/>Sinuntano sunbaasi kota Helmas sina tolfattuus daason ha'sife asus amanonoynamato sholefaat baassotin tugga'e. <verse eid="ACT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9"/>Phawulos sinfe Sawul Korto Ayyanak tuumme kootki biyaat: <verse eid="ACT 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10"/>«Ne ma'a wuzaasi guma! Eshnewa mangune neyissi tuumna Sexanni naa. Zeephto Daamiisa ugnanon elingsuuson aafanoso beyata wuza? <verse eid="ACT 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11"/>Daamiisa kushu neen ke'in aaftishu sinatar. Garo wonniron awuni chaarefa aafa biyatawuza» yi. Geregere ki'nanewa talumne basaasta kere. Kushubaason ephphe zoonsuni asuni sholok ek hang kuti. <verse eid="ACT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12"/>Daason ha'sife asus sina chowaason biyaat Daamiisa aruno diinqok amane.<verse eid="ACT 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Barnabasnawa Phawulosna Phirisiyak Fa Antsokiya Hamete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13"/>Phawulosnawa zomobaasakitona Phafun kabsere Pinifiliya fa Pergen hamete. Estan Yohannis baassostan oor kesse wolle Yerusalem hami. <verse eid="ACT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14"/>Sinuntano baasso Pergenun kabsere Pisidiya fa Ansokiya hamete. Baysani wonaasik Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi girsere diisete. <verse eid="ACT 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15"/>Museni tumaasewa raajjuni meeni tichaase ferettenanneen orfo Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaason ha'sife baasso: «Ayni meeno; daraasi merkoni kaama nittoki faafaanane makotiwa» yit wossete. <verse eid="ACT 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16"/>Phawulos daakun kabire kushuni besuk: «Israelni asuni meyane, Ha'ooson digefe nitto zuuttera odotiwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17"/>Han Israelni daraasa Ha'o abaniisakitonin kori. Giphtsini daasta feeseten dey den teggi. Woribaasi hugnak estan kisi. <verse eid="ACT 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18"/>Acheechasir wogga ichma daassik baassotin faki. <verse eid="ACT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19"/>Kene'aki daasta fa naafun taatoosikitonon tishkaat daabesiison bari daraas warasonak zagi. <verse eid="ACT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20"/>Es bar zuuttera acheech tiirewa uuchasire woggaassiktu ko'i. Esseen orfo raajju Samuelniista kar'ananneen ha'suni erashe meyanon imi. <verse eid="ACT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21"/>Estan daraas taato baassosta taattonak shiiphsete. Ha'oos dey Biniyamni keenaassin Qiisni naa Sawulni imin acheechasir wogga baassotin ha'si. <verse eid="ACT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22"/>Sawulni kessinanneen orfo Dawitnin baassok taassi. Barin dey: ‹Ta nibane feernawa ta sholenaason zuutire zaguni Isseyni naa Dawitnin daningwa› yi. <verse eid="ACT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23"/>Ha'o girina teyyaasimato es asusa zaltan fatir sina Yesusnin Israelik teshshe. <verse eid="ACT 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24"/>Yesus yoonoyfeen zeemma Yohannis Israelni dara zuuttere harmire haphuktosonek makere feer. <verse eid="ACT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25"/>Yohannis wosibaason koi'sinaase: ‹Ta oo sinna nittok bestefanso? Ta bartewa. Sinuntano orgobaasi chaa'mani taar'anonnu kotak chimnoynar taneen orfo yoonirwa› yit feer. <verse eid="ACT 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26"/>Abrahamni zalaassin koonte ay sina nittonawa inno ganeyaassi Ha'ooson digefe baasso zuuttambesiise asik han faruni kaama woste. <verse eid="ACT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27"/>Sinuntano Yerusalemki asuni meenewa baassotin ha'sife baassotna Yesusnin aane arsoto. Beysa beysani wonaasik ferettefa raajjuni meeni tichaasi kaama ko'unak basaasta mangsu kar'esete. <verse eid="ACT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28"/>Barin kituta katuni isa mangsune turuksefeknu Pilatos kituni mangsu basaasta kar'anak shiiphsete. <verse eid="ACT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29"/>Barik tichche baron zuutire ko'issetenneen orfo mesqelistan kessisere moogaassi kabbarsete. <verse eid="ACT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30"/>Sinuntano Ha'o barin kitun kabgi. <verse eid="ACT 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31"/>Galiilan kabsere Yerusalem kar'ananneen barneen ane yeese baassok showo wona biiste. Baasso dey hash daraasa sina zaalwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32"/>Inno dey Ha'o abani meyak girina teyyani kaamaason nittok makeni. <verse eid="ACT 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33"/>Yesusni kitun kabgubaasik baassok girina teyyani kaamaason naanggotbesi sina innok zagi. Esiis dey hepsa gaamni tichaassi ekka yistera tichchera faar:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">« ‹Ne taak naatawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">Ta neen hash hawung koonin.›<verse eid="ACT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34"/>Bar dey aane kuupe sinnamatonawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:34">Ha'oos kitun kabgubaasonna gasasuk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:34">‹Korto amanamtera fa eebbaason;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:34">Dawitnik girina abdiison nittok imana› yi.<verse eid="ACT 13:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35"/>«Esiisimato ooma dimta:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">« ‹Kortonees kuupanak aafa zagutawuza› yifawa.<verse eid="ACT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36"/>«Dawit basa neyaasik Ha'oosi safaranon wostenanneen orfo kiti. Ababaasakitoneen kabbarte; ashbaas dey kuupi. <verse eid="ACT 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37"/>Sinuntano Ha'o kitun kabgina bar aane kuupe. <verse eid="ACT 13:37"/><verse number="38-39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38-39"/>Ese aytaasakitono; boor'ni fakiya bestefanaas Yesusniki kamo sinbaas nittok makte baron aruti. Barik amanefe bar zuuttere Museni tumaasik danonoyna ookooson danana. <verse eid="ACT 13:38-39"/><verse number="40-41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40-41"/>Es bari boor'a raajjuni meyaki kamo: ‹Kanyfe nitto biitiwa; diinqoti, tishuti, oonu nittok makefenak amanonoyti wosto nitto neyaasik wostona› » yisete bar kar'noynamato teetnitiison aruti. <verse eid="ACT 13:40-41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42"/>Phawulosnawa Barnabasna Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassin kesefe kabaasik asuni meya es wuzason yooni beysani wonaasik hepsi wolle maksonek shiiphsete. <verse eid="ACT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43"/>Zuuttoos boktenanneen orfo showo Ayhudni meenawa amanok baassossi woi'tere Ha'o shiiphsefe asuni meena Phawulosnawa Barnabasna asi orfoose hamete. Basakito dey Ha'oosi otmak chimme foosonek mekama ime. <verse eid="ACT 13:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44"/>Hepsani beysani wonaasik katamaassiki daraasasin arki sinar Ha'oosi kaamanon odok zuuttesete. <verse eid="ACT 13:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45"/>Ayhudni meya akam darani biyeteese koonesete. Phawulosni wollaason tugga'ok me'esete. <verse eid="ACT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46"/>Sinuntano Phawulosnawa Barnabasna diga foontonon: «Ha'oosi kaama zeemma nittok maktonak sholsuwa. Sinuntano nitto kashshiseti. Dey koi'ba foonto kaa nittok sholsunoynamato teetnitiista mangsu kar'eti boor'a inno Aazabni meyaki hamnirwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47"/>Daamiis kaambaassi: ‹Faruni kaamaason daasi diltaneen katutak Aazabni meyakneen chaarefa zaginwa› yire innotin ajaje» yisete. <verse eid="ACT 13:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48"/>Aazabni meya es baron odeseteyse girsere Daamiisa kaamak ulfina imesete. Koi'ba foonto kaak hoore baasso zuuttere amanesete. <verse eid="ACT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49"/>Daamiisa kaama es biratoosta fa daa zuuttambaase asiista zi'i. <verse eid="ACT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50"/>Sinuntano Ayhudni meya Ha'ooson shiiphok dey ulfinto mashka meyanonnawa katamaassi feese otum asuni meyanonna Phawulosniistanawa Barnabasniistana kabugsere daabesiistan kalle kissete. <verse eid="ACT 13:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51"/>Phawulosnawa Barnabasna wochobesiistaki tulonon tebaat Iqoniyon hamete. <verse eid="ACT 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52"/>Amane baasso dey giraknawa Korto Ayyanakna tuumesete.<verse eid="ACT 13:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawulosnawa Barnabasna Ikoniyonuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1"/>Ikoniyonuk Phawulosnawa Barnabasna hazozotiisimato Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi girsere mai'sire maksete boor'a Ayhudniissinnawa Girikniissinna akam showo asu amanesete. <verse eid="ACT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2"/>Sinuntano amanonoy Ayhudni meya Aazabni meyanon kabugsere ayni meyanon oomtosonek zagsete. <verse eid="ACT 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3"/>Phawulosnawa Barnabasna Daamiisa chowanon diga foontonon makset showo wona Ikoniyon diisete. Daamiis dey maksete Ha'oosi otumni kaamanon biistera artonoy besoknawa diinqi wostokna ammanon besit feer. <verse eid="ACT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4"/>Katamaassi fe daraas heppik bagtere isa kunuus Ayhudni meyaneen, isa kunuus dey wosini meyaneen sini. <verse eid="ACT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5"/>Es kabaasik Aazabni meenawa Ayhudnin ha'sife baassotna isarik sinere wosini meyanon shu'ak ichak sholsete. <verse eid="ACT 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6"/>Baasso es baron arseteese Likoniyani awurajaassi faase Listira, Darbe yistefa katamaasikitosinawa biratobaastana shaatere hamete. <verse eid="ACT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7"/>Estak Ha'oosi kaamanon maksete.<verse eid="ACT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulosnawa Barnabasna Listiranewa Darbene Asiissi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8"/>Listirak koontenanneen kutire biinoy wochoba laafa asu feer. <verse eid="ACT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9"/>Es asus Phawulosni wollaason odedifer. Phawulos kootkire barki biyaat farunak amantoba foobaason araat akama kaamak: <verse eid="ACT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10"/>«Kabira wochoneesik yerowa» yin geregere fillere kabire taarire kuti. <verse eid="ACT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11"/>Daraas Phawulos zagina chowaason biyeteyse Likaoniyawini meeni kaamak: «ha'oosikito asune faar sinna inno ganeyaassi kerewa!» yit chaagete. <verse eid="ACT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12"/>Barnabasnin dey Diya yisete. Arkiro makedifer Phawulos sinna boor'a Hermen yisete. <verse eid="ACT 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13"/>Katamaasi gerakalota fa Diyani betemeqdesiisi maag omorunewa taato fur'ane ephphe katamaasi finynyita daraasneen ane baassok maa'a imak shole. <verse eid="ACT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14"/>Wosini meya Barnabasnawa Phawulosna es baron odeseteyse maybesiison karasisere daraasa ganesi eelesete. Kaambesiison teggisere: <verse eid="ACT 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15"/>«Nitto han baron awagan ekka zagidifetirinso? Inno nittone fe asuwa. Nitto han foonto wuzaassin kessa samaason, daason, akasewa sir kuni testooson zuutira tesi hayewa Ha'ooski wolutik kaambaason nittok makefeniwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16"/>Ha'oos aata neyaassi darani meya zuuttere teetbesiri ugnak hamonek shaakkira beyi. <verse eid="ACT 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17"/>Sinuntano bar zaalbaason makefa ma'a wostooson wosto aane beya; saman iro ichanak zagi; maaraason baassok imi; muuknawa girakna nibbesiison gawusi» yisete. <verse eid="ACT 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18"/>Es baron zuutire maksefeknu akama kaboktu darani meya maa'a baassok imonoytemato kalete.<verse eid="ACT 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19"/>Sinuntano Ayhudni meya Ansokiyannawa Ikoniyonna yeesere daraasin eeshshisere Phawulosnin shu'ak ichosone zagsete. Estan kitiwa iyaat bokosire katamaassin gerakalo kissete. <verse eid="ACT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20"/>Sinuntano nawoni meya ganeya gedde feeseten kabire katamaassi giri. Wonotirik Barnabasneen ane Derben hami.<verse eid="ACT 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulosnawa Barnabasna Soriya Fa Ansokiya Wolsete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21"/>Phawulosnawa Barnabasna Derbenuk Ha'oosi kaamanon maksere showo asunin amansisetenneen orfo Listiranewa Ikonoyonne asiissi aatte Pisidiya fa Ansokiya hamete. <verse eid="ACT 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22"/>Nawoni meyanon zagguk, Ha'oosik chimme foosonek merkeset: «Ha'oosi taatosi girunik showo shana ephphatoonik sholsifa» yit assisete. <verse eid="ACT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23"/>Betekiristaniisikitosi kur'uni meyanon korire taassisetenneen orfo soomere shiiphsefaat amanesete Daamiisik adara imete. <verse eid="ACT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24"/>Pisidiya kamo aatere Pinifiliya yeesete. <verse eid="ACT 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25"/>Pergamonuk kaambaason maksetenneen orfo Ataliya kersete. <verse eid="ACT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26"/>Estak wostesete wostooson Ha'oosi otmak koi'sisere baassok adara ima Ansokiya Merkebik hamete. <verse eid="ACT 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27"/>Hamme kar'e betekiristaniissi fe amanynyi meyanon zuutire Ha'o baassoneen faafaat zagina baron zuuttambaase asinnawa Aazabni meya dey faruni ugna gachchobaason maksete. <verse eid="ACT 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28"/>Nawoni meyaneen ane showo wona esta diisete.<verse eid="ACT 14:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalemuk Zagte Zuutto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1"/>Isa isa asuni meya Yuudan Ansokiya hamere: «Museni tumaasimato haarko kunu beyfaatine farutik aafa chimati wuza» yiset ayni meyanon assuk jammarsete. <verse eid="ACT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2"/>Es barik Phawulosnawa Barnabasna baassoneen ane akama chima kirikkiri zagsete. Estan Phawulosnawa Barnabasna Antsokiyak feese oom amanynyini meyaneen sinere Yerusalem hamere es chowaason wosini meyaknawa kur'uni meyakna maksonek zagte. <verse eid="ACT 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3"/>Betekiristaniis ugunbesiisik argasseten Aazabni meeni Ha'oki wolunon makset Feenqenewa Samariyane asiissi aatesete. Ode ayni meya zuuttesere girsete. <verse eid="ACT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4"/>Yerusalem kar'esefe kabaasik betekiristaniis, wosini meenewa kur'uni meene sinne ephete. Baasso dey Ha'o baassoneen sinna wostena wostooson zuutire maksete. <verse eid="ACT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5"/>Ferisawini keenaassin amane baasso isa isaas kabsere: «Aazabni meya haarko kunosoneknawa Museni tumaasi oodonekna zagu sholsuwa» yisete.<verse eid="ACT 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6"/>Wosini meenewa kur'uni meena es chowaason tu'nusonek zuuttesete. <verse eid="ACT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7"/>Akamanon karakkarsetenneen orfo Phexiros kabire baassok: «Ayni meyane; Ha'o showo wonaneen sinak nitto ganeyaassin taan korira Aazabni meya Ha'oosi kaamanon taakin odere amanosonek zagubaason arsefetiwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8"/>Asusa nibanon arifa Ha'oos Korto Ayyananon innok imnaasimato baassok dey imma baassotin ephpha toobaason besi. <verse eid="ACT 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9"/>Nibbesiison amantok kaynina boor'a baassotnawa innotna asi ganeyaassi aane dilowa. <verse eid="ACT 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10"/>Ese abaniisakitonawa innotna wor'ak chimnoyni waanjooson nawoni meeni ogogta wossuk hash awuni boor'a Ha'ooson shimsidifetirinso? <verse eid="ACT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11"/>Innonu faruniis baassosimato Daamni Yesusni otmaasik amanokwa» yi.<verse eid="ACT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12"/>Estan daraas zuuttere shaakki. Barnabasnawa Phawulosna Ha'o baassoki kamo Aazabni meeni ganeyasi zagina biistera artonoy diinqi chowaason makseten odesete. <verse eid="ACT 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13"/>Baasso dey maksere koi'sisetenneen orfo Yaqob kabire: «Ayni meyane; ese odotiwa! <verse eid="ACT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14"/>Ha'oos barik teegtoni daranin baasso ganeyaassin korunak tesusta Aazabni meyaki aakkak yaanamato Simon innok makewa. <verse eid="ACT 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15"/>Raajjuni meyaki kamo dey:<verse eid="ACT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16"/>« ‹Esseen orfo wolunawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">Bogte Dawitni keyaason wolgira keer'ana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">bogtera gande baron dey wolgira yeetuna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">Hepsinu dey wolgira keer'ana.<verse eid="ACT 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17-18"/>Es baron dey zagunaas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17-18">Fu'te asuni meenawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17-18">ta sunaasik teegte Aazabni meena;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17-18">zuuttere ta Daamiisin sholsonekwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17-18">zeemmaneen han bar zuuttera artonak zagiis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17-18">ta Daamiiswa›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 15:17-18">yiste barneen isarwa.<verse eid="ACT 15:17-18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19"/>«Es bari boor'a ta safaraas Ha'ooski woli Aazabni meyanon shimsunoynimatowa. <verse eid="ACT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20"/>Es baristan ‹koo'loosik maa'a sinna imtok kiina muuson muutiita; gerkesaastan wokti; geetera kiti baron muutiita; hanna muutiita› yira baassok tichunik sholsuwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21"/>Ibeneen Museni tumaas beysa beysani wonaasik Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi ferettet faar; kaambaas dey katama katamaassina makterwa.»<verse eid="ACT 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zuuttoosta Wolumtera Budi Bar Amanynyini Meyak Tichche</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22"/>Esseen orfo wosini meenawa kur'uni meena betekiristanini meyaneen ane sinere ganebesiissin garo asunin korisere Phawulosnawa Barnabasna ane Ansokiya wosusonek buggisete. Ayni meeni ganeyaassi ma'a ha'subaasik arto sina Bersabas yiste Yuudaninnawa Silasninna korisete. <verse eid="ACT 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23"/>Tichche tichaason Phawulosniknawa Barnabasnikna wosisete; es bar dey ekka yifar: «Ayni meya; wosini meenawa kur'uni meena Aazabni meeni keenaassin amanere Ansokiyak; Soriyak; Kilqiya feese ayniisakitono! Naga nittok ooshshefeniwa» <verse eid="ACT 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24"/>Isa isa asuni meya inno ajajonoyniron innoossin kesere maksete barik nitto nibaason shoruksetematonawa rakkisisetematona odeniwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25"/>Es bari boor'a isarik zuuttera wolleninneen orfo asuni meyanon korira shunto ayni Barnabasneen Phawulosneen ane nittoki wosuk isar sinni. <verse eid="ACT 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26"/>Barnabasnawa Phawulosna Daamni Yesusni sunaasik kaabesiison aatire ima asuwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27"/>Nittok tichiniis baron kaamak kotte maksonek Yuudaninnawa Silasninna wosiniwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28"/>Han sholsu chowaasneen ooma ba'a nittoosta wossunoynimato Korto Ayyanaasewa innotna ma'ar sinnamato biiniwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29"/>Esiis dey koo'loosik imtera kiina muu muutiita; hanna muutiita, geetera kiti waagni asha muutiita, gerkestan wokti; es effatena wuza zuuttambaase asiissin teetnitiison oodatine ma'aron zagitiwa; maar'ongwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30"/>Woste asuni meya dey: «Maar'ongwa» iyaat Ansokiya hamete; kiristanani meyanon isarik zuutire tichaason imete. <verse eid="ACT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31"/>Baasso dey tichaason ephere feretisetenneen orfo danete ma'a mekamaasik girsete. <verse eid="ACT 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32"/>Yuudanawa Silasna teetbesiisik raajju sinete boor'a ayni meyanon akamanon merkere zaggisete dey chinisete. <verse eid="ACT 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33"/>Esta garo wona diisetenneen orfo ayni meya «ma'aron hamoti» yiseten wolle baassotin wosi baassoki hamete. <verse eid="ACT 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34"/>[Sinuntano Silas esta fui'tonak shole.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa isa birannani masafaassi han faadaasta fa bar aafa.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35"/>Phawulosnawa Barnabasna oom showo amanynyi meyaneen Daamiisa kaamanon assitnawa maketna Ansokiya garo wona diisete.<verse eid="ACT 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulosnawa Barnabasna Oor Oor Kesete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36"/>Garo wonaneen orfo Phawulos Barnabasni: «Kabin Daamiisa kaamanon makeni makeni katamaassi wolla hamma ayni meyanon mamsuniwa; aakka feesetemato dey biyaniwa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37"/>Barnabas dey Marqos yistefe Yohannis baassoneen ane hamanak shole. <verse eid="ACT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38"/>Sinuntano Marqos sinak zeemme baassoneen ane wostoosi hama beyfaat Piniphiliyak oor kesse Yerusalem hamna boor'a Phawulos barin ephphe hamak aane sholowe. <verse eid="ACT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39"/>Estan baassotna baassotna asi ganeyaassi kirikkiri kabin oor oor kesete. Es bari boor'a Barnabas Marqosnin ephphe merkebik Kophiros hami. <verse eid="ACT 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40"/>Sinuntano Phawulos dey Silasnin kori. Ayni meya dey Phawulosnin Daamiisa otmak adara imetenneen orfo hami. <verse eid="ACT 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41"/>Betekiristaniisikitonon chinit Soriyanewa Kilqiyane asiissi kamo aatte hami.<verse eid="ACT 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Ximotiyos Phawulosneen Silasneen Ane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1"/>Phawulos Derbenawa Listirane sinfa daasta hami. Estak Ximotiyos yiste amanynyi asu feer. Intobaas Ayhudni meeni kiristana. Sinuntano ababaas Girikni daani asu. <verse eid="ACT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2"/>Ximotiyos Listiranewa Iqoniyone asiissi fe ayni meeni ganeyaassi ma'ariktu artefe. <verse eid="ACT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3"/>Phawulos Ximotiyosnin ephphe barneen ane hamanak sholefaat es biratoosta fe Ayhudni meeni boor'a Ximotiyosnin haarko kunsi. Es baron dey zaginaas esta feese Ayhudni meya zuuttere Ximotiyosni abaas Girikni daani asu sinbaason arsere feeseter sinna boor'a. <verse eid="ACT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4"/>Baasso dey isa katamaassin kesse ooma katamasi hamefe kabaasik Yerusalemuk feese wosini meenawa kur'uni meena wolumsere aatisete sitiriison amanynyini meyak assiset feeseter. Dey wostota feeshusonek makset feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5"/>Es bari boor'a Betekiristaniisikito amantobesiisik chimere faadbesiis dey wona wonaasik daytet faar.<verse eid="ACT 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Meqedoniya Hamanak Teegte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6"/>Phawulosnawa barneen ane fe baassona Iisiyak kaambaason maksonoytemato Korto Ayyanaas kalna boor'a Firgiyanewa Galatiyaniissi kamo aatte hamete. <verse eid="ACT 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7"/>Miisiyani dilaasta kar'efe kabaasik Bitaniya hamonek kabsete. Sinuntano Yesusni Ayyanaas esta kamo hamonoytemato kali. <verse eid="ACT 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8"/>Es bari boor'a Miisiya kamo aatte Tiroadda kersete. <verse eid="ACT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9"/>Estan waalin isa Meqedoniyani asu yerefaat: «Hang Meqedoniya finfaat innotin argasuwa» yifeen Phawulos raa'ik bi. <verse eid="ACT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10"/>Phawulos es raa'ison biinanneen orfo geregere Meqedoniya hamak sholeni. Esiis dey Meqedoniyak feese asuni meyak misirachchuni kaamaason makonik Ha'oos innotin teegene faar sinna bestena boor'awa.<verse eid="ACT 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lidiya Kiristoosnik Amane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11"/>Tiroaddan Merkebisi diira Samotiraqe hamni. Wonotiri wono dey Naaphule hamni. <verse eid="ACT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12"/>Estan kabira hamma Filiphisiyus kar'ni. Filiphisiyus dey Meqedoniyani katama sinfaat Romanni ha'suusi sikalosi fa waradani katmawa. Es katamaassi garo wona diini. <verse eid="ACT 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13"/>Beysani wono dey shiiphok zuuttesefe dima katamaasi gerakalota fa wor'a akaasi ha'ta sinnamato safareni boor'a esta hamni. Esta diifaat zuuttesera faase mashkasusikitok Ha'oosi kaamanon makeni. <verse eid="ACT 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14"/>Odet faase mashkasusikitosin Lidiya yiste isa asu faar. Bar dey Ha'ooson shiiphe asu. Tiyatironi katamaassin koonte wantajjini maamni naggadde. Daamiis nibbaason gachna boor'a Phawulos makefena kaamaason gasasira odet faar. <verse eid="ACT 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15"/>Barewa bari keerki baassotna zuuttere haphuktesetenneen orfo: «Daamiisik amanonaason gasasira arsetinneen taaki keer yaara duutiwa» yit chinira shiiphe.<verse eid="ACT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Filiphisiyusni Katamaassik Phawulosnawa Silasna Asi Taato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16"/>Isawa shiiphoni dimaasta hamfeni hanneenti sinni wuza wollefa kiina ayyana ephna keeri wostinynya sina isa durba nawa innok uphe. Bar dey tolfatbaasik baron ha'sife baassok akama waaga danonek zagit faar. <verse eid="ACT 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17"/>Bar Phawulosnawa innotna asi orfoose yaafaafa: «Han baasso faruni ugnaason nittok makset feese zuuttambaase asi denalo sina Ha'oosi wostinynyani meyawa!» yit chaaget faar. <verse eid="ACT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18"/>Es baron dey showo wona zagi. Sinuntano Phawulos haarere yerqere kiina ayyanaason: «Yesus Kiristoosni sunaasik barissin kesatak ajajefan!» yi. Kiina ayyanaas dey es kabaasik kesi. <verse eid="ACT 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19"/>Baron ha'sife baasso buu'a danefe abdibesiis kessa hambaason biyeteyse Phawulosninnawa Silasninna ephete. Zatte dey yaboosta taamme gaannye meeni sina tai'sisete. <verse eid="ACT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20"/>Roomani daason ha'sisefe baassoki tai'sire ekka yisete: «Han baasso Ayhud meeni keengwa! Katamaniison dey naga turuksisete. <verse eid="ACT 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21"/>Inno Roomki asu ephphatoonik wedey zagunik sholsunoy sitiriisontu maksefe.» <verse eid="ACT 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22"/>Daraas dey isarik Phawulosnawa Silasna asiista kabsete. Daa ha'sisefe baasso dey maybesiison gaa'ere haarok ichosonek ajajesete. <verse eid="ACT 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23"/>Akamanon ichesetenneen orfo taatoni keer gedesete. Tasoos mai'sire oodanak ajajesete. <verse eid="ACT 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24"/>Tasoos dey es ajajiison ephnanneen orfo taatoni keyaasi keerkalo fa keyaasi bagtosi gedde wochobesiison ginosi gedde sippe taar'i. <verse eid="ACT 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25"/>Wassi daani kixxek Phawulosnawa Silasna shiiphoknawa gaamakna Ha'ooson galatteset feeseter. Es kabaasik oom taatoni meya dey baassotin odesedifer. <verse eid="ACT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26"/>Diinqone taatoni keyaasi kapta shorkonanneen akama daani shorko sini. Taatoni keyaasi gamala zuuttera gachche. Taatoni meeni shahsaraas dey baak kotte. <verse eid="ACT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27"/>Tasoos afay'nitan guzire taatoni keyaasi gamala gachchobaason biinayse taatoni meya aatte kesetenne faar sinna barik bestefaan bar barin wolgire worunak sikobason bokosire kisi. <verse eid="ACT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28"/>Sinuntano Pawwulos kaambaason teggire chaagge: «Inno zuuttamniise hantatu faaniwa, ne neyista mangu wuza zagutaatawa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29"/>Tasoos tona ephphe yoosonek teegere eelle keerkalo giri. Korkit dey Phawulosnawa Silasna asi wochoossi gandere sagade. <verse eid="ACT 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30"/>Baassotin gero kisaat: «Daamni meyane! Farunak awu zagunak sholsifaso?» yi. <verse eid="ACT 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31"/>Baasso dey: «Daam Yesusnik amanowa; neenawa neeki keerki asuni meena farsonewa» yisete. <verse eid="ACT 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32"/>Estan Daamiisa kaamanon bariknawa barki keer feese baasso zuuttambesiise asikna maksete. <verse eid="ACT 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33"/>Es sa'atiistak tasoos wassi Phawulosnawa Silasna asin ephphe taamme mazabesiison masi. Geregere dey barnawa barki keer feese baassotna zuuttere haphuktesete. <verse eid="ACT 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34"/>Esseen orfo Taatoni keyaason tasoos Phawulosninnawa Silasninna keeba ephphe taamme muu maasi. Ha'ooson amanena boor'a basa keerki asuni meyaneen zuuttere giresete. <verse eid="ACT 16:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35"/>Wonfana kabaasik daason ha'sife baasso: «Taatoni meyanon kotta gafkutiwa» yit baasso polisinin wossete. <verse eid="ACT 16:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36"/>Tasoos bar dey: «Daason ha'sife baasso kottotik polisinin wosisete sinna boor'a kessa nagak hamtiwa» yit Phawulosnik make. <verse eid="ACT 16:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37"/>Sinuntano Phawulos: «Inno Roomki asu sinna faani daraasa sinak mangsu kar'ba foontonon yaboosta ichere innotin taatoni keer gedete. Hash dey aachok innotin taatoni keerun kisuk sholsefeso? Es bar aafawa sinanawuza baasso yeesere innotin kotte kissotowa!» yit wolgi. <verse eid="ACT 16:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38"/>Polisini meya es kaamaason daason ha'sife baassok maksete. Daason ha'sife baasso Phawulosnawa Silasna Roomki asu sinobesiison arseteyse digsete. <verse eid="ACT 16:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39"/>Yeesere dey mangsini yisere taatoni keerun baassotin kissete; katamaassin dey kesse hamonek shiiphsete. <verse eid="ACT 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40"/>Phawulosnawa Silasna taatoni keerun kesere Lidiyani keer hamete. Estak hamme ayni meyanon danere chinisefaat katamaason gafkire kesse hamete.<verse eid="ACT 16:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Teselonqek Kabi Nagani Tishu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1"/>Phawulosnawa Silasna Anfipholiyanewa Apholoniyane asiissi kamo aatte Teselonqe hamete. Estak Ayhudni shiiphoni keya faar. <verse eid="ACT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2"/>Phawulos hazozoti zagifenaasimato Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi giri. Keez beysani wona sinniron korto matsafaassin kisaafe daraasik kotte maket feer. <verse eid="ACT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3"/>Kiristoos shanaason ephphetoonaknawa kitun kabunak sholsu sinnamato kotte maket: «Han ta nittok makefana Yesus bar kiristooswa» yit feer. <verse eid="ACT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4"/>Estan Ayhudniissin isa isaas kaambaason odesere Phawulosneen Silasneen ane isar sinete. Faadbesi akam showo Ha'ooson shiiphsefe Aazabni meenawa showo arto mashka meene kaambaason odesere baassoneen ane isar sinete. <verse eid="ACT 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5"/>Sinuntano Ayhudni meya koonesere naga tishkuni wostobesi foonto asuni meyanon zuutire baassosta kabugsete. Katamaassi dey naga tishunak zagsete. Phawulosnawa Silasna asin daraasik aatire imak Iyyasonni keyaason kephire zuuttesete. <verse eid="ACT 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6"/>Sinuntano baassotin aane danoto sinna boor'a Iyyasonnawa ayni meyaassin isa isaasin zatte katamaassi fe gaanynye meeni sina taamefaat: «Han asuni meya han daason zuutire naga turksi; hash dey hanta yeesetewa. <verse eid="ACT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7"/>Iyyason dey baassotin ephphetewa: ‹Yesus yiste oom taato feerwa› yisefaafe Keesarni ajajiison tugga'sedifewa» <verse eid="ACT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8"/>Daraasnawa katamaason ha'sife baassotna es baron odeseteyse shapharesete. <verse eid="ACT 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9"/>Estan Iyyasoninnawa oom meyanonna waasi teegsonek zagsere gafuksete.<verse eid="ACT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulosnawa Silasna Beriya Hamete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10"/>Ayni meya geregere Phawulosnawa Silasna waalin Beriya hamonek zagsete. Esta kar'eteyse dey Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi girsete. <verse eid="ACT 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11"/>Beriyak fe asuni meya Teselonqeki asuni meyaastan ma'a yaadatbesi faar sinna boor'a kaambaason ma'arik ephpheteesete. Es kaamaas futo sinbaason arsere wonna wonna korto matsafaason ferere biyet feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12"/>Es bari boor'a baassossin showoos amanesete. Dey showo Girikni daani otumba faana mashka meenewa arqa meena amanesete. <verse eid="ACT 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13"/>Sinuntano Teselonqek feese Ayhudni meya Phawulos Ha'oosi kaamanon Beriyak makenamato arseteyse esta hamere daraasin manguk kabgire faasso kabugsete. <verse eid="ACT 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14"/>Es kabaasik ayni meya geregere Phawulosnin ek baarisi tesha hamanak zagsete. Sinuntano Silasnawa Ximotiyosna Beriyak fu'tesete. <verse eid="ACT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15"/>Phawulosnin ephphe kesa baasso dey barin Atena katisete. Estan Silasnawa Ximotiyosna taptere taaki yoosotowa yifa Phawulosni ajajiison ephphe Beriya wolsete.<verse eid="ACT 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Atenak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16"/>Phawulos Atenak Silasninnawa Ximotiyosninna oodfeen katamaassi koo'lo tuuma feen biyaat ayyanabaasik haare. <verse eid="ACT 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17"/>Es bari boor'a Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassin Ayhudni meyaneennawa Ha'ooson shiiphsefe asuni meyaneenna gabaasta wonna wonna danfena asusakitonen we'nit feer. <verse eid="ACT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18"/>Ephikoros yistefe baassonawa Istokos yistefe baassotna barki yeesefaafe we'nit feeseter. Isa isa meya: «Han sinnoy wolla wollefe bar awunak sholefeso?» yiseten oomni meya dey: «Gaddo koo'loosi chowanontu makefewa» yit feeseter. Es baron dey makesetees Phawulos Yesusninnawa kitun kabuni odusonna makena boor'awa. <verse eid="ACT 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19"/>Es bari boor'a Phawulosnin Ariyosfagos yiste dimaasta zuuttera fa shonggosta ephphe hamfaat ekka yisete: «Han ne makefata gaddo assus awu sinnamato arunik innok makowa? <verse eid="ACT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20"/>Isa isa gaddo gaddo wuza neekin inno odeni sinna boor'a es bar awu sinnamato arunik sholefeniwa.» <verse eid="ACT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21"/>Es baron yise Atenaki asuni meenawa Atenak feese irbani meena gaddo gaddo wuza woloknawa odokna wonbesiison aatu shuneseter. <verse eid="ACT 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22"/>Es kabaasik Phawulos Ariyosfagosuk zuuttera fa shonggosi ganesi yerefaat ekka yi: «Han Atenaki asuni meyane! Nitto showo hugnak haymanotintison zaggira ephefetimato biingwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23"/>Nitto katamaassi biratefat Ha'o shiiphefeti dimaason biifana kabaasik: ‹Artonoy Ha'ok› yistera tichchera faana shoo'ason daningwa. Ese ta nittok makonaas es arunoy shiiphefeti Ha'oosongwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24"/>Es bar han daasewa han daasta fa testo zuuttambaase asin zuutira tesiis samaasewa daase asi Daamawa. Bar asuni kushu keer'na betemeqdesiisi aane faafawa. <verse eid="ACT 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25"/>Kaasonnawa katfeni baronna dey ooma wuzasikitononu zuutira asunik imniis bar sinna boor'a isa wuzane barkin aane yo'ifawa. Asuni argasu dey barik aane sholsifawa. <verse eid="ACT 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26"/>Neebesiisonnawa foosone daasi dilanonna dilera imi. Asuni zalaason zuutira isa asunikintu tesi. Han daa zuuttambaase asiista dey foosonek zagi. <verse eid="ACT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27"/>Es baron zaginaas dey asuni meya Ha'ooson sholere tu'nire awuzakne baron danak chimonekwa. Sinfanaknu bar isarni isarniisatan wokatawa. <figure style="fig" alt="Paul speaking to the Areopagus" file="cn02136b.tif" size="span" ref="17:19">Phawulos Ariyosfagosuk zuutte zuuttoosta wolle </figure><verse eid="ACT 17:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28"/>« ‹Kaa danniis; shorkera kutifeniis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 17:28">dey faafeni foosnu barikwa›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Esiis dey;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">Nittoossin gaama arsefe nitto aruni meya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 17:28">‹Inno zuuttamniise Ha'oosi naanggotawa›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">yiseteysimatowa.<verse eid="ACT 17:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29"/>«Ese inno Ha'oni naanggota sinninneen bar asuni techmaknawa warqekna, birrik, wedey shu'ak wosuste gito zagira safaronik aane sholsifawa. <verse eid="ACT 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30"/>Ese Ha'oos asuni meya zeemoti daagni neyaasik zagsete baron baak aatira hash daadaassi fe asu zuuttere harmusonek ajaje. <verse eid="ACT 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31"/>Bar korina asuski kamo han daa zuuttambaase asiista futok mangsu kar'ana wona duusi. Es baron besinaas es korina asusin kitun kabubaasikwa.»<verse eid="ACT 17:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32"/>«Kitun kabu» yifa kaamaason odeseteyse isa isaas kanyesete. Sinuntano oomiis: «Han chowaason hepsa neekin odonik sholefeniwa» yisete. <verse eid="ACT 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33"/>Esseen orfo Phawulos baasso ganeyaassin kesse hami. <verse eid="ACT 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34"/>Sinuntano isa isa asuni meya Phawulos makena chowaason ephpheteere amanesete. Amane baassossin Ariyosfagosni shonggota diisefe baasso Diyonasyus yiste asunawa Demaris yiste isa mashkasune dey oom asuni meya feeseter.<verse eid="ACT 17:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Qoronxosni Katamaasik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1"/>Esseen orfo Phawulos Atenan kabire Qoronxos hami. <verse eid="ACT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2"/>Estak Phantoski asu sina aqila yiste isa Ayhudni meeni asunin dani. Bar dey: «Ayhud zuuttere Roomun keso» yit Roomki taate meeni taato Qelawudos ajajena boor'a asuba Phirisqilaneen Ixaliyan yeenaas ta'a wonawa. Es bari boor'a Phawulos baassotin hamme wol ari. <verse eid="ACT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3"/>Bar dey baassosimato durkani zoorir sinna boor'a baassoneen ane diifaat wostet feer. <verse eid="ACT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4"/>Beysani beysani wonaasik Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi hamfaafe Ayhudni meyaknawa Girikni meyakna amanosonek kabet feer. <verse eid="ACT 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5"/>Silasnawa Ximotiyosna Meqedoniyan yeesefe kabaasik Phawulos: «Yesus bar Kiristooswa» yit Ayhudni meyak mai'sire zaala maket wonaasikitonon aatit feer. <verse eid="ACT 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6"/>Sinuntano Ayhudni meya barin tugga'esere me'esefe kabaasik maambaasi tulonon tebire: «Ese nitto hannaas teetnitistawa; ta aafa mamustonawuza. Hanneen ekalo Aazabni meyakitu hamanawa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7"/>Estan kesse Tiitos Iyyosixos yiste asuni keer hami. Es asus Ha'ooson shiiphet feer. Keebaas dey Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaasi tesha. <verse eid="ACT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8"/>Qersiphos yiste Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaasi gaanynya dey barki keerki meyaneen zuuttere Daamiisin amanesete. Showo Qoronxoski asuni meya dey Phawulos makefeen odesere amanere haphuktesete. <verse eid="ACT 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9"/>Daamiis dey waalin Phawulosnin raa'ik uphere ekka yi: «Digotaatawa! Makowa! Dey shaakutaata! <verse eid="ACT 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10"/>Ta neneen anetu fawungwa. Han katamaassi showo asuta feerwa. Oonu sinfaanane neyista isa miir'oni wuza katuk aafa chimanawuza.» <verse eid="ACT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11"/>Estan Phawulos Ha'oosi kaamanon assit isa wogganewa issun assane esta di. <verse eid="ACT 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12"/>Gaaliyos Akayanon ha'sunak taatefena kabaasik Ayhudni meya isar sinere Phawulosniista kabsete. Phawulosnin ephphe mangsu katefana shonggosta taamefaat: <verse eid="ACT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13"/>«Han asus tumaason tugga'oni hugnak asuni meya Ha'ooson shiiphsonek zagit feerwa» yisete. <verse eid="ACT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14"/>Phawulos wolguba makonak hoorefena kabaasik Gaaliyos Ayhudni mayak ekka yi: «Nitto Ayhudni keen sina meyane! Nittoosta miir'a wedey faya mangsu zagte sinfaanane malatnitiison nibira odona kabawa. <verse eid="ACT 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15"/>Sinuntano merketi kaamnitiisiknawa, sunnitiisikna dey tumantiisiknatu malatedifeti sinnanneen teetnitiisi girowa. Ta han barissi girira mangsu kar'anak aane sholefatwa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16"/>Ekka yire mangsuni kar'ni shongostan baassotin kisi. <verse eid="ACT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17"/>Es kabaasik asu zuuttere Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaasi gaanynya sina Soostensenin ephphe shonggosta ichesete. Es bar zuuttera sinfana kabaasik Gaaliyos aane kalle shaakkire bi.<verse eid="ACT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Ansokiya Wolle Ye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18"/>Phawulos showo wona Qoronxosuk ayni meyaneen diinanneen orfo: «Maar'on» iyaat merkebisi diire Soriya hami. Phirisqillanawa Aqilane dey barneen ane feeseter. Phawulos gibaba faana boor'a Kinkiriiya yiste dimaasta sombaason fiitte. <verse eid="ACT 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19"/>Efeson kar'efe kabaasik Phirisqillaninnawa Aqilanonna esta foosonek zagi. Sinuntano bar Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi girire Ayhudni meyaneen wollet feer. <verse eid="ACT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20"/>Showo wona baassoneen ane foonak sholseten bar aane ma'i uwe. <verse eid="ACT 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21"/>Sinuntano bar: «Ha'o iyaanane hepsa wolla yoona» iyaat Efesonun kesse merkebisi diire hami. <verse eid="ACT 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22"/>Qisariya kar'faat Yerusalem hamme amanynyini meyanon naga ooshshefaat yeet wolle Ansokiya kere. <verse eid="ACT 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23"/>Ansokiyak garo wona di. Esseen orfo kabire Galatiyanewa Firgiyane asiissi kutifaafe amanynyini meyanon chimonek zagi.<verse eid="ACT 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aphphilos Efesonuknawa Qoronxosukna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24"/>Koontoba Iskindiriyakir sinna Aphphilos yiste Ayhudni daani asu Efeson ye. Bar dey Korto matsafaason mai'sire aru; dey ma'a wolumni aruba feena asu. <verse eid="ACT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25"/>Es asus Daamiisa ugnanon mai'sire assit dey Ayyanaasik kiichchet Yesusni chowaason maket feer. Sinuntano bar arifenaas Yohannisni haphquson koi'bawa <verse eid="ACT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26"/>Bar digaba foontonon Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi kotte mako ephi. Sinuntano Phiriskillanawa aqilane odeseteyse keebesi ephphe taamme Ha'oosi ugnanon mai'sire kotte barik maksete. <verse eid="ACT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27"/>Aphphilos Akaya hamanak safarefena kabaasik ayni meya dey es basa safaraason chinisere Akayak fe ayni meya ma'arik barin ephphetoosonek ticha tichire imete. Esta hamme Ha'oosi otmak amanynyi sinne fe baassotin akamanon argasi. <verse eid="ACT 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28"/>Yesus bar Kiristoos sinbaason korto matsafasin kisire makefaafe akama we'nuk Ayhudni meyanon makere meret feer.<verse eid="ACT 18:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Efesonuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1"/>Aphphilos Qoronxosuk feena kabaasik Phawulos tukaki daasta kamo aatte Efeson hamme kar'i. Estak faadbesi garo amanynyini meyanon danne: <verse eid="ACT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2"/>«Amanefeti kabaasik Korto Ayyanaason ephpha taasetiyoso?» yit mamsi. Baasso dey: «Aane ephphatoweniwa. Korto Ayyanaas foobaasonnu aane odoweniwa» yisete. <verse eid="ACT 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3"/>Phawulos dey: «Eekan aro haphuqtonson haphuqtetiri?» yi. Baasso dey: «Yohannisni haphuqtosongwa» yisete. <verse eid="ACT 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4"/>Phawulos dey: «Yohannisni haphquus boor'ni harminirwa. Daraasik dey makenaas: ‹Ta orfoose yooni barik amanoti› yit feer. Es bar dey Yesuswa!» yi. <verse eid="ACT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5"/>Es baron odeseteyse Daam Yesusni sunaasik haphuktesete. <verse eid="ACT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6"/>Phawulos kushubaason baassosta ta'ifena kabaasik Korto Ayyanaas baassosta keren gaddo noono wolumsesete. Raaji dey mako ephesete. <verse eid="ACT 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7"/>Es asuni meeni faadaas dey asire heppe sinana. <verse eid="ACT 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8"/>Phawulos Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi hamme keez assa sinniron digaba foontonon Ha'oosi taatoni chowanon maketnawa assitna feer. <verse eid="ACT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9"/>Sinuntano isa isa meya nibbesiison kalere Daamiisa ugnanon daraasa sina me'et aafawa amanoniwuza yisefe kabaasik baassostan woki. Amanynyi meyanon dey baasso baassotin oor kisire Xiranosni keerki assuni keyaassi wonna wonna assit feer. <verse eid="ACT 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10"/>Phawulos es baron zaginaas hep wogga sinana. Es kabaasik Iisiyak feese Ayhudni meenawa Aazabni meena zuuttere Daamiisa kaamanon odosonek chimesete.<verse eid="ACT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ha'oos Phawulosniki Kamo Zagina Biistera Artonoy Wuza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11"/>Ha'oos Phawulosniki kamo akama biistera artonoy wuza zagit faar. <verse eid="ACT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12"/>Atubaas ta'ina maamaasewa kushuni marabibaase asin ephphe taamme mettanni meyaasta kunusseten mettanni meya merobesiissin farit feeseter. Kiina ayyanaas dey asusasin keset faar. <verse eid="ACT 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13"/>Kiina ayyanaason asusasin kisset kutise isa isa Ayhudni meya: «Phawulos makefena Daam Yesusni sunaasik nittotin ajajefeni» uuk kiina ayyanaason asusasin kisuk kabet feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14"/>Ayhud sina maagni gaanynyaasasin isa Asqewani naafun naanggotiis dey esiisimato zagset feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15"/>Sinuntano kiina ayyanaas wolgira: «Yesusnin arifan; Phawulosnin chowaason arifan; nitto oonso?» yi. <verse eid="ACT 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16"/>Kiina ayyanaas ephna asus dey fillere baassotin ephphe baassosta chimi dey mere. Mazayerenawa atatuna keerun eelle kesete. <verse eid="ACT 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17"/>Es wuzaas dey Efesonuk feese Ayhudnawa Aazabni meena asik artena boor'a zuuttambesiise digesete. Daam Yesusni sunaas akamanon ulfinto sini. <verse eid="ACT 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18"/>Amane baassossin dey showo asu mangu wostobesiison ammanon kisire harmifaafe yeeset feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19"/>Showo tolfattuni meya dey tolfatni matsafabesiison zuutire dara zuuttambesiise asi sina kiichisete. Es tolfatni matsafaasi waaga dey gammatten uuchasir kuma shu'ni birri sini. <verse eid="ACT 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20"/>Esiisimato Daamiisa kaama akama hugnak tagitnawa meretna hami.<verse eid="ACT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Efesonuk Naga Tishi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21"/>Es bar zuuttera sinnanneen orfo Phawulos Meqedoniyanewa Akayane asiissi aatte Yerusalem hamanak ayyanabaassi safarefaat: «Esta kar'etenneen orfo Rooma hamaktu sholsuwa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22"/>Estan barin argassefe baassossin heppin Ximotiyosnawa Erasixosninna asin Meqedoniya wosaat bar teetbaasik garo wona Iisiyak di. <verse eid="ACT 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23"/>Es kabaasik Daamiisa uguntan kabi chowa Efesonuk naga tishi. <verse eid="ACT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24"/>Dimexiros yiste birri wuukife asus Arxemisni Betemeqdesiisi gito birrik wostefaafe birri wuukife baassok akama buu'a danonek zagit feer. <verse eid="ACT 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25"/>Es bari boor'a es asus birri wuukife baassotinnawa basasne fa wostobesi faana baassotinna isa dima zuutire ekka yi: «Asuni meyane! Inno otma danfeniis han wostoosik sinnamato arifetiwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26"/>Han Phawulos: ‹Kushuk wosuste gitoos bar Ha'otawa› yi Efesonuk koi'ba sinnoynaron garo daatu fu'tetano Iisiyanon zuuttambaase asin showo daranin assinamatonawa amanosonek zaginamatona nitto biiti dey odetiwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27"/>Es effatena ugnaasik inno wostoos kashisterwa. Es bar koi'ba sinnoynaron Iisiyanewa daa zuuttambaase asiissi fe asu zuuttere shiiphefena arki ha'o arxemisni betemeqdesiis ke'inor sinna fu'tobawa. Bari arkittoos dey shaarterwa.» <verse eid="ACT 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28"/>Asuni meya dey es baron odeseteyse gi'tesere: «Efesonki arxemis arkittowa» yit chaagesete. <verse eid="ACT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29"/>Katamaas zuuttera naga turki. Meqedoniyaki asuni meya dey hep Phawulosni zomo sina Gayiyosnawa Aristirokosna asin zatere daraasa zuuttoni dimaasta eelete. <verse eid="ACT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30"/>Phawulos daraasa zuuttota hamanak sholet feer. Sinuntano nawoni meya kalesete. <verse eid="ACT 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31"/>Iisiyani daason ha'sife basa zomo sina baassossin isa isaas Phawulosniki aachok asunin wosire: «Daraasa zuuttoni dimta hamma ammanon kessa bestotatawa» yit shiiphsete. <verse eid="ACT 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32"/>Daraasa ganesi akama buuncho kabina boor'a arki sinaas awuniron zuuttenamato aane aruwe. Es bari boor'a isaas isa wuza oomiis dey ooma wuza maket chaaget feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33"/>Ayhudni meyaassin Iskindir yiste asusin tugire teshsho daraasa sina yeetisete. Daraasa ganesin isa isaas mai'sire we'nunak chinire kiitisete. Bar dey daraas shaakkunak kushubaasik besire baassok wollonak hoore. <figure style="fig" alt="Goddess Diana or Artemis of the Ephesians" file="HK00286B.tif" size="span" ref="19:28">Eefesonuk fa ha'o Arxemis wedey Diyana </figure><verse eid="ACT 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34"/>Sinuntano bar Ayhudni meeni keen sinbaason arseteyse zuuttere isa kaamak: «Efesonki arxemis arkittowa» yit hep sa'ati sinniron chaagesete. <verse eid="ACT 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35"/>Koi'baastak katamaasi ha'suni tichaason tichife bar daraas shaakkunak zagaat: «Nitto Efesonni asuni meyane! Efesonni katamaassi fe daraas arkitto arxemisni betemeqdesiisewa saman kere inya shu'aase asin oodfenamato asu zuuttambaase asik artowa. <verse eid="ACT 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36"/>Es baron mormonir oonu aafe sinna boor'a shaakkutiknawa taptera isa mangu wuza zagunoytimato teetnitiison oodatik sholsuwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37"/>Betemeqdesiison bo'oknawa ha'oniison mei'noy asuni meyanon ephpha hanta yaasetiwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38"/>Dimexirosnawa barneen ane feese birri wuukife baassotna malatosone asu feefaanane mangsu katona wonaas faarwa. Daason ha'sife baasso feeseter sinna boor'a estak malassotowa. <verse eid="ACT 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39"/>Ooma sholefei wuza faafaanane tumaasi shonggoni zuuttota biistonawa. <verse eid="ACT 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40"/>Haniistan ooma hawungti zagseti wuzaas: ‹Faasso kabgiwa› yistera mamustonoynimato digeniwa. Wedey ‹Han kabi faassoos awuni boor'a kabiso?› yistera mamustefaanine wolguni malsi aafawa.» <verse eid="ACT 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41"/>Es baron makefaat zuuttere fe daraasin boktosonek zagi.<verse eid="ACT 19:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Meqedoniyani daastanawa Girikni Daastana Hami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1"/>Nagani tishuus koochenanneen orfo Phawulos amanynyini meyanon isarik zuutire kiitire chinaat: «Maar'on duuti» iyaat baassostan oor kesse Meqedoniya hami. <verse eid="ACT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2"/>Es aatfena dima dimaassi amanynyini meyanon showo kiito kiitire chininanneen orfo Girikni daa hami. <verse eid="ACT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3"/>Esta keez assa diinanneen orfo merkebi diire Soriya hamanak safare. Sinuntano Ayhudni meya basaasta chowa sholsetemato arinaayse Meqedoniya kamo wolle yoonak hoorere kabi. <verse eid="ACT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4"/>Payirosni naa Beriyaki Susiphaxiros Teselonqeki Aristirokosnawa Sikondusna Derbenki Gayiyos, Ximotiyos, Iisiyaki Tikiqosnawa Trofemosna ane hamete. <verse eid="ACT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5"/>Es baasso sina zeemme hamefaat Xiroaddak innotin oodesete. <verse eid="ACT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6"/>Sinuntano inno kixxani heeboos aatnanneen orfo Filiphisiyusun merkebi diira uuch wonak baasso feesete Xiroadda kar'a esta naafun wona diini.<verse eid="ACT 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Koi'baastak Xiroaddaki Asuni Meyanon Mamsuk Hami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7"/>Guddani wono isarik Daamiisa meeta'unon muunik zuuttera diifeni kabaasik Phawulos wonotirik hamanak sholsu sinna boor'a baassoneen wollet feer. Wassi daani kixxe kar'ananeen wolumbaason dichi. <verse eid="ACT 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8"/>Inno zuuttera faani fooqiissi showo tona faar. <verse eid="ACT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9"/>Awuxekis yiste isa na'o naa maskotiista diifer, Phawulos wolumbaason dichina boor'a es na'o naasin akama afay' ephaan fooqiistan gande. Asuni meya dey kitire kunfeen kabugsete. <verse eid="ACT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10"/>Sinuntano Phawulos kerere naasin mugire idimfaat: «Kaaba faarwa digotiitawa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11"/>Phawulos wolle den fooqiista kesse amanynyini meyaneen Daamiisa meeta'unon batte me. Wonana kabaneen asuni meyaneen wollenanneen orfo kabire hami. <verse eid="ACT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12"/>Asuni meya dey fari naasin ephphe keer hamete. Es barik dey akamanon giresete.<verse eid="ACT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Tiroaddan Milixi Yiste Dima Hami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13"/>Inno Phawulosnin merkebisi duusunik sholeni boor'a zeemma merkebi diira Aason hamni. Es baron dey zaginiis Phawulos wochok hamanak sholena boor'a. <verse eid="ACT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14"/>Aasonuk uphefeni kabaasik merkebisi duunak zagira Mixilini barneen ane hamni. <verse eid="ACT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15"/>Wonotiri wono kabira merkebisi diira Kiyyuni sinaasta fa dimaasta kar'ni. Wonotir wono Samoon finna wonotiri wono Milixi kar'ni. <verse eid="ACT 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16"/>Phawulos Iisiyak showo wona duuk aane sholowe sinna boor'a Efeson shaatonoy aatte hami. Es baron zaginaas Penxekosteni heeboosik Yerusalem hamme aatunak sholet feer sinna boor'a. <figure style="fig" alt="Boat" file="LB00213B.tif" size="span" ref="20:13-15">Goonu</figure><verse eid="ACT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Koi'baasta Phawulos Efesonuk Feese Kur'uni Meyak Zagina Wolla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17"/>Phawulos milixinun asunin Efeson wosire betekiristanini kur'uni meyanon teegsi. <verse eid="ACT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18"/>Barki yeeseten ekka yi: «Han Iisiya yaana wonaneen wonna wonna nittoneen ane aakkak aatinamato nitto teetnitiisik arifetiwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19"/>Ayhudni meeni chowni sholostan kabi chowa shana tayista katisefeknu futoni garamaknawa harafakna Daamiisik wostet faanarwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20"/>Yaboosta sinun nitto keenti keentiissi nittok sholsifayson zuutiratu assintano isa wuzane makonoy aane fu'otwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21"/>Ayhudni meenawa Aazabni meena boor'besiison harmire Ha'ooski wolsoneknawa Daamni Yesusnin amanosonekna mai'sira baassok makengwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22"/>Hashnu ta esta hamfana kabaasik awu tayista kar'nitto arunoy Korto Ayyanak ajachchera Yerusalem hamnarwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23"/>Sinuntano katama katamaassi taatonewa rakkone tayista kar'ana baron Korto Ayyanaas taak makewa. <verse eid="ACT 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24"/>Ha'oosi otumni misirachchuni kaamanon makonak Daam Yesusnikin ephna barik wostoni giddiison koi'sanane kaanaas taak ke'nir yira aafawa faaduna wuza. <verse eid="ACT 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25"/>Hash hawungneen kar'a nitto ganeyaassi kutifaafa Ha'oosi taatoni kaamanon makettu fawungwa. Sinuntano hanneen ekalok oonu taan aafa biyana wuza sinnamato arifawungwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26"/>Es bari boor'a nittoossin isar tishifenaknu ta aafa mamustonawuza yit hash hawungti wonaasta nittok makefawungwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27"/>Ha'oosi fiqadinon zuutiratu nittok makentano isa fu'ena wuza aafawa. <verse eid="ACT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28"/>Nittotin betekiristanini kur'u zagira Korto Ayyanaas kori. Ese nitto teetasiknawa keemfeti wodoosikna teetnitiison arutiwa. Ha'oos bari naasa hannak waagena betekiristaniison mai'sira oodtiwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29"/>Ta hamnanneen orfo wodoosik kenashtonoy keena budu iririkasne fe asuni meya yoosonemato arifawungwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30"/>Esiisimato isa isa asuni meya nitto ganeyasin kabsere elinga assu assire amanynyini meyanon baassoki wolgusonerwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31"/>Es bari boor'a isa isarnitiisik keez wogga toonewa waalinne arafnaason wuukit nittotin kiitinamato yaadatefaat guzuti. <verse eid="ACT 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32"/>Hashnu kortoni meyaneen ane risti nittok imanak chimni Ha'oosiknawa otumbaasi kaamak nittotin chinira yeetuni barik nittotin aatira adara imingwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33"/>Ta ookinnu birri, warqe wedey maama ephphatoonak aane fantot. <verse eid="ACT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34"/>Kushunaasik wosto wostefaat taaknawa taneen fe zoomotaasakitoninna argasit faanamato nitto aridifeti. <verse eid="ACT 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35"/>‹Ephpheteesefe basaastan imfe bar suustowa› yifa Daam Yesusni kaamanon safarok kushuniisik wostet hopini meyanon argasunik sholsu sinnamato showo ugnak nittok besifawungwa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36"/>Es baron iyaat kaa'nere baassoneen shiiphe. <verse eid="ACT 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37"/>Zuuttere akamanon waassere Phawulosnin idimme daamesete. <verse eid="ACT 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38"/>Arkiron suumosonek zagiis «Hanneen ekalo taan aafa biyati wuza» yina boor'a. Estan merkebi diistefana dimaasta zoonsire geggesisete.<verse eid="ACT 20:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Yerusalem Hami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1"/>Baassostan oor kesse hamninneen orfo merkebisi diira Qos yiste dimta hamni; Wonotirik Ruud yiste dimta hamni; Estan Paxira yistefa katamasi hamni. <verse eid="ACT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2"/>Estan Fiinqe sinfa daa hamma merkebi danna barissi diira hamni. <verse eid="ACT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3"/>Kophirosnon alda teshniista biyaat Soriya hamma Merkebiis wor'na ba'aason kessifana Xiroski wodebiiski hamni. <verse eid="ACT 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4"/>Estak amanynyini meyanon sholera danna naafun wona diini. Baasso dey Korto Ayyanak tuntesere Pawulonin: «Yerusalem hamataatawa» yit makesete. <verse eid="ACT 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5"/>Estak fooni wonaas ko'ubaase amanynyini meyaastan oor kessa ugunniison hamni. Zuuttambesiise asubesiiseneen naanggotbesiseneen kesere katamaasi gerakalo kar'ananeen innotin geggesisete. Baarisi tesha kaa'nera baassoneen ane shiipheni. <verse eid="ACT 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6"/>Estan baassotin maar'on iyaat Inno merkebiissi girira diini. Baasso dey wolle keebesi hamete. <verse eid="ACT 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7"/>Inno Xirosun kabira Pentelemayis kar'ni. Estak amanynyini meyaneen uphera naga ooshshefaat baassoneen ane isa wona feeshni. <verse eid="ACT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8"/>Wonotiri wono estan kessa Qisariya hamni. Estak naafun daaqonynyisasin isar sinna Filiphoos yistefe wongelawiisa keer girira barneen ane diini. <verse eid="ACT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9"/>Barki keer raaji maksefa acheech durba naanggotba faaser. <verse eid="ACT 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10"/>Showo wona esta diifeni Agabos yiste raajju Yuudan innoki ye. <verse eid="ACT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11"/>Es raajjuus innoki yeere Phawulosni talfaason ephphe basa teetni kushusonnawa wochoosonna taar'aat: «Korto Ayyanaas han talfaasi abanin Yerusalemuk feese Ayhudni meya haniisimato taar'ere Aazabni meyak aatire imonerwa yifawa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12"/>Es baron odeniise innotnawa esta feese baassotna Phawulos Yerusalem hamnoynamato shiipheni. <verse eid="ACT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13"/>Sinuntano Phawulos wolgire: «Ekka waasira awuniron nibnaason shorkifetiso? Ta Daam Yesusni sunaasik Yerusalemuk taato koi'ba sinnoynaron kitunu sinfaanane hooreratu fawungwa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14"/>Kiitini kiitooson ephphetoo beybaase: «Ese Daamiis yina bar sinungwa» iyaat beyni. <verse eid="ACT 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15"/>Estak garo wona diininneen orfo ba'aniison taar'a hoossira Yerusalem hamni. <verse eid="ACT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16"/>Qisariyak feese amanynyini meyaassin isa isaas innoneen ane yeesete. Baasso dey barki keer beysa ephanik Minasonni keer innotin zoonsisete. Bar dey zeemme amanere fe Kophiroski asusasin isaas.<verse eid="ACT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Yerusalemuk Yaqobnin Mamsuk Hami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17"/>Hamma Yerusalem kar'feni kabaasik amanynyini meya innotin girak ephete. <verse eid="ACT 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18"/>Wonotiri wono Phawulos innoneen ane Yaqobniki keer hami. Estak dey kur'uni meya zuuttere feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19"/>Phawulos dey naga ooshshenanneen orfo Ha'oos barki kamo Aazabni meeni ganeyaassi zagina wuzason isarba isarbaasik baassok make. <verse eid="ACT 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20"/>Es baron odeseteyse Ha'ooson galattesete. Phawulosnin dey ekka yisete: «Ayniiso! Showo kumak faadtoni Ayhudni meya amanesetematonawa zuuttambesiise dey Museni tumaasik ma'a koonabesi faanamato arifatwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21"/>Ne Aazabni meeni ganeyaassi feese Ayhudni meyanon: ‹Naanggotnitiison haarko kunsutiita wedey tumaason zagutiita› yit assuneesik Museni tumaason zagsobeyonek zagitarwa yistet fa wollaason odesetewa. <verse eid="ACT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22"/>Ese awu zagifaanine ma'ari? Ne yooson futoosik odeseterwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23"/>Es bari boor'a han inno neek makefeni baron zaguwa. Gibabesi faana acheech asu innoneen ane feeseterwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24"/>Baassotin ephpha Betemeqdesi hamfaat teetneeson kayimsuwa. Sombesiison dey fiittosonek betemeqdesiisik imtefa imni waagaason baassok kaasuwa. Es baron zagaatane neyista wolumte wollaas zuuttera shima sinbaasewa nenu teetneesik dey tumaasik ajajame asu sintamato zuuttambaase arunawa. <verse eid="ACT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25"/>Sinuntano Aazabni meyaassin amane baassok: ‹Koo'loosik maa'a imte kiina muuson muutiita, hannaason muutiita, geetera kiti waagaasi ashanon muutiita, gerkesasin wokti› yifa tichaason wollera buggira baassok gafkiniwa» yisete. <verse eid="ACT 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26"/>Esseen orfo Phawulos asuni meyanon ephphe wonotirik baassoneen ane teetbaason kayimsi; kayimsone wonaas aage sinanamatonawa es wono isa isarbesiisa teetak imtefa gibani maa'aasi waaga aage kaastonamato yaadassuk betemeqdesiisi giri.<verse eid="ACT 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Betemeqdesiisik Ootte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27"/>Naafunsa wonaas ko'unak kar'fana kabaasik Iisiyan yeese Ayhudni meya Phawulosnin betemeqdesiisi biyete boor'a daraasin zuutire basaasta kabgisere ephesete. <verse eid="ACT 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28"/>«Israelni asuni meyane!, Innotin argasutiwa, daraaniisinnawa tumaanisonna, dey daa daasi fe asu zuuttambaase asin assit feyiis han asuswa. Es bar bariknu beynoy Aazabni meyanon betemeqdesiisi gedfaafe han kayma dimaason kiinsiwa» yit chaagesete. <verse eid="ACT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29"/>Es baron makesetees zeemo sinak Efesonki Trofemos barneen ane katamaassi kutifeen biyete boor'a barin Phawulos betemeqdesiisi ephphe girine faar sinna baassok bestera faar. <verse eid="ACT 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30"/>Katamaas zuuttera naga turki. Dara dey zuuttere isarik eelle yeere Phawulosnin ephphe zatte betemeqdesiissin kissete. Geregere betemeqdesiisi gamalanon kulufte. <verse eid="ACT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31"/>Asuni meya Phawulosnin Woruk sholsefe kabaasik: «Yerusalemni katama zuuttambaase asiissi naga tishiwa» yifa wosiyaas Romanni meya taar'oni meyanon ajajefe gaanynyaaski hamma kar'i. <verse eid="ACT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32"/>Estan bar meya taar'osakitoninnawa tii meeni gaanynyasakitoninna ephphe eelet hamme kar'i. Asuni meya dey meya taar'oni meyanon ajajefe gaanynyaasnawa meya taar'oni meyanonna biyeteyse Phawulosnin ichaason beyete. <verse eid="ACT 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33"/>Es kabaasik meya taar'oni meyanon ajajefe gaanynyaas tai'sere ephphe Phawulosnin hep shashsharak taatonak ajaje. Esseen orfo bar oo sinnamatonawa awu zaginamatona mamsi. <verse eid="ACT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34"/>Darani meya dey isa isaas isa wuza yisten oomiis dey ooma wuza maket chaaget feeseter. Meya taar'oni meyanon ajajefe bar daraasa chaagatan kabi chowa futo sinna wuzason arunak aane chime sinna boor'a Phawulosnin meya taar'oni meeni ke'e ephphe hamonek ajaje. <verse eid="ACT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35"/>Phawulos gefaasta kar'fena kabaasik daraas zuuttere akama gi'ak kabsere barin miir'oni wuza basaasta katusonek feeseter sinna boor'a meya taar'osakito barin wor'e hamete. <verse eid="ACT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36"/>Daraas dey: «Wortowowa» yit orfoose chaaget barneen ane hamete.<verse eid="ACT 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Daraasneen Wolle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37"/>Meya taar'osakito barin ephphe hamere feesefe dimaasta kar'efe kabaasik Phawulos meya taar'oni meyanon ajajefe gaanynyaasin: «Ta isa wuza neek makonak ma'i utaroso?» yi. Ajajefe gaanynyaas dey: «Girikni noono arifatoso? <verse eid="ACT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38"/>Eekan zeemo sinak dara nuurunak zagire kaa wori acheech kum asuni meyanon ephphe ichma daa hama Giphtsini asus netenoso?» yi. <verse eid="ACT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39"/>Phawulos dey: «Ta Kilqiya fa arto Tersesni katamaassin koonte Ayhudawiwa. Adarawa daraasik makonak ma'i utak mamsifawungwa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 21:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40"/>Bar dey makowa ubaase Phawulos gefaasta yerefaat kushubaason kabgire daraas shaakunak zagi. Daraas dey shaakki. Phawulos Ibrayistini noonok ekka yit make.<verse eid="ACT 21:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1"/>«Nitto aytaasakitonawa abataasakitona! Hash nittok makona wolguni wolumnaason odotiwa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2"/>Ibrayistini noonok makefeen odeseteyse akamanon shaakkisete. Estan Phawulos dey ekka yi: <verse eid="ACT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3"/>«Ta Kilqiyaki fa Terseski katamaassin koonte Ayhudawiwa; sinuntano dichnaas han Yerusalemni katamaassiwa; taan assiis Gamaliya sinfe asuswa; abani meeni tumaason mai'sira arira dey han nitto zagifetisimato hashnu Ha'oosik akamanon koone asuwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4"/>Han ugnaasik zoonustefe baassotin kituta kar'one kabaneen kabgit faanar. Arqasinnawa mashkasonna taar'taafa aatira taatoni keer imet faanar. <verse eid="ACT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5"/>Es bar futo sinbaason Maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaasnawa kur'uni meeni shonggose taak zaalwa. Esiisimato dey Demaskok feese han asuni meyanon taar'a Yerusalem teshshera ke'o danonek Demaskok feese Ayhud sina ayni meyaki tichisete tichaason ephnaas han baassokingwa.<verse eid="ACT 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Kiristoosnin Aakkak Amanenamato Make</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6"/>«Ta Demasko hamet katamaaski tai'sefana kabaasik toosta diinqone akama chaarefa saman biratonaasta palpalit chaare. <verse eid="ACT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7"/>Es kabaasik daasta kere gandera: ‹Sawulno! Sawulno! Awuni boor'a taan kabgidifa?› yifa kaama oden. <verse eid="ACT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8"/>Ta dey: ‹Daamiiso! Ne oonso?› yin. Bar dey: ‹Ta han ne kabgifata Naaziretki Yesuswa› yi. <verse eid="ACT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9"/>Taneen ane feese baasso es chaarefaasontu biyetetano bar taan wolumsifena kaamaason aane odosoto. <verse eid="ACT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10"/>Ta dey: ‹Daamiiso! Awu zagunarinso?› yina Daamiis dey: ‹Kabira Demasko hamma; zagutak sholsi bar zuuttera estak neek maktonawa› yi. <verse eid="ACT 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11"/>Es chaarefaasi palpalutan kabi chowa biyanak aane chimut sinna boor'a taneen ane feese asuni meya kushunaassi zatere zoonsit Demasko katisete. <verse eid="ACT 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12"/>Estak Hananiya yiste isa asu feer. Bar dey Ayhudni meeni sinak ulfinto; tumaasik ha'i ayyantu asu. <verse eid="ACT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13"/>Bar yeere teshna yerefaat: ‹Ayta Sawulno! Aafnees biyungwa!› yi. Aafnaas dey es kabaasik geregere gachche; barin dey biin. <verse eid="ACT 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14"/>Bar dey taak ekka yi: ‹Abaniisakitoni Ha'o bari safaraason arutak, ookoosin biyataknawa dey kaambaason noonobaassin odotakna neen zeemma koriwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15"/>Es baron dey zaginaas biita baronnawa odeta baronna asu zuuttambaase asi sina barik zaal sinatakwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16"/>Eekan Hash awu oodaat diitarin? Kabira basa sunaason teegok haphuktera boor'neessin kayimwa› yi. <verse eid="ACT 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17"/>Esseen orfo Yerusalem wolla hamma betemeqdesiisi Ha'o shiiphefaat temesxok raa'i biin. <verse eid="ACT 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18"/>Daamiis dey bestere: ‹Ne ta chowaasik makota zaalaason aafa ephphetoosone wuza sinna boor'a taptera Yerusalemun keswa› yi. <verse eid="ACT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19"/>Ta dey ekka yin: ‹Daamiiso! Ayhudni shiiphoni keya zuuttambaase asiissi hamfaafa Neek amanefe baassotin zuutira ephpha taatoni keer gednamatonawa ichnamatona baasso teetbesiisik arsedifewa. <verse eid="ACT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20"/>Neek zaal sina Isxifanosnin worsefe kabaasik ta dey baassoneen ane isar sinna teshbesi yerefaat baasso mayaason oodet faanarwa› <verse eid="ACT 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21"/>Daamiis dey: ‹Woka daak feese Aazabni meyaki neen wosunar sinna boor'a kabira hamma› » yi.<verse eid="ACT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Roomni Daani Asu Sinbaason Besi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22"/>Estaneen kar'e daraas zuuttere Phawulos makena wollaason odeset feeseter. Estan kaambesiison teggisere: «Han effetena asu kaak foonak aane sholsifa sinna boor'a daastan tishuwowa» yit chaagete. <verse eid="ACT 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23"/>Baasso dey chaaget; maybesiison kisire sirusta birassit; tulooson den sama buket feeseter. <verse eid="ACT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24"/>Ajajefe gaanynyaas es baron biinayse Phawulosnin meya taar'oni meya feesefe dimaassi ephphe hamonek ajaje. Daraas basaasta awuni boor'a effaron chaagetemato arunak ichchet mamustonak ajaje. <verse eid="ACT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25"/>Sinuntano talfak taar'ere ichonek hooresefe kabaasik Phawulos teshba yere tii meeni gaanynyak: «Roomni asusnin mangsu kar'noyfeen ichatik sholsunoso?» yi. <verse eid="ACT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26"/>Tii meeni gaanynyaas es baron odenayse ajajefe gaanynyaaski hamme: «Han asus Roomki daani asuwa; awu zagutakinso?» yi. <verse eid="ACT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27"/>Es bari boor'a ajajefe gaanynyaas Phawulosniki tai'sere: «Ne Roomki daani asunoso? Taak makebbo» yi. Phawulos dey: «Aa, ta Roomki daani asuwa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28"/>Ajajefe gaanynyaas: «Ta Roomki asu sinanak akama waagatu kaasira waagengwa» yi. Sinuntano Phawulos: «Ta Roomni daastatu koontengwa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29"/>Estan barin tu'nuk hoorere feese baasso basaastan oor kesse hamete. Gaanynyaas dey Roomki asu sinbaason arinaayse shashsharak taatonak ajajobaasik dige.<verse eid="ACT 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Ayhudni Meeni Shonggosi Sina Ta'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30"/>Wonotiri wono ajajefe gaanynyaas Ayhudni meya Phawulosnin malassete chowa futobaas awu sinnamato arunak shole. Estan maagni gaanynye meyanonnawa shonggota diisefe baassotinna zuuttosonek ajaje. Phawulosnin taatoni keerun kotsire teshshe baasso sina tai'si.<verse eid="ACT 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1"/>Phawulos shonggosta diise baassotin kootkire biyaat: «Aytaasakitono! Ta hawungneen kar'a Ha'oosi sina faana foonaas ma'a kanukwa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2"/>Hananiya sinfe maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynya Phawulosni tesha yere asuni meyanon Phawulosni noonooson ichosonek ajaje. <verse eid="ACT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3"/>Es kabaasik Phawulos Hananiyanin: «Ne booro maattera di sawane faatarwa; Ha'oos neen ichnirwa! Ne tumaasimato mangsu kar'atak diifaat kessa tumaasneen gerakalo taan ichosonek ajajotaroso?» yi. <verse eid="ACT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4"/>Esta yerse asuni meya: «Ha'oosi maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaasin me'fatoso?» yisete. <verse eid="ACT 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5"/>Phawulos dey: «Aytaasakitono! Maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynya sinbaason aane arutwa. Ha'oosi kaamsi: ‹Daraasin ha'sife baassosta mangu kaama makotaatawa› yistera tichchera faarwa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6"/>Sinuntano Phawulos esta yere baassossin isa kunuus Seduqawi; isa kunuus Ferisawi sinobesiison arifaat: «Aytaasakitono! Ta Ferisawini meeni keenaassin koonte Ferisawiwa. Hash ta mangsu kar'tefana dimaasta tai'senaas imte abdisiknawa kitun kabuni chowaasiknawa» yit zuuttoosi sina kaambaason teggire chaagi. <verse eid="ACT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7"/>Es baron makobaase Ferisawini meenawa Seduqawini meena asi ganeyaassi faasso kabin shonggos heppik bagte. <verse eid="ACT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8"/>Seduqawini meya: «Kitun kabu aafa; Ha'oosi wosiya dey aafa; Ayyanaas dey aafa» yifar; sinuntano Ferisawini meya: «Es bar zuuttambaase faarwa» yiretu amanesefe. <verse eid="ACT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9"/>Es bari boor'a nagani tishu sini. Ferisawini meeni ganeyaassin isa isa Museni tumaason assife baasso kabsere: «Han asusata isa mangsune aane daneniwa. Awuzakne Ayyana wedey Ha'oni wosiya barik make sinanawa» yit chinire we'nisete. <verse eid="ACT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10"/>Faassoos arkit yoobaase asuni meya Phawulosnin buu'e tishuksonoytemato ajajefe bar digefaat meya taar'oni meya hamere asuni meeni ganeyasin kisire teshshere meya taar'oni meya feesefe dimaasta ephphe hamonek ajaje. <verse eid="ACT 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11"/>Wonotiri wono waalin Daamiis Phawulosni tesha yerefaat: «Digotaatawa! Yerusalemuk ta chowaason maketaasimato Room dey hamma ta chowaason makotak sholsuwa» yi.<verse eid="ACT 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulosnin Woruk Zagte Koppo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12"/>Wonfana kabaasik Ayhudni meya zuuttesere: «Phawulosnin worunoy muu aafa muuni wuza dey aka aafa ushani wuza» yit teyisesete. <verse eid="ACT 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13"/>Es baron merkees acheechasir asuneen denalo. <verse eid="ACT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14"/>Es baasso dey maagni gaanynye meyakinawa kur'uni meyakina hamere: «Phawulosnin woruninneen: ‹Muu aafa muuni wuza› yit chinira teyiniwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15"/>Nitto dey shonggosneen ane isar sinna basa chowaason mai'sire tu'nuti wuza faarne faar zagira Phawulosnin nittoki tai'sunak ajajefe barin mamsutiwa. Inno dey hanta kar'noyfeen worunik hooreniwa» yisete.<verse eid="ACT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16"/>Sinuntano Phawulosni eeti naa es mekamaason odefaat meya taar'oni meeni ke'e hamme Phawulosnik make. <verse eid="ACT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17"/>Phawulos dey tii meeni gaanynyaasasin isarin teegere: «Han naas ajajefe gaanynyaasik makona wuza faar sinna boor'a gaanynyasneen uphsuwa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18"/>Tii meeni gaanynyaas dey naasin taamme ajajefe gaanynyaaski katifaat: «Han naas neek makona wuza faar sinna boor'a taato sina Phawulos taan teegere neeki ephpha yoonak shiiphewa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19"/>Ajajefe gaanynyaas dey naasin kushubaassi zatte eksefaat: «Taak makota wuzaas aambanso?» yit mamsi. <verse eid="ACT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20"/>Naas dey ekka yi: «Ayhudni meya Phawulosni chowaason chinire tu'nusonerne faar zagsere wono shonggosi sina tai'sutak neen mamsusonek merkesetewa. <verse eid="ACT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21"/>Sinuntano ne ma'i utaatawa. Phawulosnin woruninneen muu aafa muuni wuza aka dey aafawa ushani wuza yisere teyisete acheechasirneen denalo asu barin woruk oodediferwa. Hash baasso oodeset feesetees ne wolgusongwa» <verse eid="ACT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22"/>Ajajefe gaanynyaas: «Han taak maketa chowaason ooniknu makotaatawa» iyaat naasin gafki.<verse eid="ACT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Daason Ha'sife Filkisni Oottere Hami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23"/>Esseen orfo ajajefe gaanynyaas Tii meeni gaanynyaasasin heppin teegere: «Waalin keez sa'atiista Qisariya hamni hep tii meya taar'oninnawa, naafunasir faza eelsuni asuninna, dey hep tii ebo fokni asunin hoossutiwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24"/>Phawulosnik fazasikitonon hoossira daason ha'sife Filkisniki nagak kar'anak zagutiwa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25"/>Ekka yifa ticha dey tichire: <verse eid="ACT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26"/>«Qelaudewos Lusiyosnikin arkitto daason ha'sife Filkisno! Naga neek sinfawungwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27"/>Han asusin Ayhudni meya worsone kabawa. Sinuntano bar Roomki daani asu sinbaason arina boor'a meya taar'oni meyaneen ane esta kar'a fu'engwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28"/>Barin awuni chowak malassetemato arunak sholefaat baasso shonggosta tai'sin. <verse eid="ACT 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29"/>Malassetees dey baasso tumaason biifa chowaasik sinbaason aringwa. Sinuntano kituta katuni wedey barin taatoni keer gedni chowatawa. <verse eid="ACT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30"/>Han asusin woruk koppa'sere hooresetemato odenayse geregere neeki gafkingwa. Malatese baasso malatbesiison neeki sina tai'susonek makengwa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31"/>Estan meya taar'oni meya baassok maktenaasimato Phawulosnin waalin ephphe taamme Antiphatirisniki katisete. <verse eid="ACT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32"/>Wonotiri wono faza eelsife asuni meya Phawulosneen ane hamonek zagifaat meya taar'oni meya feesefe dimaaski wolsete. <verse eid="ACT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33"/>Faza eelsife asuni meya dey Qisariya kar'eteyse tichaason daason ha'sife barik imefaat Phawulosnin dey sinba tai'sisete. <verse eid="ACT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34"/>Daason ha'sife bar tichaason feretinanneen orfo Phawulosnin: «Ne! Ayki daani asunso?» yit mamsi. Qilkiyaki daani asu sinbaason arinaayse: <verse eid="ACT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35"/>«Neen malatesefe baasso yeesefaaten chowneeson baassokin dey odonawa» yi. Herodisni masaraassi oodtere foonak ajaje.<verse eid="ACT 23:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawulosnin Ayhudni Meya Malatesete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1"/>Uuch wonaneen orfo maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynya Hananiya isa isa kur'uni meyaneen Tertelus yiste wobisneen ane Qesariya hami. Baasso dey Phawulosni chowaason daason ha'sife Filkisniki hamere malatesete. <verse eid="ACT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2"/>Phawulos teegtere yeefena kabaasik Tertelus ekka yit malatonak kabire: «Ulfinto Filkisno! Neeki kamo akama naga danniwa, Han ne ma'a ha'susik daraaniis foobaas sooltewa. <verse eid="ACT 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3"/>Akamanon ulfinto Filkisno! Han ma'a wostoneeson daa daassinawa aagene aagenena akama galataktu ephpha taafeniwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4"/>Sinuntano haniistan denalo neen hopsunoynaron kawunbaase neek makona baron garamak innotin odotak shiiphefawungwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5"/>Han asus innoosta mangu mero siniwa. Han daa zuuttambaase asiissi fe Ayhudni meeni ganeyaassi naga tishki. Naazirawini meya yistefe baassok zoonsibesiwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6"/>Dey betmeqdesiison kiinuk kabefeen ephniwa. [Tumaniisimato mangsu kar'anik sholera faanir. <verse eid="ACT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7"/>Sinuntano meya taar'oni meyanon ajajefe gaanynya Lusiyus yeere akama hugnak inno kushuussin ephi. <verse eid="ACT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8"/>Barin malatesefe baassotin dey neeki yoosonek ajaje]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Girikni tichaassi aafa </char></note> Ne teetneesik barin tu'nira han inno barin malateni chowaason zuuttira arutak chimatawa.» <verse eid="ACT 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9"/>Ayhudni meya dey: «Han chowaas zuuttera futowa» yiset malataasik isar sinete.<verse eid="ACT 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Filkisni Sinak Malataasi Wolgunon Make</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10"/>Daason ha'sife Filkis Phawulos makonak kushubaason kabgire besi. Phawulos dey ekka yit mako ephi: «Showo neya han daraasata mangsu kar'et faatamato arinar sinna boor'a tayista malate malataasi wolgunon neek makonaas girakwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11"/>Ha'oni shiiphok Yerusalem hamnanneen asire heppe wonaastan aane daytowa sinnamato ne teetneesik arutak chimatawa. <verse eid="ACT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12"/>Betemeqdesiissi sinun Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi wedey katamaassi ooneennu we'nifana wedey daraas naga turkunak zagifana taan aane danoto. <verse eid="ACT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13"/>Hash taan malatesete chowaasik isa zaala neek tai'susonek aafa chimone wuza. <verse eid="ACT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14"/>Sinuntano han baron neek makonak sholefawungwa; baasso eshni ugna yisefe es ugnaasik ta inno abani meeni Ha'oosontu shiiphefawungwa. Museni tumaasi tichche baronnawa raajjuni meyaki kamo makte baronna zuutira amanenarwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15"/>Baasso dey abdi zagsefeysimato ta dey ookoni meenawa ooko sinnoy meena kitun kabsonemato Ha'oosik abdi zagifawungwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16"/>Es bari boor'a ta Ha'oosi sinaknawa asuni sinakna kayma nibna foonak wonna wonna duudefawungwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17"/>Yerusalemun kesnanneen hang showo wogga aatnanneen orfo darataasik sinni argasuni waagnewa Ha'oosik imtoni imaason imanak yaangwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18"/>Betemeqdesiisik dey kayimni sitiriison zagit faanatu danetewa. Es kabaasik taneen ane daraas aafe. Dey nagani tishuus aane kabuwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19"/>Sinuntano Iisiyan yeese Ayhudni meya esta feeseter. Baasso tayista malatosone chowa faafaanane neeki sina tai'sere malatosotowa.<verse eid="ACT 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20"/>«Esseen orfo shonggosi sina tai'fana kabaasik danete mangsu faafaanane maksotowa. <verse eid="ACT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21"/>Baasso ganeyaassi yerefaat: ‹Kituni meeni kitun kabu faarwa unaasiktu hash hawung mangsu tayista katonak nitto sina ta'ingwa› yit tega kaamak chaagga makengwa. Esiistano ooma zagina wuza aafawa.»<verse eid="ACT 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22"/>Sinuntano Filkis Daamiisa ugnanon mai'sire arire feer sinna boor'a: «Meya taar'oni meyanon ajajefe gaanynya Lusiyos yeefena kabaasik nitto chowaason koi'sunawa» iyaat gafki. <verse eid="ACT 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23"/>Phawulosnin oodet fe tii meya taar'osin: «Birmadumma kalnoy mai'sira oodwa; dey koonbaasakito barik sholsi wuza ephphe yeesefe kabaasik kalataatawa» yit ajaje.<verse eid="ACT 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Filkisnawa Dirusillane Asi Sina Ta'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24"/>Garo wonaneen orfo Filkis Ayhudawi sina asuba Dirusillaneen ane ye. Phawulosnin teegsire Kiristoos Yesusnik amanoni chowaason maken ode. <verse eid="ACT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25"/>Phawulos ookoni chowaasonnawa teetni ha'suse asi chowanonna dey yooni mangsuni kar'aasi chowanon makobaase Filkis digere: «Hash hantan hamma; taak ho'itna wononeen wosira teegsunawa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26"/>Filkis Phawulosnikin waaga muunak abdi zagit feer. Es bari boor'a showo wona teegsifaafe wolumsit feer. <verse eid="ACT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27"/>Hep wogganeen orfo Porqiyos Fistos Filkisni kodaasta ha'sunir sinne taatte. Filkis Ayhudni meyanon girsunak sholefaat Phawulosnin kota beyi.<verse eid="ACT 24:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawulosni Chowaas Keesarni Kina Biistonak Mamsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1"/>Fistos ha'sifena awurajjaassi girire keez wona aatinanneen orfo Qisariyan Yerusalem hami. <verse eid="ACT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2"/>Estak Maagni gaanynye meenawa isa isa Ayhudni meyanon zoonsife baassona Phawulosnin malatesete. <verse eid="ACT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3"/>Phawulosnin ugunta oodde worsonek sholsefaat Fistosnik: «Phawulosnin Yerusalem ootire teshshok innok ma'a wuza zaguwa» yit shiiphsete. <verse eid="ACT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4"/>Sinuntano Fistos wolgire: «Phawulos Qisariyak taatoni keer oodtettu fewa; ta dey hash taptera esta hamnarwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5"/>Ese nittotin ha'sife meya taneen ane Qisariya hamotowa; estak Phawulos zagina mangsu faafaanane malatosotowa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6"/>Fistos dey nangirin wedey asir wona sinniron baassoneen ane aatinanneen orfo Qisariya hami. Wonotiri wono mangsuni kar'ni kodaasta diifaat Phawulosnin tai'susonek ajaje. <verse eid="ACT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7"/>Phawulos tai'sefena kabaasik Yerusalemun ye Ayhudni meya ganeya gedde yersefaat showo zaalba foonto faya malata basaasta malatesete. <verse eid="ACT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8"/>Phawulos dey: «Ayhudni tumaasta sinun betemeqdesista wedey Qesarniista isa zagina mangsu aafa» yit malataasi wolgunon wolgi. <verse eid="ACT 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9"/>Fistos Ayhudni meyanon girsuk sholefaat Phawulosnin: «Yerusalem hamfaat han chowaasik mangsu katonak taaki sina ta'atak sholefatoso?» yi. <verse eid="ACT 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10"/>Sinuntano Phawulos wolgire: «Tayista mangsu kar'ak chimni Qeesarni mangsuni kar'ni kodaasi sina yerefawungwa. Ne mai'sira arifataasimato Ayhudni meyaasta isa mangsune aane katutwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11"/>Ese miir'anewa kituta katuni mangsune zagin sinfaanane kitun fui'tona aafa unawuza. Sinuntano baasso malataas shima sinfaanane taan baassok aatire imanak oonu aafa chimanawuza. Chownaas Qeesarni sina biistongwa» yinwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12"/>Es kabaasik Fistos barneen ane merkesefe baassoneen ane merkere: «Yigibanynyi yitanneen Qesarniki hamatawa» yi.<verse eid="ACT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Agriphanawa Berniqena Asi Sina Ta'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13"/>Garo wonaneen orfo taato Agriphanawa Berniqena Fistosnin «Ekku nagak yaata» uuk Qisariya yeesete. <verse eid="ACT 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14"/>Estak showo wona diisete boor'a Fistos Phawulosni chowaason ekka yit taato Agriphanik make: «Filkis taatire kunsina isa asu hantatu fe. <verse eid="ACT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15"/>Ta Yerusalemuk faana kabaasik maagni gaanynyanawa Ayhudni kur'uni meena han asusa chowanon malatesere basaasta mangsu kar'anak taan mamussete. <verse eid="ACT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16"/>Sinuntano ta: ‹Malatte asus malate baasso sina yerere malattena malataasi wolgunon imnoyfeen malate barin aatire ima Roomani meeni dubbiyotawa› yira baassok wolgingwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17"/>Estan malatese baasso hanta zuuttesefe kabaasik ta dey woknoy wonotiri wono mangsuni kar'ni kodaasta diifaat es asusin tai'susonek ajajen. <verse eid="ACT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18"/>Malatese baasso dey teshba yersefaat maksefe kabaasik ta safarenaasne fa mangu wuza isanne basaasta aane maksoto. <verse eid="ACT 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19"/>Sinuntano barneen ane we'nit feesetees baasso teetni haymanotisiknawa Phawulos ‹Hayewwa› yifena kiti Yesusni chowaasiknawa. <verse eid="ACT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20"/>Ta dey han effatena chowaason tu'nu taan rakkisina boor'a: Phawulosnin: ‹Yerusalem hamfaan estak han chowaasik mangsu neyista kar'anak sholefatoso?› yin. <verse eid="ACT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21"/>Sinuntano Phawulos chowbaas Qesarnikik biistonak sholefaat: ‹Yigibanynyi› ubaasik esta gafkunanneen taatere foonak ajajen.» <verse eid="ACT 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22"/>Agripha Fistosnin: «Ta han asus makefeen odonak sholefawungwa» yi. Fistos dey: «Wono makefeen odotawa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23"/>Estan wonotiri wono Agriphanawa Berniqena akama ulfinak meya taar'oni meeni gaanynyasakitoniknawa katamaassi fe arto meyakna geeptere yeesere mangsuni kar'ni addarashisi girsete. Esseen orfo Fistos Phawulosnin teegsi. <verse eid="ACT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24"/>Fistos dey: «Taato Agriphano! Nitto innoneen ane fe asuni meya zuuttere! ‹Han asus hanneen ekalok kaak foonak aane sholsifa› yit chaaget Yerusalemuknawa han Qisariyak feese Ayhudni meya basaasta mangsu kar'anak taan mamussete asus hanifewa. <verse eid="ACT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25"/>Sinuntano ta barin kituta katuni mangsu aane danut. Bar dey: ‹Chownaas Qeeasrnik biistongwa› yina boor'a esta wosunak hooren. <verse eid="ACT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26"/>Sinuntano basa chowaasik Daamtaasik tichuna amma wuza aafawa. Estan tu'nira biininneen orfo tichuna wuza dananatto iyaat nitto sina arkiron dey taato Agriphano! Neeki sina tai'singwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27"/>Isa taato denalo fe taatoski wostere hamfena kabaasik malattena malataasi chowanon amma zagu beya ma'ar sinna taak aane bestowawa.»<verse eid="ACT 25:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Agriphani Sinak Zagina Wolla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1"/>Agripha dey Phawulosnin: «Chowneeson makotak chimatawa» yi. Phawulos kushubaason kabgire malatena malataasi wolgunon make. <verse eid="ACT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2"/>«Taato Agriphano! Ayhudni meya taan malatesete malata zuuttambaase asik wolgubaason hash hawung neeki sina imfana kabaasik ta ta teetaasik akamanontu girengwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3"/>Esiis dey ne Ayhudni meeni sitirisewa karakkaroose asin mai'sira aritarwa. Es bari boor'a fakiyak taan odotak shiiphefawungwa.<verse eid="ACT 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4"/>«Garonaaseneen aakkak faanamato Ayhudni meya zuuttere arseterwa. Tesustan kabgira darataasa ganesinawa Yerusalemukna faana foonaason arseterwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5"/>Ta chowaasik zaala maksonek ma'i yisefaatene haymanotiniison akamanon zaggire oodefe Ferisawini meeni keen sinna faanamato tesustaneen kabire arseterwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6"/>Sinuntano hash mangsu tayista katonak hanta yerenaas Ha'oos abaniisakitonik imna teyyani kaamaasik abdi zagifana boor'awa. <verse eid="ACT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7"/>Es abdiista kar'onek asire heppe inno asteseriis Ha'ooson toone waalinne chimme shiiphok oodedifer. Taatono! Taan Ayhudni meya malatesetees es abdiisikwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8"/>Ha'oos kituni meyanon kitun kabgunir sinbaas awuni boor'a nittoki amantoba foonto chowa sinniso?<verse eid="ACT 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9"/>«Ta dey ta teetaasik Naaziretki Yesusni sunaason chimnaasne faaron tugga'ok sholsu sinnamato safaret faanar. <verse eid="ACT 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10"/>Yerusalemuk zaginaas esiisongwa. Maagni gaanynye meyakin ephna ha'suni hugnaasik amanynyini meyaassin showonin taatoni keer taatin. Baassotin worsefe kabaasik baassoneen ane isar sinin. <verse eid="ACT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11"/>Showo wona Ayhudni shiiphoni keya keyaasi hamfaafa ke'o ephphetoosoneknawa Daamiisata mei'ni kaama maksonekna kabet faanar. Baassosta akamanon haarera ooma geroni katamaassinu hamfaafa kabgit faanar.<verse eid="ACT 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Kiristoosniki Aakkak Wolinamato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12"/>«Han chowaasik maagni gaanynye meyakin ha'suni hugnanewa ajajine ephpha Demasko hamdifanar. <verse eid="ACT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13"/>Taatono! Ugunaasta faana toosta awaasi chaarefatan denalo sina chaarefa biin. Es chaarefaas biratonaastanawa taneen ane hamet feese baasso biratoostana saman chaare. <verse eid="ACT 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14"/>Zuuttamniise daasta gandera kunfeni Ayhudni meeni noonok: ‹Sawulno! Sawulno! Awuniron taan kabgidifa? kamo bittaasta yer'ana iyaatane teetnesontu miir'otawa› yifa kaamaason oden. <verse eid="ACT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15"/>Ta dey: ‹Daamiiso! Ne oonso?› yin. Bar dey: ‹Ta; ne kabgifata Yesuswa; <verse eid="ACT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16"/>Sinuntano hash kabira wochoneesik yerowa. Ta; neek bestenaas biita ta wuzasiknawa hanneen dey neek besunak fa wuzaasikna wostinynyata sinna zaala taak makotaktu neen taatsingwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17"/>Israelni daraasa kushusinnawa neen wosuna Aazabni meeni daraasa kushusinna neen oodana. <verse eid="ACT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18"/>Aafbesiison gachataknawa talmaassin chaarefaasta kisutakna dey Sexanaasi ha'suni sikalosin Ha'ooski wolgutakna neen zagunawa. Baasso dey boor'besiisi fakiyanon danone. Taak amanobesiisik dey korto sina baassoneen risti danone.›<verse eid="ACT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Wostobaas Awu Sinnamato Make</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19"/>«Taato Agriphano! Saman taak beste raa'isik aane ajajamo beyutwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20"/>Sinuntano zeemma Demaskok feese asuni meyak estan dey Yerusalemuknawa Yuudani daa zuuttambaase asiissi fe baassokna esiisimato dey Aazabni meya harmusonek maken. Harmusobesiison besifa wosto wostosonek awasingwa <verse eid="ACT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21"/>Es bari boor'a Ayhudni meya betemeqdesiisik taan ephphe woruk kabsete. <verse eid="ACT 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22"/>Hash hawungneen kar'a Ha'oosi argasu tayistan aane tishuwa. Es bari boor'a garosiknawa gaymasikna han futooson maket hanta yerefawungwa. Raajjuni meenawa Musena zeemme ekka sinana yisere maksete baron makenastano ooma isa wuzane aane makotwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23"/>Baasso dey: ‹Kiristoos shanaason ephphetoona; kitun kabuusik dey tesunir sinne chaarefaason Israelni daraasiknawa Aazabni meyakna ammanon besuna› yiseretu maksetewa.» <verse eid="ACT 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24"/>Phawulos es baron makefeen Fistos: «Phawulosno! Nifasetwa. Akamanon arunees nifaso sinatak neen zagiwa» yit chaagge make. <verse eid="ACT 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25"/>Sinuntano Phawulos: «Akamanon ulfinto Fistosno! Futosewa futo sina barontu makentano aane nifasotwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26"/>Basa sina ammanon makena taatoos han baron arifewa. Es bar dey aachonor sina beyna boor'a taatoos arunamato arifawungwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27"/>Taato Agriphano! Raajjuni meyanon amanees tatanoso? Ne dey amanefatamato arifawungwa» <verse eid="ACT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28"/>Agripha dey Phawulosnin: «Han garo kabisasi taan kiristana zagutak sholedifatarwa bi» yi. <verse eid="ACT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29"/>Phawulos dey: «Garo kabaasik sinun akama kabak ne ne sinnoytaron hash hawung ta wollaason ode baasso zuuttere han taatonaastano tane feer sinonek Ha'ooson shiiphefawungwa» yi. <verse eid="ACT 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30"/>Esseen orfo taato Agripha; daason ha'sife barnawa Berniqenonna dey baassoneen ane diise asuni meya zuuttesere kabsete. <verse eid="ACT 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31"/>Estan kesere hamefet baassotna baassotna: «Han asusin kituta wedey taatok katuni isa wuzane aane zaguwewa» yit wolumsete. <verse eid="ACT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32"/>Agripha dey Fistosnin: «Han asus: Qesarniki yigibanynyi uu shaki sinfaanane baak kotana kabawa» yi.<verse eid="ACT 26:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Room Hami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1"/>Merkebik Ixaliya hamanik wonaas katobaase Phawulosnawa oom taatoni meena; taatoosa taatoni meya taar'osakitonisin isa Yuliyos yiste tii meeni gaanynyaasik taamme imete. <verse eid="ACT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2"/>Iisiyani baarisi ha'ta faase wodebiiski hamfa Adiramixiyonni merkebiissi diira hamni. Teselonqek feefe Meqedoniyani daani asu sina Aristirokos dey innoneen ane feer.<verse eid="ACT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3"/>Wonotiri wono Sidona hamma kar'ni, Yuliyos Phawulosnik kenashtefaat Phawulos hamme zomobaaskin barik sholsi argasu ephphe yoonak fiqadi imi. <verse eid="ACT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4"/>Estan kabira sirus ek sinniistak sirit faar sinna boor'a baarisi ganesi kuni daa kophirosnon teetera hamni. <verse eid="ACT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5"/>Qilqiyanewa Pinifiliyane asi tesha fa baariison finninneen orfo Liqiyak fa Mura yistefa katamasi kar'ni. <verse eid="ACT 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6"/>Estak tii meeni gaanynyaas Ixaliya hama Iskindiriyani merkebi danne barissi duunik zagi. <verse eid="ACT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7"/>Showo wona nibi nibi kutira akama rakkok Qenidos yistefa katamasi kar'ni. Sirus ek sina hamnoynimato kalna boor'a Silmonani tesha kamo aatta baarisi ganesi kuni daa Qerxesnon teetera hamni. <verse eid="ACT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8"/>Akama rakkok teshba teshbaase aatninneen orfo Lasiya yistefa katamaassi tesha fa «Ma'a wodebi» yistefa dimaasta kar'ni.<verse eid="ACT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9"/>Kutifeni kutuniis faya sinna boor'anawa soomoni wonaas aatna boor'ana es kabaasik merkebik kutuus adaga sinna boor'a Phawulos asuni meyak ekka yi: <verse eid="ACT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10"/>«Asuni meyane! Hanneen ekaloki fa kutuniis akama adaga faar sinnatu taak bestedifawa. Feche ba'astanawa merkebiistana koi'ba sinnoynaron asuni kaatanu akama adaganewa tishune kar'nirwa» <verse eid="ACT 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11"/>Sinuntano tii meeni gaanynyaas Phawulos makena baristan merkebiissi fe asusin ajajefe barinnawa merkebiisi abaninnatu odedifer. <verse eid="ACT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12"/>Es wodebiista yeeshuuson aatuk mangu sinbaasik yeesho esta yerok aane mai'fa sinna boor'a showo asuni meya: «Hama chimtefaanane kawudan awugirukinawa yeeshdaani awugirukina fa Feenqe yistefa Qerxesni wedebiski kar'ere yeeshuuson aatuni» yisere maksete.<verse eid="ACT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Baariistak Akani Guubo Kabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13"/>Garo kawudani sirus sirifeen biyeteyse baasso safareteesne faar sinna baassok bestefaan merkebiis yeronak zagifa baron kabugsere hamak kabsete. Wedebiistan kabsere Qerxes kamo teshba teshbaase aatte hamete. <verse eid="ACT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14"/>Sinuntano woknoyfeen «Yeeshdaani awukesaki ipuwa» yiste hugnaba faana ipuwa baarisi ganeyasi kuni daastan kabira baariiski ya. <verse eid="ACT 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15"/>Merkebiis ipuwaasik tugtera ipuwaason tugire hamak aane chima sinna boor'a shaakkira ipuwaasik tugtet hamni. <verse eid="ACT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16"/>«Qeda» yiste baarisi ganesi kuni daason teetera hamfeni kabaasik akama rakkok merkebiisi goonunon mai'sira zatta merkebiison fu'ok chimni. <verse eid="ACT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17"/>Merkebiissi diise baasso goonuuson hang merkebiski zatte kissetenneen orfo merkebiisi biratonon gaaduk taar'esete. Merkebiis: «Surtiis» yiste fuutuni daasta gandonoytemato digsefaat sharaason kessisefaaten sirus merkebiison kalin hamete. <verse eid="ACT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18"/>Ipuwaas akamanon innoosta chimet hamna boor'a wonotiri wono merkebiista feche ba'aason kessisere baariissi ha'u ephesete. <verse eid="ACT 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19"/>Keezsinari wono merkebisiki ke'ni kodaason kushubesiisik kissere ha'sete. <verse eid="ACT 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20"/>Showo wona awa wedey baakura aane biistowa sinbaasik sirus innoosta chimet hamna boor'a: «Hanneen ekalok aafawa fui'toni wuza» yit abdi buggini. <verse eid="ACT 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21"/>Asuni meya dey isa muune muunoy showo wona diisete. Es bari boor'a Phawulos baasso ganeyasi yerefaat ekka yi: «Asuni meyane! Ta makena baron odera Qerxesun kabu beyeti sinfaanane han adagasewa tishuuse nittoosta kar'ana kabatawa. <verse eid="ACT 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22"/>Hashnu han merkebiis bar bartu miir'amonittano nittoossin oonu tishunir aafewa. Es bari boor'a ‹Harewa digotiitawa› yit nittotin chinifawungwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23"/>Aata waalaasik barir sina ta shiiphefana Ha'oos wosina wosibaas teshna yerefaat: <verse eid="ACT 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24"/>‹Phawulosno! Digotaatawa; Qeesarni sina yerotak sholsuwa. Neneen ane hamfe baassotin dey zuutira Ha'oos neekwa iyaat kitun fu'onirwa› yit taak makewa. <verse eid="ACT 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25"/>Es bari boor'a asuni meyane! Digotiitawa! Taak makena baron zuuttambaase asin zagunamato Ha'oosik amanefawungwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26"/>Sinfanaknu sirus isa Baarini ganesi kuni daasi ha'ta taamma innotin ha'una.»<verse eid="ACT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27"/>Asire acheechche sinnari wono waalin Adiriyan yiste baarisi ganeyata siruusik ekna hangna tugtet hamfeni wassi daani kixxestak merkebiistaki wostinynyani meya golo daasta kar'etene faar sinna baassok beste. <verse eid="ACT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28"/>Es bari boor'a baarisi tir'manon hoossire biini gaaduuson baarisi ha'seten acheechasir meetiri sini. Garonon feesere hepsa dey hoossire biyak gaaduuson ha'seten keezasir meetiri sini. <verse eid="ACT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29"/>Merkebiis baarisi ha'ta fa shu'aasneen heephtonoynamato digsefaat merkebiisi orfota merkebiison yeetuni wuza acheechon baariissi kessisete. Estan waalaas wonanak shiiphsete. <verse eid="ACT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30"/>Merkebiissiki wostinynyani meya sirun kesak sholsete boor'a merkebiison yeetuni wuzason ek sinaasta ha'unirne feer sinere goonuuson baariissi ha'sete. <verse eid="ACT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31"/>Es kabaasik Phawulos tii meeni gaanynyaasinnawa taar'oni meyanonna: «Han Merkebiissi feese baasso merkebiissi shaakkisere du shakisefaatene nitto fui'tok aafa chimati wuza» yi. <verse eid="ACT 27:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32"/>Estan taar'oni meya goonuuson epha gaaduuson kar'eten goonuus akaasta kunna hamanak gafuksete. <verse eid="ACT 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33"/>Waalaas wonanakfana kabaasik Phawulos zuuttambesiise muu muusonek shiiphe. Ekka dey yi: «Isa wuzane muunoy afurnitise asire acheechche wona kar'tiwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34"/>Es bari boor'a muu muutik shiiphefawungwa. Es bar dey kaak footik nittotin chinunawa isa miir'anu nittoosta aafa kar'anawuza» yi. <verse eid="ACT 27:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35"/>Es baron yinanneen orfo tusha ephphe zuuttambesiise asi sina Ha'o galattefaat batte muu ephi. <verse eid="ACT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36"/>Es kabaasik zuuttambesiise chima danere muu ephphe meesete. <verse eid="ACT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37"/>Merkebiissi fe inno zuuttamniise hep tiirewa naafunasire issune asu. <verse eid="ACT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38"/>Zuuttambesiise meesere gawusetenneen orfo markabista feche zagooson baariissi ha'uk merkebiisi ba'a kashonak zagsete.<verse eid="ACT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Markabiisi Mesto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39"/>Wonfana kabaasik hamme kar'ete dimaason aane arsoto. Sinuntano fuutuusi teshta fa baarisi tugo daa biyete. Chimtefaanane merkebiison tugire esta katuk sholsete. <verse eid="ACT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40"/>Merkebiison yeetifa gaaduuson kotere baariissi gafuksete. Es kabaasik merkebiison kalfa bari gaaduuson kotete. Hangkaloki fa sharaason siruski den teggire baarisi ha'ta kamo aatte kesak hamete. <verse eid="ACT 27:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41"/>Sinuntano merkebiis tuultera di fuutuusta heephtena boor'a yeet tukna sheligte. Merkebiis sinbaasik fuutuussi kejja diina boor'a shorko beyi. Sinuntano orfobaas ipuwaasi tugutan kabi chowa mestet faar.<verse eid="ACT 27:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42"/>Taatoni meyaassin isarnu akaassi ichere kesse tishunoynamato taar'oni meya woruk sholsete. <verse eid="ACT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43"/>Sinuntano tii meeni gaanynyaas Phawulosnin fu'onak sholena boor'a baasso safaraason aane ephphetowe. Es baristan akani ichche fina chimefe baasso merkebiissin kesere baarisi fillefaafe zeemme daasta kessonek ajaje. <verse eid="ACT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44"/>Fu'te baasso dey merkebiisi zoodanonnawa merkebiisi mestoni kattosi kamona kesonek ajaje. Ekkak zuuttambesiise ma'arik daasta kar'ete.<verse eid="ACT 27:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Malta Yiste Baarisi Ganesi Kuni Daasta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1"/>Ma'arik daasta kar'ninneen orfo es baarisi ganesi kuni daas Malta yistefanamato arini. <verse eid="ACT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2"/>Es daasta fe asuni meya akama diinqi ma'a innok zagsete. Es kabaasik iro ichin koochedifar sinna boor'a geya sookere zuuttamniise besunik zagsete. <verse eid="ACT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3"/>Sinuntano Phawulos waa'a zuutire geyaassi ha'ifeen geyaasi gumutan kabi chowa ufo kessa kushubaason saar'a here'tera yere. <verse eid="ACT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4"/>Es daasta fe asuni meya Phawulosni kushuusta ufoos here'tera yerefeen biyeteyse baassotna baassotna wol: «Han asus futok kaa woraat ye asuwa! Baariistaki akani guubosin nagak kesfenaknu ooko Ha'oosi ke'osin aatte kaak foonak aane chimewa» yisete. <verse eid="ACT 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5"/>Sinuntano Phawulos ufooson geyaassi tebire ha'i. Ufoosi saar'a barin isanne aane miir'owa. <verse eid="ACT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6"/>Asuni meya dey: «Hashtu atubaas wolsuna wedey geregere kitire gandona» yiset oodeset feeseter. Sinuntano akama sa'ati oodesefeknu basaasta isa miir'a aane kar'a sinnamato biyeteyse safarabesiison soolesere: «Han bar ha'owa» yisete. <verse eid="ACT 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7"/>Es faani dimaas tesha baarisi ganesi kuni daasi ha'sinynya Puppeliyosni daa faar. Es asus innotin barki keer ephphe keez wona ma'arik irbasi. <verse eid="ACT 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8"/>Puppeliyosni aba gumtannewa keenni ichne meraan kunfer. Phawulos es asuski keer girire kushubaason ta'ire shiiphen fari. <verse eid="ACT 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9"/>Es bar sinnanneen orfo baarisi ganesi kuni daasta feesefe oom mettanni meya yeesere farisete. <verse eid="ACT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10"/>Showo ima dey innok ephphe yeesete. Ulfinsubesiison dey innok bessete. Estan kabfeni kabaasik ugunniisik sholsi wuzason merkebiissi kunussete.<verse eid="ACT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Maltan Room Hami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11"/>Keez assa diininneen orfo es yeeshuuson baarisi ganesi kuni daasta neetta Iskindiriyani merkebiissi diira hamni. Es merkebiista Diyosqoros yiste mano ha'oni gito barista faar. <verse eid="ACT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12"/>Serakuski katamasi kar'a keez wona esta diini. <verse eid="ACT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13"/>Estan baariison biratera hamma Regiyun katama kar'ni. Estak isa wona aatininneen orfo kawudani sirus sirina boor'a hepsinari wono Putiyolus hamni. <verse eid="ACT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14"/>Estak ayni meyanon danna baassoneen ane naafun wona duunik innotin shiiphsete. Esseen orfo Room hamni. <verse eid="ACT 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15"/>Roomuk feese ayni meya inno yooson odeseteyse hamma Afiyusni gabaastanawa Keez ha'uni dimaastana kar'ere innotin ephak yeesete. Phawulos baassotin biinayse Ha'ooson galattere nibaas chima dani.<verse eid="ACT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawulos Roomuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16"/>Room girifeni kabaasik Phawulosnin oodni taar'o imten bar bar foonak fiqadi imte.<verse eid="ACT 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17"/>Keez wonaneen orfo Phawulos esta feese Ayhudni meeni gayma meyanon barki teegsi. Baasso zuuttesefe kabaasik ekka yi: «Aytaasakitono! Ta Israelni daraasatanawa abani meeni tumaastana zagina mangsu isa wuzane aafawa. Sinuntano Yerusalemuk taatera Romanni meeni kushuussi aattera imtengwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18"/>Roomni meya taan tu'nisetenneen orfo kituta katuni mangsu aane danoto sinna boor'a baak kottonek safarsete. <verse eid="ACT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19"/>Sinuntano Ayhudni meya baak kotnaason tugga'obesiise Qesarnik: ‹Yigibanynyi› unak giddi siniwa. Sinfanaknu darataasin malatonaktawa. <verse eid="ACT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20"/>Hashnu nittotin teegsinaas nittotin biyanaknawa han baron dey nittok makonaknawa. Ta han shashsharaasik taatenaas Israelni meyak imte abdiisikwa.»<verse eid="ACT 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21"/>Baasso dey ekka yit wollugsete: «Yuudani daastan ne chowaasik tichche ticha aane innok kar'awa. Hanta yeese baassossin oonu ne chowaasik mangu wuza woller aafewa. <verse eid="ACT 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22"/>Sinuntano han ne faata haymanotiison daadaassi asuni meya tugga'sefemato arifeniwa. Es bari boor'a ne safaraas awu sinnamato neekin odonik sholefeniwa.»<verse eid="ACT 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23"/>Wona duusisere showo asu sinere barki keer yeesete. Bar dey e'son kabira hamma waalin kar'ana kabaneen Ha'oosi taatoni chowanon make. Baassotin amansuk Museni tumaassinnawa raajjuni meeni matsafasinna kisire Yesusni chowaason ammanon baassok make. <verse eid="ACT 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24"/>Isa isa asuni meya makena kaamaason amanesete. Sinuntano oomiis aane amanosoto. <verse eid="ACT 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25"/>Baasso dey baassotna baassotna aane isa niba sinoto. Sinfanaknu oor oor kesonoy feeseten Phawulos koi'baasta ekka yi: «Korto Ayyanaas raajju Isayyasniki kamo nitto abani meyak makena bar futowa.<verse eid="ACT 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26"/>« ‹Ek daraaski hamfaat;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">odoson odesetir, sinuntano aane yaadatesefeti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">biyason biitir, sinuntano gazgira aane biifeti;;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">nibnitiissi dey aane kunsifeti.<verse eid="ACT 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27"/>Han daraasa niba muumiwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">odobesiis dey oyewa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">aafbesiis dey simewa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">ekka sina shaki sinfaanane aafbesiisik biyere;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">odobesiisik odere;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">nibbesiissik yaadatesere taaki wolseten;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">ta dey baassotin fatuna kabawa› yi.<verse eid="ACT 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28"/>«Ese han Ha'oosi fatuni wosiya Aazabni meyak wostenamato arutiwa. Baasso dey ma'i yisere ephphetoosone» <verse eid="ACT 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29"/>[Phawulos es baron makobaase Ayhudni meya baassotna baassotna akamanon we'niset kesse hamete]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«Isa isa Girikni birannani tichaassi faadba hepasire izgineeson aane daysifa»</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 28:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30"/>Phawulos kira ephna keyaassi hep wogga di. Barki keer yeesefe asuni meyanon zuutire keebaassi ephet feer. <verse eid="ACT 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31"/>Oonu barin kalnoynaron Ha'oosi taatonon maket Daam Yesus Kiristoosni chowaason diga foontonon assit feer.<verse eid="ACT 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28"/>
</usx>
